Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.27,0:00:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,任务报告
Dialogue: 2,0:00:43.27,0:00:44.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,Mission Report.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.57,0:00:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,K599俄联邦潜艇 塞瓦斯托波尔号
Dialogue: 2,0:00:44.57,0:00:49.52,Eng,,0,0,0,,Russian Federation submarine K599 Sevastopol.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.07,0:00:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,行动代号:马蹄铁
Dialogue: 2,0:00:50.07,0:00:51.94,Eng,,0,0,0,,Operation: Podkova.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.99,0:00:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,第74天
Dialogue: 2,0:00:51.99,0:00:53.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,Day 74.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.83,0:00:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在测试的自主学习防御系统
Dialogue: 2,0:00:55.83,0:00:58.62,Eng,,0,0,0,,The active learning defense system we are testing…
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.37,0:01:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,依然毫无瑕疵地运行着
Dialogue: 2,0:00:59.37,0:01:01.45,Eng,,0,0,0,,…continues to operate flawlessly.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.96,0:01:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至可以说是
Dialogue: 2,0:01:01.96,0:01:03.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,One might even say…
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.50,0:01:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,奇迹般地运行着
Dialogue: 2,0:01:03.50,0:01:04.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,…miraculously.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.91,0:01:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在通过航位推测法 在北极冰层下航行
Dialogue: 2,0:01:04.91,0:01:09.42,Eng,,0,0,0,,We are navigating under the Arctic ice cap by dead reckoning
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.42,0:01:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,并且再有五天就到家了
Dialogue: 2,0:01:09.42,0:01:11.00,Eng,,0,0,0,,and five days from home.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.59,0:01:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,在两万五千海里的航行过程中
Dialogue: 2,0:01:11.59,0:01:14.13,Eng,,0,0,0,,After 25,000 nautical miles,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.13,0:01:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,塞瓦斯托波尔号刻意接近了 世界各国的海军力量
Dialogue: 2,0:01:14.13,0:01:18.85,Eng,,0,0,0,,the Sevastopol has deliberately approached every navy in the world
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.85,0:01:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,并且成功地避开了所有侦查
Dialogue: 2,0:01:18.85,0:01:21.85,Eng,,0,0,0,,and remained completely undetected.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.68,0:01:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,马蹄铁的反声波隐形能力 已经超出了所有人的预期
Dialogue: 2,0:01:23.68,0:01:28.69,Eng,,0,0,0,,The Podkova's stealth capability has exceeded all expectations.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.36,0:01:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,此刻我们手里掌握着这世上最尖端的
Dialogue: 2,0:01:34.36,0:01:38.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,We are at this moment the state of the art
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.91,0:01:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,战争科技
Dialogue: 2,0:01:38.91,0:01:40.33,Eng,,0,0,0,,of war.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.41,0:01:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这是人类有史以来
Dialogue: 2,0:01:44.41,0:01:46.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,The most fearsome killing machine
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.75,0:01:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,最可怕的杀人机器
Dialogue: 2,0:01:46.75,0:01:49.04,Eng,,0,0,0,,ever devised by man.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.09,0:01:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,想找到我们就好比大海捞针
Dialogue: 2,0:01:51.09,0:01:54.80,Eng,,0,0,0,,And we are impossible to find.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.72,0:02:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 发现目标 代号S83
Dialogue: 2,0:01:57.72,0:02:00.76,Eng,,0,0,0,,Captain, we have a submerged contact, designated Semyon-83,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.76,0:02:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是一艘美国弗吉尼亚级核潜艇
Dialogue: 2,0:02:00.76,0:02:03.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,exhibiting tonals of a US Virginia-class submarine.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.56,0:02:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,方位130°正朝我们逼近
Dialogue: 2,0:02:03.56,0:02:06.02,Eng,,0,0,0,,Bearing 130°, drawing forward.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.19,0:02:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,值班长注意 准备进入战斗状态
Dialogue: 2,0:02:07.19,0:02:09.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,Chief of the Watch, man battle stations silently.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.73,0:02:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,值更军官 汇报潜艇情况
Dialogue: 2,0:02:09.73,0:02:11.65,Eng,,0,0,0,,Officer of the Deck, ship status?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.65,0:02:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,船深50米 距离海底72米
Dialogue: 2,0:02:11.65,0:02:14.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ship's depth, 50 meters. Bottom, 72 meters.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.19,0:02:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,距离海面冰冠21米
Dialogue: 2,0:02:14.19,0:02:16.49,Eng,,0,0,0,,Clearance to the ice canopy, 21 meters.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.49,0:02:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-距深海还有多远 -2公里
Dialogue: 2,0:02:16.49,0:02:18.57,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Distance to deep water? -Two kilometers.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.57,0:02:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,六分钟后抵达阿留申海底断崖
Dialogue: 2,0:02:18.57,0:02:20.37,Eng,,0,0,0,,Aleutian Precipice in six minutes.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.37,0:02:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,机动调整航向 舵手 左转舵15度
Dialogue: 2,0:02:20.37,0:02:22.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ranging maneuver. Helm, left 15 degrees rudder.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.83,0:02:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,保持航向100°
Dialogue: 2,0:02:22.83,0:02:24.62,Eng,,0,0,0,,Steady course 100°.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.62,0:02:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,以标准速度匀速上升
Dialogue: 2,0:02:24.62,0:02:26.25,Eng,,0,0,0,,Come up easy on a standard bell.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.25,0:02:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-指挥权移交舰长 -收到指令
Dialogue: 2,0:02:26.25,0:02:28.08,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Captain has the conn. -Helm, aye!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.08,0:02:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,方位角调整到100°
Dialogue: 2,0:02:28.08,0:02:30.25,Eng,,0,0,0,,Coming to course 100°.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.93,0:02:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,稳定航向 100°
Dialogue: 2,0:02:43.93,0:02:45.77,Eng,,0,0,0,,Steady on course 100°.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.77,0:02:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,武器官 射程
Dialogue: 2,0:02:45.77,0:02:47.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,Weapons Officer, range?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.23,0:02:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,正在锁定目标 射击瞄准距离一万五千米
Dialogue: 2,0:02:47.23,0:02:51.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,Firing solution is tracking at a distance of 15,000 meters.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.31,0:02:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 这个距离说不通 声呐信号怎么会这么清晰
Dialogue: 2,0:02:51.31,0:02:54.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,Sir, that doesn't make sense. Tonals this loud and clear?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.48,0:02:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,目标一定在更近的位置
Dialogue: 2,0:02:54.48,0:02:56.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,He must be closer than that.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.74,0:03:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 射击瞄准距离突然缩短 变成一万米了
Dialogue: 2,0:02:57.74,0:03:01.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,Captain, firing solution just did a step change to 10,000 meters.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.45,0:03:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,没有潜艇会这么快
Dialogue: 2,0:03:02.45,0:03:03.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing moves that fast.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.78,0:03:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,所有数据匹配 这是真实距离
Dialogue: 2,0:03:03.78,0:03:06.29,Eng,,0,0,0,,All solutions are matching. The range is true.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.29,0:03:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,舵手 右满舵 转向270°
Dialogue: 2,0:03:06.29,0:03:08.54,Eng,,0,0,0,,Helm, right full rudder to course 270°.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.54,0:03:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,右满舵270° 收到
Dialogue: 2,0:03:08.54,0:03:10.46,Eng,,0,0,0,,Course 270°, aye.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.09,0:03:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们避开目标 直接去深水区
Dialogue: 2,0:03:14.09,0:03:16.21,Eng,,0,0,0,,We'll just walk away and head for deep water.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.21,0:03:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,目标转向160°
Dialogue: 2,0:03:16.21,0:03:18.92,Eng,,0,0,0,,Contact bearing 160°.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.92,0:03:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,对方瞬间完成了变向
Dialogue: 2,0:03:18.92,0:03:20.80,Eng,,0,0,0,,Bearing rate zero?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.80,0:03:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,目标在那儿 又和我们一起转向了
Dialogue: 2,0:03:20.80,0:03:23.22,Eng,,0,0,0,,He's there, turning with us again.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.43,0:03:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,它能看到我们
Dialogue: 2,0:03:24.43,0:03:26.18,Eng,,0,0,0,,He can see us.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.18,0:03:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这不可能 我们是隐形的
Dialogue: 2,0:03:26.18,0:03:28.18,Eng,,0,0,0,,Impossible. We're invisible.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.18,0:03:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,武器官 诊断声呐和作战系统程序 一定出问题了
Dialogue: 2,0:03:28.18,0:03:32.44,Eng,,0,0,0,,Weapons, run diagnostics on sonar and fire control. Something isn't right.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.44,0:03:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 目标的鱼雷管道开始蓄水了
Dialogue: 2,0:03:32.44,0:03:34.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,Sir, he's flooding his torpedo tubes!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.15,0:03:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,鱼雷舱 这里是控制室 填装所有发射管道
Dialogue: 2,0:03:35.15,0:03:37.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,Torpedo room, conn. Load all torpedo tubes.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.19,0:03:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官
Dialogue: 2,0:03:37.19,0:03:38.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.20,0:03:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-仔细检查 -船前完毕
Dialogue: 2,0:03:41.20,0:03:43.57,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Check clear! -Forward clear!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.57,0:03:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-船尾完毕 可以填装 -开始填装
Dialogue: 2,0:03:43.57,0:03:46.16,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Aft clear! Ram torpedo! -Ramming!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.04,0:03:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,所有鱼雷填装完毕
Dialogue: 2,0:03:48.04,0:03:49.45,Eng,,0,0,0,,Torpedo tubes loaded.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.45,0:03:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,目标已开启外侧舱门
Dialogue: 2,0:03:49.45,0:03:50.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,He's opened outer doors!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.87,0:03:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,武器官 一到四号管道蓄水 打开外侧舱门
Dialogue: 2,0:03:50.87,0:03:53.12,Eng,,0,0,0,,Weapons, flood tubes one through four and open outer doors.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.12,0:03:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,二号管道输入发射参数
Dialogue: 2,0:03:53.12,0:03:55.08,Eng,,0,0,0,,Enter firing solution into tube two.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.08,0:03:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是 舰长 二号管道准备随时发射
Dialogue: 2,0:03:55.08,0:03:57.88,Eng,,0,0,0,,Aye, Captain. Making tube two ready in all respects.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.88,0:03:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 目标在挑衅我们
Dialogue: 2,0:03:57.88,0:03:59.26,Eng,,0,0,0,,Captain, he's provoking us.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.26,0:04:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他在找借口把我们炸出水面
Dialogue: 2,0:03:59.26,0:04:01.76,Eng,,0,0,0,,He wants an excuse to blow us out of the water.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.76,0:04:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,发现敌方鱼雷 方位角200° 距离一千米 还在加速
Dialogue: 2,0:04:01.76,0:04:05.26,Eng,,0,0,0,,Enemy torpedo in the water, bearing 200°. 1,000 meters and accelerating.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:05.26,0:04:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,舵手 左满舵 别管一切 全速前进
Dialogue: 2,0:04:05.26,0:04:07.76,Eng,,0,0,0,,Helm, left full rudder, all ahead flank cavitate.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.76,0:04:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,收到 左满舵 已开启全速前进模式
Dialogue: 2,0:04:07.76,0:04:10.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,My rudder is left full. Answering all ahead flank cavitate.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.35,0:04:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-启动反打击措施 -反打击措施启动
Dialogue: 2,0:04:10.35,0:04:12.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Launch countermeasures. -Launching countermeasures.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.98,0:04:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-发射二号管道 -二号管道发射
Dialogue: 2,0:04:15.98,0:04:18.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Fire tube two. -Firing tube two.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.53,0:04:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,鱼雷已发射 高速运行中
Dialogue: 2,0:04:21.53,0:04:23.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,Our torpedo is away. Running hot.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.20,0:04:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,敌方鱼雷还在逼近 距离我们800米
Dialogue: 2,0:04:26.20,0:04:28.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,Enemy torpedo still homing, range 800 meters.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.99,0:04:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他绕开了我们的反打击措施
Dialogue: 2,0:04:28.99,0:04:30.29,Eng,,0,0,0,,He's blown through our countermeasures.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.29,0:04:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-舵手 右满舵 -收到 长官 右满舵
Dialogue: 2,0:04:30.29,0:04:32.66,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Helm, right full rudder. -Right full. Aye, sir!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.66,0:04:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,还有600米
Dialogue: 2,0:04:32.66,0:04:33.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,600 meters.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.67,0:04:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,下潜官待命 准备清空所有紧急压载舱
Dialogue: 2,0:04:33.67,0:04:36.21,Eng,,0,0,0,,Diving Officer, stand by to emergency blow all main ballast tanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.21,0:04:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,还有400米
Dialogue: 2,0:04:36.21,0:04:37.17,Eng,,0,0,0,,400 meters.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.17,0:04:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,值班长 准备拉响碰撞警报
Dialogue: 2,0:04:37.17,0:04:38.34,Eng,,0,0,0,,Chief of the Watch, stand by the collision alarm.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.34,0:04:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,只剩200米了
Dialogue: 2,0:04:38.34,0:04:39.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,200 meters.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.71,0:04:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我是舰长 所有船员准备迎接打击
Dialogue: 2,0:04:39.71,0:04:41.42,Eng,,0,0,0,,This is the captain. All hands brace for impact.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.42,0:04:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,敌方鱼雷抵达倒计时
Dialogue: 2,0:04:41.42,0:04:43.26,Eng,,0,0,0,,Enemy torpedo impact in…
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.26,0:04:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,五 四
Dialogue: 2,0:04:43.26,0:04:45.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,five… four…
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.34,0:04:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,三 二
Dialogue: 2,0:04:46.34,0:04:48.60,Eng,,0,0,0,,three… two…
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.43,0:04:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,一
Dialogue: 2,0:04:49.43,0:04:50.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,one.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.93,0:04:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,命中
Dialogue: 2,0:04:50.93,0:04:51.77,Eng,,0,0,0,,Impact!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.86,0:05:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-到底怎么回事 -鱼雷不见了
Dialogue: 2,0:05:02.86,0:05:05.24,Eng,,0,0,0,,-What just happened? -It's gone.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.24,0:05:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-它没击中 -不
Dialogue: 2,0:05:05.24,0:05:07.57,Eng,,0,0,0,,-It missed us? -No.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.57,0:05:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,它消失了 就像从没出现过一样
Dialogue: 2,0:05:07.57,0:05:11.04,Eng,,0,0,0,,It vanished like it was never there.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.04,0:05:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,声呐官 敌方舰艇在什么方位
Dialogue: 2,0:05:11.04,0:05:13.58,Eng,,0,0,0,,Sonar, where is the enemy vessel?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.58,0:05:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,方位角330° 距离船首右舷四千米
Dialogue: 2,0:05:13.58,0:05:16.88,Eng,,0,0,0,,Bearing 330°, 4,000 meters off our starboard bow.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.88,0:05:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我方鱼雷还在运行
Dialogue: 2,0:05:16.88,0:05:18.21,Eng,,0,0,0,,Our torpedo is running true.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.21,0:05:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,即将命中敌方军舰 倒计时
Dialogue: 2,0:05:18.21,0:05:20.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,Impact with enemy submarine in…
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.13,0:05:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,三 二 一
Dialogue: 2,0:05:21.13,0:05:24.22,Eng,,0,0,0,,three… two… one.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.60,0:05:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么没显示命中
Dialogue: 2,0:05:28.60,0:05:29.89,Eng,,0,0,0,,Where was the impact?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.89,0:05:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 敌方舰艇消失了
Dialogue: 2,0:05:29.89,0:05:32.64,Eng,,0,0,0,,Captain, enemy submarine has vanished.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.64,0:05:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,突然不见了
Dialogue: 2,0:05:32.64,0:05:34.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's gone, sir.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.43,0:05:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么情况
Dialogue: 2,0:05:34.43,0:05:36.10,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.57,0:05:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,目标从没出现过
Dialogue: 2,0:05:41.57,0:05:42.69,Eng,,0,0,0,,He was never there.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.82,0:05:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在追逐一个幻影
Dialogue: 2,0:05:45.82,0:05:47.36,Eng,,0,0,0,,We've been chasing a phantom.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.36,0:05:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,可他刚才明明就在那儿 仪器是不会撒谎的
Dialogue: 2,0:05:47.36,0:05:50.20,Eng,,0,0,0,,It was right there. The instruments don't lie.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.20,0:05:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但今天是个例外
Dialogue: 2,0:05:50.20,0:05:52.58,Eng,,0,0,0,,They lied to us today.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.58,0:05:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-武器官 关闭鱼雷发射程序 -是 舰长
Dialogue: 2,0:05:52.58,0:05:55.41,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Weapons, shut down our torpedo. -Aye, Captain.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.41,0:05:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,关闭鱼雷发射程序
Dialogue: 2,0:05:55.41,0:05:57.21,Eng,,0,0,0,,Shutting down torpedo.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.21,0:05:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人解除作战状态
Dialogue: 2,0:05:57.21,0:05:59.92,Eng,,0,0,0,,Secure from battle stations.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.55,0:06:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这也是我们出海测试的原因
Dialogue: 2,0:06:02.55,0:06:04.46,Eng,,0,0,0,,This is why we have sea trials.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.47,0:06:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,系统仍然存在缺陷
Dialogue: 2,0:06:05.47,0:06:07.05,Eng,,0,0,0,,There's a bug in the system.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.93,0:06:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,躲在机器里的幽灵
Dialogue: 2,0:06:08.93,0:06:10.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,A ghost in the machine.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.26,0:06:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-该打道回府了 -舰长
Dialogue: 2,0:06:13.26,0:06:14.97,Eng,,0,0,0,,-It's time to go home. -Captain!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.97,0:06:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我方鱼雷没有响应 正在朝我们袭来
Dialogue: 2,0:06:14.97,0:06:18.10,Eng,,0,0,0,,Our own torpedo is not responding. It's coming right at us!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.10,0:06:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们被锁定了 打击距离400米 -见鬼
Dialogue: 2,0:06:18.10,0:06:21.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Our torpedo's homing, range 400 meters! -Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.23,0:06:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,改用缆控 关闭发射程序
Dialogue: 2,0:06:21.23,0:06:23.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,Wire command. Shut down our weapon!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.61,0:06:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我方鱼雷还在逼近 还有200米
Dialogue: 2,0:06:24.61,0:06:28.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,Our torpedo's still closing, range 200 meters!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.03,0:06:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,释放所有主压载舱蓄水 拉响碰撞警报
Dialogue: 2,0:06:28.03,0:06:31.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,Blow all main ballast tanks! Sound the collision alar--
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.63,0:07:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,外卖到了
Dialogue: 2,0:07:30.63,0:07:32.22,Eng,,0,0,0,,Food delivery.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.90,0:07:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有人吗
Dialogue: 2,0:07:41.90,0:07:43.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.61,0:07:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,对接代号
Dialogue: 2,0:07:51.61,0:07:52.61,Eng,,0,0,0,,Designator.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.61,0:07:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,别紧张
Dialogue: 2,0:07:52.61,0:07:54.16,Eng,,0,0,0,,Easy.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.45,0:07:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,别紧张
Dialogue: 2,0:07:55.45,0:07:56.70,Eng,,0,0,0,,Easy.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.08,0:08:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,对接代号
Dialogue: 2,0:07:59.08,0:08:00.33,Eng,,0,0,0,,Designator.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.17,0:08:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,代号IZ254
Dialogue: 2,0:08:03.17,0:08:05.00,Eng,,0,0,0,,India-Zulu-254.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.09,0:08:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,BE11
Dialogue: 2,0:08:06.09,0:08:07.92,Eng,,0,0,0,,Bravo-Echo-11.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.01,0:08:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不 还不行
Dialogue: 2,0:08:10.01,0:08:11.05,Eng,,0,0,0,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.05,0:08:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你还得问我安全验证问题
Dialogue: 2,0:08:11.05,0:08:13.64,Eng,,0,0,0,,You need to ask me the security question first.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.64,0:08:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 抱歉
Dialogue: 2,0:08:13.64,0:08:16.01,Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.26,0:08:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的誓言是什么
Dialogue: 2,0:08:18.26,0:08:19.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,What is the oath?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.48,0:08:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,无论生死皆隐于世
Dialogue: 2,0:08:24.48,0:08:26.81,Eng,,0,0,0,,We live and die in the shadows
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.36,0:08:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,为我们珍爱之人
Dialogue: 2,0:08:28.36,0:08:30.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,for those we hold close
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.49,0:08:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,也为不曾谋面之人
Dialogue: 2,0:08:31.49,0:08:33.49,Eng,,0,0,0,,and for those we never meet.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.32,0:08:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,放桌子上吧
Dialogue: 2,0:08:37.32,0:08:38.62,Eng,,0,0,0,,You can put it on the table.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.22,0:08:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 2,0:08:54.22,0:08:55.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.06,0:09:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎加入碟中谍小组
Dialogue: 2,0:08:59.06,0:09:00.85,Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the IMF.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.52,0:09:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你的选择是正确的
Dialogue: 2,0:09:02.52,0:09:04.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,You made the right choice.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.86,0:09:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官
Dialogue: 2,0:09:07.86,0:09:08.98,Eng,,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.49,0:09:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上好 亨特先生
Dialogue: 2,0:09:14.49,0:09:16.45,Eng,,0,0,0,,Good evening, Mr. Hunt.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.62,0:09:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,很久没联系了
Dialogue: 2,0:09:17.62,0:09:19.45,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.54,0:09:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,人生是我们每一次选择的结果
Dialogue: 2,0:09:20.54,0:09:22.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,Our lives are the sum of our choices
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.41,0:09:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们终将无法逃避过去
Dialogue: 2,0:09:24.41,0:09:26.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,and we cannot escape the past.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:27.63,0:09:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,三十年前你面临过一次选择
Dialogue: 2,0:09:27.63,0:09:30.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,Thirty years ago, you were offered the choice.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.55,0:09:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,加入碟中谍小组 又或者锒铛入狱
Dialogue: 2,0:09:30.55,0:09:34.42,Eng,,0,0,0,,Join the IMF or spend your life in prison.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.51,0:09:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你过人的天赋 政府原谅了你的过失
Dialogue: 2,0:09:35.51,0:09:39.97,Eng,,0,0,0,,Because of your unique natural talents, your government forgave you.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.97,0:09:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但这不代表我们会忘记一切
Dialogue: 2,0:09:39.97,0:09:42.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,But we will never forget.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.39,0:09:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,正如你永远无法忘记多年之前
Dialogue: 2,0:09:42.39,0:09:45.02,Eng,,0,0,0,,Just as you will never forget the death
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.02,0:09:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是她的死把你带到了我们面前
Dialogue: 2,0:09:45.02,0:09:48.10,Eng,,0,0,0,,that brought you to us all those years ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.74,0:10:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这是为了提醒你 遵守誓言并效忠于我们
Dialogue: 2,0:10:02.74,0:10:07.33,Eng,,0,0,0,,This is to remind you of your oath and allegiance to us.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.33,0:10:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这次任务的风险比以往都要高
Dialogue: 2,0:10:07.33,0:10:10.42,Eng,,0,0,0,,The stakes of this mission are higher than ever.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.42,0:10:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你一贯不服从指令的行为将不会被容忍
Dialogue: 2,0:10:10.42,0:10:13.84,Eng,,0,0,0,,Your habitual rogue behavior will not be tolerated.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.84,0:10:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你选择接受任务 请仔细听清以下内容 它们十分重要
Dialogue: 2,0:10:13.84,0:10:18.38,Eng,,0,0,0,,Should you choose to accept, it is imperative that you listen.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.30,0:10:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,政府正在寻找一把钥匙
Dialogue: 2,0:10:19.30,0:10:22.06,Eng,,0,0,0,,Your government is searching for a key.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.06,0:10:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,其用途对于我们来说至关重要
Dialogue: 2,0:10:22.06,0:10:25.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,Its purpose, its vital importance to us,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.39,0:10:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,具体原因你不必关心
Dialogue: 2,0:10:25.39,0:10:27.98,Eng,,0,0,0,,is none of your concern.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.98,0:10:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要关心的是 你的朋友伊尔莎浮士德也牵扯其中
Dialogue: 2,0:10:27.98,0:10:32.77,Eng,,0,0,0,,What should concern you is the involvement of your friend Ilsa Faust.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.28,0:10:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,她在伊斯坦布尔杀了一名快递员
Dialogue: 2,0:10:34.28,0:10:36.82,Eng,,0,0,0,,She killed a courier in Istanbul.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.82,0:10:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们相信 那人手里握着半把 我们正在寻找的钥匙
Dialogue: 2,0:10:36.82,0:10:41.62,Eng,,0,0,0,,And we believe he was carrying one half of the key we're searching for.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.16,0:10:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,至于她为何会插手这件事 至今还是个谜
Dialogue: 2,0:10:42.16,0:10:46.00,Eng,,0,0,0,,Why she has chosen to interfere in this affair is a mystery,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.00,0:10:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,正如她的下落一样
Dialogue: 2,0:10:46.00,0:10:48.33,Eng,,0,0,0,,as are her whereabouts.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.08,0:10:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,但可以肯定的是 政府正在悬赏要她的性命
Dialogue: 2,0:10:49.08,0:10:53.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,What is certain is that your government has put a price on her head
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.71,0:10:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,而那些赏金猎人 已经开始行动了
Dialogue: 2,0:10:54.71,0:10:58.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,and these bounty hunters are out to collect it.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.18,0:11:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他们从未带回来过活口
Dialogue: 2,0:10:59.18,0:11:02.10,Eng,,0,0,0,,They never bring a fugitive back alive.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.10,0:11:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至连具全尸都不会留
Dialogue: 2,0:11:02.10,0:11:04.89,Eng,,0,0,0,,And rarely in one piece.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.89,0:11:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他们正在前往阿拉伯沙漠的鲁卜哈利地带
Dialogue: 2,0:11:04.89,0:11:07.77,Eng,,0,0,0,,We believe they're headed for the Arabian Desert's Empty Quarter
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.77,0:11:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,寻找你的朋友
Dialogue: 2,0:11:07.77,0:11:09.89,Eng,,0,0,0,,in search of your friend.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.89,0:11:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,找到那些赏金猎人 也许就能找到你的朋友
Dialogue: 2,0:11:09.89,0:11:13.69,Eng,,0,0,0,,Find the bounty hunters, and you may just find her.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.65,0:11:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,若你选择接受 本次任务为
Dialogue: 2,0:11:14.65,0:11:17.65,Eng,,0,0,0,,Your mission, should you choose to accept it,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.65,0:11:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,夺取目标钥匙 并把它带给我们
Dialogue: 2,0:11:17.65,0:11:21.20,Eng,,0,0,0,,is to acquire the key and deliver it to us.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.20,0:11:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,完成任务后 伊尔莎的命运将由你决定
Dialogue: 2,0:11:21.20,0:11:24.58,Eng,,0,0,0,,What happens to Ilsa after that is up to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.45,0:11:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,还是老规矩 如果你或你团队的任何成员被捕或被杀
Dialogue: 2,0:11:25.45,0:11:29.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,As always, if any members of your team are caught or killed,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.50,0:11:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,部长将否认对你们的行动知情
Dialogue: 2,0:11:29.50,0:11:33.00,Eng,,0,0,0,,the secretary will disavow any knowledge of your actions.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.04,0:11:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这条消息将会在五秒之后自动销毁
Dialogue: 2,0:11:34.04,0:11:37.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,This message will self-destruct in five seconds.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:38.46,0:11:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你好运 伊森
Dialogue: 2,0:11:38.46,0:11:40.13,Eng,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Ethan.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.00,0:12:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 2,0:12:14.00,0:12:15.08,Eng,,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.84,0:13:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森
Dialogue: 2,0:13:04.84,0:13:06.22,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ethan.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.38,0:15:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,摆在我们面前的到底是什么
Dialogue: 2,0:15:48.38,0:15:50.17,Eng,,0,0,0,,So what are we dealing with?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.17,0:15:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这个所谓的"智体"它有着多重不同的身份 
Dialogue: 2,0:15:50.17,0:15:54.05,Eng,,0,0,0,,This "entity" has multiple personalities,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:54.09,0:15:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有时它就像电脑病毒一样 有时又如同绦虫或僵尸网络
Dialogue: 2,0:15:54.09,0:15:58.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,at times behaving like a computer virus then a tapeworm, then a botnet.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.59,0:16:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,它会肆意扭曲和修改 接触到的所有数字信息
Dialogue: 2,0:15:58.59,0:16:02.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,Distorting any and all digital information with which it comes in contact.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.23,0:16:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦感染
Dialogue: 2,0:16:02.23,0:16:03.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,Once infected,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.35,0:16:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,所有以数字形式记录 存储和传输的信息 都将有可能被篡改
Dialogue: 2,0:16:03.35,0:16:07.44,Eng,,0,0,0,,nothing recorded, stored or transmitted digitally can be trusted as fact.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.44,0:16:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,最初 它的目标集中在新闻和社交媒体上
Dialogue: 2,0:16:07.44,0:16:11.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,At the outset, it concentrated primarily on news and social media,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.74,0:16:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,当时我们并没有在意 因为那通常和我们的利益一致
Dialogue: 2,0:16:11.74,0:16:14.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,which was of little concern to us as it often suited our purposes.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:14.95,0:16:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,直到六个月前
Dialogue: 2,0:16:14.95,0:16:16.16,Eng,,0,0,0,,Until six months ago,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.16,0:16:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,智体入侵了沙特阿拉伯的情报局
Dialogue: 2,0:16:16.16,0:16:19.45,Eng,,0,0,0,,when the entity breached Saudi Arabia's General Intelligence Directorate.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.45,0:16:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,还夺取了他们的机密技术 可自主学习的人工智能
Dialogue: 2,0:16:19.45,0:16:22.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,And assimilated their top secret active learning AI
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.87,0:16:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,然后就在云端消失得无影无踪
Dialogue: 2,0:16:22.87,0:16:25.21,Eng,,0,0,0,,before vanishing into the cloud.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.21,0:16:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,随后感染率在一夜之间增长了上万倍
Dialogue: 2,0:16:25.21,0:16:28.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,Subsequent attacks increased ten-thousandfold overnight,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.50,0:16:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,正以指数倍疯狂传播
Dialogue: 2,0:16:28.50,0:16:30.22,Eng,,0,0,0,,spreading exponentially.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:30.22,0:16:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说 智体已经拥有了
Dialogue: 2,0:16:30.22,0:16:33.68,Eng,,0,0,0,,Indicating that the Entity has since become
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.68,0:16:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,感知能力
Dialogue: 2,0:16:33.68,0:16:35.22,Eng,,0,0,0,,sentient.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.93,0:16:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是它会自主思考了
Dialogue: 2,0:16:35.93,0:16:37.93,Eng,,0,0,0,,You're telling me this thing has a mind of its own?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.93,0:16:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,仅在过去的三周内
Dialogue: 2,0:16:37.93,0:16:39.85,Eng,,0,0,0,,Over the last three weeks alone,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.85,0:16:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,它就已经入侵了我们的卫星通讯系统 联邦储备银行
Dialogue: 2,0:16:39.85,0:16:43.60,Eng,,0,0,0,,it has accessed our satellite telecommunications, the Federal Reserve,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.60,0:16:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,股票市场 还有全国电网
Dialogue: 2,0:16:43.60,0:16:46.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,the stock market and the national power grid.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.23,0:16:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,航空局 美国宇航局 还有各个联合军种的分支机构
Dialogue: 2,0:16:46.23,0:16:49.53,Eng,,0,0,0,,The FAA, NASA and the combined branches of our military.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.53,0:16:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,而且不光是我们 它也感染了其他国家 以及欧洲中央银行系统
Dialogue: 2,0:16:49.53,0:16:54.28,Eng,,0,0,0,,And we're not alone. It has penetrated the World and European Central Banks.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.28,0:16:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,还侵入了多国的国防 金融 基础设施系统
Dialogue: 2,0:16:54.28,0:16:57.58,Eng,,0,0,0,,Gained entry to the major defense, finance and infrastructure systems
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.58,0:17:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,包括俄罗斯 印度 以色列 澳大拉西亚和整个欧洲
Dialogue: 2,0:16:57.58,0:17:02.12,Eng,,0,0,0,,of Russia, India, Israel, Australasia, all of Europe.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:02.12,0:17:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那它对这些系统具体做了些什么
Dialogue: 2,0:17:02.12,0:17:05.04,Eng,,0,0,0,,And what did it do to all of these systems exactly?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.04,0:17:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没做
Dialogue: 2,0:17:05.04,0:17:06.17,Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.21,0:17:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没吗
Dialogue: 2,0:17:07.21,0:17:08.13,Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:08.13,0:17:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,它来去自如
Dialogue: 2,0:17:08.13,0:17:09.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,It came and it went,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.55,0:17:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,在最明显的地方留下痕迹
Dialogue: 2,0:17:09.55,0:17:12.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,leaving fingerprints where they could easily be found
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.59,0:17:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,就是为了向我们传达一条明确的信息
Dialogue: 2,0:17:12.59,0:17:15.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,and sending a very clear message.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.18,0:17:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,"我会卷土重来"
Dialogue: 2,0:17:17.18,0:17:18.81,Eng,,0,0,0,,"I shall return."
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.81,0:17:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,无论它最终的目的是什么 我们都无力阻止它
Dialogue: 2,0:17:18.81,0:17:22.64,Eng,,0,0,0,,Whatever its ultimate goal is, we're powerless to stop it.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.64,0:17:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,目前它的全部力量 都集中指向了一个目标
Dialogue: 2,0:17:22.64,0:17:26.60,Eng,,0,0,0,,The full force of its energy is now directed at a single objective.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.60,0:17:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,整个世界的情报网络
Dialogue: 2,0:17:26.60,0:17:28.52,Eng,,0,0,0,,The world's intelligence networks.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:28.52,0:17:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们目前所知晓的真相
Dialogue: 2,0:17:28.52,0:17:30.94,Eng,,0,0,0,,The very truth as we know it.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.94,0:17:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,整个情报部门都在全力以赴用纸质文档
Dialogue: 2,0:17:30.94,0:17:35.70,Eng,,0,0,0,,The entire intelligence community is racing to archive hard copies
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.70,0:17:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,保存已确认属实的数据库信息
Dialogue: 2,0:17:35.70,0:17:37.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,of our fact-positive knowledge bases
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.87,0:17:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,以防我们最安全的数据库遭到入侵 或被破坏
Dialogue: 2,0:17:37.87,0:17:41.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,before our most secure data centers are breached and corrupted.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.87,0:17:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但那也只是时间问题
Dialogue: 2,0:17:41.87,0:17:43.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,Which is only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.79,0:17:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,智体非常清楚
Dialogue: 2,0:17:43.79,0:17:45.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,The Entity will know precisely
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.83,0:17:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,如何削弱我们的优势 并准确利用我们的弱势
Dialogue: 2,0:17:45.83,0:17:49.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,how to undermine our every strength and exploit our every weakness.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.71,0:17:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,如何将我们的盟友变成敌人
Dialogue: 2,0:17:49.71,0:17:52.42,Eng,,0,0,0,,How to turn our allies into enemies
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.42,0:17:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,将我们的敌人 变成侵略者
Dialogue: 2,0:17:52.42,0:17:55.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,and our enemies into aggressors.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:55.59,0:17:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不隔离情报网络的服务器呢
Dialogue: 2,0:17:55.59,0:17:58.34,Eng,,0,0,0,,Why not air-gap our intelligence servers?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:58.34,0:18:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,完全切断它们与外界的联系
Dialogue: 2,0:17:58.34,0:18:00.72,Eng,,0,0,0,,Cut them off from the outside world entirely?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.72,0:18:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经这么做了
Dialogue: 2,0:18:00.72,0:18:02.14,Eng,,0,0,0,,We already have.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.14,0:18:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,可是 服务器仍然需要人工维护
Dialogue: 2,0:18:02.14,0:18:05.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,But servers require humans to maintain them.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:05.48,0:18:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,而人是所有安全链中最薄弱的环节
Dialogue: 2,0:18:05.48,0:18:08.73,Eng,,0,0,0,,And humans are the weakest link in any security chain,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.73,0:18:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其在面对缺乏信仰 无依无靠 道德品质低的敌人时
Dialogue: 2,0:18:08.73,0:18:12.86,Eng,,0,0,0,,especially when dealing with a godless, stateless, amoral enemy.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.86,0:18:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,它一直在暗处耐心地倾听 读取 观察我们
Dialogue: 2,0:18:12.86,0:18:16.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,One that has been patiently listening, reading, watching.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:16.78,0:18:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,收集我们最私密的个人信息 年复一年
Dialogue: 2,0:18:16.78,0:18:20.12,Eng,,0,0,0,,Harvesting our deepest personal secrets for years.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.12,0:18:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,它可以欺骗 勒索 贿赂任何人 甚至成为它想成为的人
Dialogue: 2,0:18:20.12,0:18:25.33,Eng,,0,0,0,,Able to beguile, blackmail, bribe or be anyone it wants.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.33,0:18:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,还能利用我们对一个精心构筑的 数字世界的彻底依赖
Dialogue: 2,0:18:25.33,0:18:29.04,Eng,,0,0,0,,And to manipulate us at will through our total dependence
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.04,0:18:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,随意操控我们每一个人
Dialogue: 2,0:18:29.04,0:18:32.05,Eng,,0,0,0,,on a carefully constructed digital reality.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.05,0:18:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,一个无处不在的敌人
Dialogue: 2,0:18:32.05,0:18:34.38,Eng,,0,0,0,,An enemy that is everywhere
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.47,0:18:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,同时又无处可寻
Dialogue: 2,0:18:35.47,0:18:37.26,Eng,,0,0,0,,and nowhere
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.26,0:18:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,虚无缥缈的敌人
Dialogue: 2,0:18:37.26,0:18:39.18,Eng,,0,0,0,,and has no center.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.26,0:18:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 所以你们的意思是
Dialogue: 2,0:18:43.26,0:18:46.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, so what you're telling me is,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.43,0:18:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,作为全世界最出色的情报战术组织的你们
Dialogue: 2,0:18:46.43,0:18:51.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,the most awesome goddamn intelligence and tactical apparatus on the planet
Dialogue: 1,0:18:51.19,0:18:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,都没有办法除掉这个智体
Dialogue: 2,0:18:51.19,0:18:54.69,Eng,,0,0,0,,has no way of killing this thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.69,0:18:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们并不想除掉它 长官
Dialogue: 2,0:18:54.69,0:18:56.86,Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't want to kill it, sir.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.40,0:18:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,而是要控制它
Dialogue: 2,0:18:58.40,0:18:59.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,You want to control it.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:59.95,0:19:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那要怎么实现呢 基特里奇先生
Dialogue: 2,0:18:59.95,0:19:03.12,Eng,,0,0,0,,And how do we do that, Mr. Kittridge?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.99,0:19:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,中情局在克里姆林宫的线人说
Dialogue: 2,0:19:03.99,0:19:06.58,Eng,,0,0,0,,The CIA's assets in the Kremlin informed us
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.58,0:19:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,俄方将大部分情报活动都集中在了
Dialogue: 2,0:19:06.58,0:19:11.13,Eng,,0,0,0,,that the Russians have focused the majority of their intelligence activity
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.13,0:19:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,寻找一把由两把钥匙组成的十字钥匙上
Dialogue: 2,0:19:11.13,0:19:14.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,on acquiring two halves of a cruciform key.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:15.46,0:19:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-开什么锁的钥匙 -暂时还不确定
Dialogue: 2,0:19:15.46,0:19:18.17,Eng,,0,0,0,,-And what does it unlock? -Not exactly sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.88,0:19:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但俄方似乎确信这把钥匙
Dialogue: 2,0:19:18.88,0:19:21.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,But the Russians seem to believe that it somehow has
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.43,0:19:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,可以让那个神秘的智体停止运行
Dialogue: 2,0:19:21.43,0:19:24.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,the power to deactivate our mysterious Entity.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.39,0:19:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 不难推测
Dialogue: 2,0:19:24.39,0:19:25.81,Eng,,0,0,0,,Though, ideally,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.23,0:19:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他们希望能控制它 利用它
Dialogue: 2,0:19:27.23,0:19:30.14,Eng,,0,0,0,,they hope to control it, harness it.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.14,0:19:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的相信吗 基特里奇
Dialogue: 2,0:19:30.14,0:19:32.52,Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you believe that, Kittridge?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:33.27,0:19:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,重点在于 全世界其他国家都信了
Dialogue: 2,0:19:33.27,0:19:37.40,Eng,,0,0,0,,What matters is that the rest of the world believes it.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.40,0:19:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,日本 印度 德国 英国都信了
Dialogue: 2,0:19:37.40,0:19:40.28,Eng,,0,0,0,,Japan, India, Germany and the Brits believe it.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.28,0:19:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但却没有人
Dialogue: 2,0:19:40.28,0:19:42.12,Eng,,0,0,0,,And yet no one,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.12,0:19:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,就连我们最亲密的盟友
Dialogue: 2,0:19:42.12,0:19:44.16,Eng,,0,0,0,,not even our closest allies,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.16,0:19:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,都没有和我们提过只字片语
Dialogue: 2,0:19:44.16,0:19:47.08,Eng,,0,0,0,,have willingly whispered one word of it to us.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.08,0:19:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这恰好证明 全世界都在想办法
Dialogue: 2,0:19:47.08,0:19:49.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,Which would indicate that there's a global race on
Dialogue: 1,0:19:49.75,0:19:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,得到这把钥匙
Dialogue: 2,0:19:49.75,0:19:52.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,to acquire the two halves of this key.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.71,0:19:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,参与其中的每一个国家 都不是为了要除掉它 长官
Dialogue: 2,0:19:52.71,0:19:57.80,Eng,,0,0,0,,Every nation in it for themselves, not to kill this thing, sir,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.59,0:20:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,而是想将它变成武器
Dialogue: 2,0:19:58.59,0:20:00.26,Eng,,0,0,0,,but to weaponize it.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:00.26,0:20:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,并借此力量建立一个全新的 不容抗衡的
Dialogue: 2,0:20:00.26,0:20:04.68,Eng,,0,0,0,,And, in so doing, establish a new, incontestable form
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.68,0:20:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,全球统治地位
Dialogue: 2,0:20:04.68,0:20:06.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,of global dominance.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.31,0:20:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,怎样才能先找到钥匙
Dialogue: 2,0:20:06.31,0:20:07.97,Eng,,0,0,0,,How do we find this key first?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.97,0:20:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得知有个买家 在接下来的72个小时内
Dialogue: 2,0:20:07.97,0:20:11.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, we know that a buyer is passing somewhere through the Middle East
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.56,0:20:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,会经过中东的某个地区
Dialogue: 2,0:20:11.56,0:20:14.52,Eng,,0,0,0,,sometime in the next 72 hours.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:14.52,0:20:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们相信他已经拿到了其中一半钥匙
Dialogue: 2,0:20:14.52,0:20:17.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,We believe that he already has one half of this key.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.78,0:20:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,"你们相信"
Dialogue: 2,0:20:17.78,0:20:18.90,Eng,,0,0,0,,You believe.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:18.90,0:20:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 还不能确定钥匙的真假
Dialogue: 2,0:20:18.90,0:20:21.24,Eng,,0,0,0,,At this point, we can't be certain it's not a counterfeit.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.24,0:20:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那么要怎么验证呢
Dialogue: 2,0:20:21.24,0:20:22.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,How would you verify that?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.74,0:20:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,想要验证其中一把钥匙的真伪 就只能靠
Dialogue: 2,0:20:22.74,0:20:26.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,The only thing that can authenticate one genuine half of the key is
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.66,0:20:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,另一半钥匙 只有两把真的才能匹配
Dialogue: 2,0:20:26.66,0:20:29.29,Eng,,0,0,0,,the other genuine half of the key--its true mate, if you will.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:29.29,0:20:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,算是一种安全机制吧
Dialogue: 2,0:20:29.29,0:20:31.96,Eng,,0,0,0,,We think it's some sort of fail-safe.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.96,0:20:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,要怎么找到另一半呢
Dialogue: 2,0:20:31.96,0:20:33.17,Eng,,0,0,0,,How do we find its mate?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.17,0:20:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们相信另一半钥匙
Dialogue: 2,0:20:33.17,0:20:36.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, we believe the other genuine half of the key
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.63,0:20:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,在这个女人手里
Dialogue: 2,0:20:36.63,0:20:38.96,Eng,,0,0,0,,was in the hands of this woman.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.96,0:20:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,她是谁
Dialogue: 2,0:20:38.96,0:20:40.22,Eng,,0,0,0,,Who is she?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.22,0:20:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,伊尔莎浮士德
Dialogue: 2,0:20:40.22,0:20:41.72,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ilsa Faust.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.72,0:20:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,前英国情报局特工
Dialogue: 2,0:20:41.72,0:20:43.30,Eng,,0,0,0,,Former British Intelligence.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.30,0:20:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-她现在在哪儿 -她已经死了 长官
Dialogue: 2,0:20:43.30,0:20:46.05,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Where is she now? -She's dead, sir.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.05,0:20:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,她是被… 抱歉
Dialogue: 2,0:20:46.05,0:20:48.06,Eng,,0,0,0,,She was--excuse me--
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.06,0:20:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,被一群雇佣兵杀死的 所谓的赏金猎人
Dialogue: 2,0:20:48.06,0:20:51.64,Eng,,0,0,0,,killed by mercenaries looking to collect a bounty.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.64,0:20:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,谁悬的赏金
Dialogue: 2,0:20:51.64,0:20:53.02,Eng,,0,0,0,,And who put up the bounty?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:53.02,0:20:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,鉴于她的身份 谁都有可能
Dialogue: 2,0:20:53.02,0:20:55.52,Eng,,0,0,0,,Given her body of work, could have been anyone.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.52,0:20:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,所以任何人都可能拿到那一半钥匙
Dialogue: 2,0:20:55.52,0:20:57.65,Eng,,0,0,0,,So anyone could have her half of the key?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.78,0:21:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,也不是任何人
Dialogue: 2,0:20:58.78,0:21:00.57,Eng,,0,0,0,,Not just anyone.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:01.24,0:21:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我派了一个人前去找她
Dialogue: 2,0:21:01.24,0:21:03.32,Eng,,0,0,0,,I sent a man to find her.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.32,0:21:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这世上她唯一信得过且愿意托付钥匙的人
Dialogue: 2,0:21:03.32,0:21:06.37,Eng,,0,0,0,,The only man she would have entrusted with her half of the key.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.37,0:21:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那他拿到钥匙了吗
Dialogue: 2,0:21:06.37,0:21:08.24,Eng,,0,0,0,,Does he have it, Kittridge?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:08.24,0:21:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,目前我还不知道 长官 他…拒绝露面
Dialogue: 2,0:21:08.24,0:21:12.29,Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, at present, I don't know that, sir. He's refused to come in.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.91,0:21:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,拒绝
Dialogue: 2,0:21:12.91,0:21:14.37,Eng,,0,0,0,,Refused?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.25,0:21:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙是什么人
Dialogue: 2,0:21:15.25,0:21:16.42,Eng,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is this guy?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.42,0:21:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这是机密
Dialogue: 2,0:21:16.42,0:21:18.04,Eng,,0,0,0,,That's classified.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.04,0:21:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是这个国家的情报局局长
Dialogue: 2,0:21:18.04,0:21:21.21,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm the goddamn Director of National Intelligence.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.21,0:21:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,请问有什么是我不能知道的吗
Dialogue: 2,0:21:21.21,0:21:23.26,Eng,,0,0,0,,What exactly is it I'm not supposed to know about?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.26,0:21:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,IMF
Dialogue: 2,0:21:23.26,0:21:24.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,The IMF.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.43,0:21:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-基特里奇先生 -世界银行
Dialogue: 2,0:21:24.43,0:21:26.01,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Mr. Kittridge. -The world bank.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.01,0:21:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不 您说的是国际货币基金组织
Dialogue: 2,0:21:26.01,0:21:27.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,No, that's the International Monetary Fund.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.43,0:21:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-基特里奇先生 -我说的是另一个IMF 我们的
Dialogue: 2,0:21:27.43,0:21:31.02,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Mr. Kittridge. -No, I mean the other IMF. Ours.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.02,0:21:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,全名到底是什么
Dialogue: 2,0:21:31.02,0:21:32.60,Eng,,0,0,0,,What does it stand for?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.52,0:21:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,碟中谍任务小组
Dialogue: 2,0:21:33.52,0:21:35.77,Eng,,0,0,0,,Impossible Mission Force.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.48,0:21:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-开什么玩笑 -这恐怕不是玩笑
Dialogue: 2,0:21:36.48,0:21:39.36,Eng,,0,0,0,,-You're not serious. -I'm afraid he is.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.36,0:21:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那他们到底是做什么的
Dialogue: 2,0:21:39.36,0:21:41.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,And what do they do exactly?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.07,0:21:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,就像他们的名字 不可能完成的任务
Dialogue: 2,0:21:41.07,0:21:44.40,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's just as the name implies. Whatever the rest of us can't.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.40,0:21:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,负责人是谁
Dialogue: 2,0:21:44.40,0:21:45.57,Eng,,0,0,0,,And who is in charge?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.57,0:21:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他们并不会按部就班地听从指令 我们一般只会…
Dialogue: 2,0:21:45.57,0:21:49.37,Eng,,0,0,0,,They're not ones to take orders in the traditional sense. We more or less…
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.66,0:21:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,给他们留言
Dialogue: 2,0:21:51.66,0:21:52.62,Eng,,0,0,0,,leave word.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.16,0:21:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,给他们留言
Dialogue: 2,0:21:54.16,0:21:56.04,Eng,,0,0,0,,Leave word.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.04,0:21:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,基特里奇先生
Dialogue: 2,0:21:56.04,0:21:57.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kittridge, sir.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.67,0:22:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,碟中谍小组不属于任何情报部门 他们直接向总统汇报
Dialogue: 2,0:21:57.67,0:22:01.38,Eng,,0,0,0,,The IMF operates outside the community and answers directly to the president.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.38,0:22:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,让我来捋一下
Dialogue: 2,0:22:01.38,0:22:02.80,Eng,,0,0,0,,So let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.80,0:22:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,每当你们遇到无法完成的任务时
Dialogue: 2,0:22:02.80,0:22:06.30,Eng,,0,0,0,,When there's a mission none of you can handle,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.97,0:22:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你们就会选择给一个神秘人留言
Dialogue: 2,0:22:06.97,0:22:11.18,Eng,,0,0,0,,you just leave word for a nameless man
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.18,0:22:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,然后祈祷他可以完成任务
Dialogue: 2,0:22:11.18,0:22:13.81,Eng,,0,0,0,,and hope he gets the job done.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.81,0:22:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样吗
Dialogue: 2,0:22:13.81,0:22:14.81,Eng,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.81,0:22:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,前提是他愿意接受任务
Dialogue: 2,0:22:14.81,0:22:18.06,Eng,,0,0,0,,Should he choose to accept it.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.06,0:22:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他们凭什么有权选择接不接受任务
Dialogue: 2,0:22:18.06,0:22:21.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,What the hell kind of outfit gets to choose what orders to accept?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.48,0:22:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,建立该小组的初衷就是为了
Dialogue: 2,0:22:21.48,0:22:23.36,Eng,,0,0,0,,The IMF was expressly created
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.36,0:22:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,确保不会出现意想不到的后果
Dialogue: 2,0:22:23.36,0:22:27.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,to ensure there would be no unintended consequences.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.07,0:22:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他们无法保证任务的最终结果
Dialogue: 2,0:22:27.07,0:22:30.24,Eng,,0,0,0,,If they cannot ensure a mission's ultimate outcome,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.24,0:22:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可以选择拒绝
Dialogue: 2,0:22:30.24,0:22:32.58,Eng,,0,0,0,,they're authorized to decline.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.09,0:23:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白
Dialogue: 2,0:23:24.09,0:23:25.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.42,0:23:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你很生气
Dialogue: 2,0:23:26.42,0:23:27.38,Eng,,0,0,0,,You're upset.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:28.26,0:23:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我没生气 基特里奇
Dialogue: 2,0:23:28.26,0:23:30.05,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not upset, Kittridge.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.47,0:23:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你说有话想对我说
Dialogue: 2,0:23:31.47,0:23:33.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,You wanted me to listen.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.39,0:23:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我就来听听
Dialogue: 2,0:23:35.39,0:23:37.10,Eng,,0,0,0,,This is me listening.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:38.60,0:23:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 2,0:23:38.60,0:23:39.89,Eng,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:40.44,0:23:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是我悬赏要伊尔莎的命
Dialogue: 2,0:23:40.44,0:23:42.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,I put the bounty on Ilsa's head.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:42.11,0:23:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,但我也跟你说了怎么找到她
Dialogue: 2,0:23:42.11,0:23:44.32,Eng,,0,0,0,,I also told you how to find her!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:45.40,0:23:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我没让她去偷钥匙 她出于她自己的原因偷了那把钥匙
Dialogue: 2,0:23:45.40,0:23:49.40,Eng,,0,0,0,,And I didn't ask her to steal the key. She did that for reasons of her own.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:49.40,0:23:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,可是 一直以来不都是这样吗
Dialogue: 2,0:23:49.40,0:23:53.58,Eng,,0,0,0,,But that's the pattern, isn't it?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:55.41,0:24:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你一次次帮她摆脱困境 她却总是一次次又陷进去
Dialogue: 2,0:23:55.41,0:24:00.29,Eng,,0,0,0,,You get her out of trouble and she always found her way back in.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:10.76,0:24:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 伊尔莎
Dialogue: 2,0:24:10.76,0:24:12.22,Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait! Ilsa.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:12.22,0:24:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,伊尔莎 别激动 等等 是我
Dialogue: 2,0:24:12.22,0:24:14.89,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ilsa, wait! It's me!
Dialogue: 1,0:24:14.89,0:24:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 2,0:24:14.89,0:24:15.93,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:23.06,0:24:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,没事了
Dialogue: 2,0:24:23.06,0:24:23.90,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:57.47,0:25:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 他们认为你死了 那就将错就错
Dialogue: 2,0:24:57.47,0:25:00.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,Listen to me! You're dead! You stay dead!
Dialogue: 1,0:25:01.18,0:25:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森 等等
Dialogue: 2,0:25:01.18,0:25:02.89,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ethan, wait!
Dialogue: 1,0:25:07.23,0:25:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会向你道歉的 亨特
Dialogue: 2,0:25:07.23,0:25:09.61,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to apologize to you, Hunt.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:09.61,0:25:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,利用你是我的职责所在
Dialogue: 2,0:25:09.61,0:25:11.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's my job to use you.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:11.99,0:25:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,就像你的职责就是完成任务
Dialogue: 2,0:25:11.99,0:25:14.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,Just like it's your job to be of use.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:14.74,0:25:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你到底有没有完成你的任务
Dialogue: 2,0:25:14.74,0:25:18.49,Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you accomplish your mission or not?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:22.91,0:25:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,无论这把钥匙的另一半在哪里
Dialogue: 2,0:25:22.91,0:25:25.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,Wherever the other half of this is,
Dialogue: 1,0:25:25.63,0:25:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,无论它们能打开什么
Dialogue: 2,0:25:25.63,0:25:28.80,Eng,,0,0,0,,whatever the completed key unlocks,
Dialogue: 1,0:25:28.80,0:25:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我都会弄个明白
Dialogue: 2,0:25:28.80,0:25:30.38,Eng,,0,0,0,,I will find it.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:32.01,0:25:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,弄明白之后呢
Dialogue: 2,0:25:32.01,0:25:33.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,And then what?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:34.18,0:25:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,智体不该交给任何人去掌控
Dialogue: 2,0:25:34.18,0:25:37.72,Eng,,0,0,0,,No one should be trusted with control of the Entity.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:38.56,0:25:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我要毁了它
Dialogue: 2,0:25:38.56,0:25:40.14,Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean to kill it.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:40.14,0:25:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森
Dialogue: 2,0:25:40.14,0:25:41.06,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ethan,
Dialogue: 1,0:25:41.60,0:25:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,下一次世界大战将不会是冷战
Dialogue: 2,0:25:41.60,0:25:43.64,Eng,,0,0,0,,the next world war isn't gonna be a cold one.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:43.64,0:25:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,它将是一场枪林弹雨 充满血腥的战争
Dialogue: 2,0:25:43.64,0:25:46.69,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be a shooting war, a ballistic war
Dialogue: 1,0:25:46.69,0:25:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,为了争夺日益减少的生态资源
Dialogue: 2,0:25:46.69,0:25:48.69,Eng,,0,0,0,,over a rapidly shrinking ecosystem.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:48.69,0:25:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,为了争夺那些仅存的能源
Dialogue: 2,0:25:48.69,0:25:51.86,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be a war for the last of our dwindling energy,
Dialogue: 1,0:25:51.86,0:25:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,为了最后一滴水 最后一口空气
Dialogue: 2,0:25:51.86,0:25:54.28,Eng,,0,0,0,,drinkable water, breathable air.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:54.28,0:25:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,掌握智体的人就等于掌握了真相
Dialogue: 2,0:25:54.28,0:25:58.37,Eng,,0,0,0,,Whoever controls the Entity controls the truth.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:59.83,0:26:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,而对于是非对错的定义
Dialogue: 2,0:25:59.83,0:26:02.08,Eng,,0,0,0,,The concepts of right and wrong
Dialogue: 1,0:26:02.08,0:26:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,在接下来的几百年里 都将由掌控智体的人说了算
Dialogue: 2,0:26:02.08,0:26:06.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,can be clearly defined for everyone for centuries to come.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:06.50,0:26:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你听听自己在说什么
Dialogue: 2,0:26:06.50,0:26:08.25,Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you even hear yourself?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:09.04,0:26:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你那些所谓的 为了正义而战的日子
Dialogue: 2,0:26:09.04,0:26:13.34,Eng,,0,0,0,,Your days of fighting for the so-called greater good
Dialogue: 1,0:26:14.51,0:26:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,已经结束了
Dialogue: 2,0:26:14.51,0:26:15.68,Eng,,0,0,0,,are over.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:16.47,0:26:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要选择一个阵营
Dialogue: 2,0:26:16.47,0:26:18.68,Eng,,0,0,0,,You need to pick a side.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:19.22,0:26:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我的阵营始终只有一个
Dialogue: 2,0:26:19.22,0:26:21.76,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm on the same side I've always been on.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:23.39,0:26:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不要妨碍我
Dialogue: 2,0:26:23.39,0:26:25.06,Eng,,0,0,0,,Stay out of my way.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:25.85,0:26:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这我做不到
Dialogue: 2,0:26:25.85,0:26:27.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:28.69,0:26:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会去找你 全世界都会追着你不放
Dialogue: 2,0:26:28.69,0:26:32.61,Eng,,0,0,0,,We're gonna be coming after you. The world's gonna be coming after you.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:32.61,0:26:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何 你内心坚持的那个使命
Dialogue: 2,0:26:32.61,0:26:36.70,Eng,,0,0,0,,And one way or another, this mission of yours
Dialogue: 1,0:26:36.70,0:26:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,都会让你付出沉重的代价
Dialogue: 2,0:26:36.70,0:26:40.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,is gonna cost you dearly.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:49.63,0:26:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我要是不接电话 很快就会有人冲进来
Dialogue: 2,0:26:49.63,0:26:52.46,Eng,,0,0,0,,If I don't get that, we're gonna have company real soon.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:09.60,0:27:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 2,0:27:09.60,0:27:10.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:10.56,0:27:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,请邓林格局长接电话
Dialogue: 2,0:27:10.56,0:27:12.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,Director Denlinger, please.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:13.15,0:27:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,局长他现在不方便接电话 有什么事吗
Dialogue: 2,0:27:13.15,0:27:16.53,Eng,,0,0,0,,Director is unavailable at the moment. How can I help you?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:16.53,0:27:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-请问您是哪位 -中情局局长尤金基特里奇
Dialogue: 2,0:27:16.53,0:27:19.82,Eng,,0,0,0,,-To whom am I speaking? -CIA Director Eugene Kittridge.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:19.82,0:27:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-对接代号 -"低音音符" 统统小写 当中没有空格
Dialogue: 2,0:27:19.82,0:27:22.53,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Designator? -"Bassnote," lowercase, all one word.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:22.53,0:27:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-长官 出了一点状况 -是吗
Dialogue: 2,0:27:22.53,0:27:25.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Sir, we have a situation. -No kidding.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:25.91,0:27:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,十分钟前 我们发现您的副手在他家中昏迷不醒
Dialogue: 2,0:27:25.91,0:27:29.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,Your adjutant was found unconscious in his home ten minutes ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:29.87,0:27:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是被下了药
Dialogue: 2,0:27:29.87,0:27:31.29,Eng,,0,0,0,,It appears he was drugged.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:31.29,0:27:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 2,0:27:31.29,0:27:32.96,Eng,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:32.96,0:27:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,事态恐怕很严重
Dialogue: 2,0:27:32.96,0:27:34.38,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't think you do, sir.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:34.38,0:27:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,警卫发现就在十五分钟之前 他刚进入了这栋大楼
Dialogue: 2,0:27:34.38,0:27:37.72,Eng,,0,0,0,,Security has him entering this facility 15 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:37.72,0:27:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了 谢谢
Dialogue: 2,0:27:37.72,0:27:39.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,I understand, thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:39.43,0:27:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,您现在是不是不方便讲话
Dialogue: 2,0:27:39.43,0:27:42.01,Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you able to speak freely?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:42.01,0:27:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-没错 谢谢 -我们马上派人过去
Dialogue: 2,0:27:42.01,0:27:45.14,Eng,,0,0,0,,-No, thank you. -A security team is on their way.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:45.14,0:27:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,如果您现在有危险 请在我数到五之前挂断电话
Dialogue: 2,0:27:45.14,0:27:48.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,If you're in any danger, simply hang up the phone before I count to five.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:48.35,0:27:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,一 二…
Dialogue: 2,0:27:48.35,0:27:50.02,Eng,,0,0,0,,One, two--
Dialogue: 1,0:27:53.61,0:27:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你打算怎么离开这里
Dialogue: 2,0:27:53.61,0:27:56.82,Eng,,0,0,0,,So just how do you plan on getting out of here?
Dialogue: 1,0:28:02.12,0:28:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,当我没问
Dialogue: 2,0:28:02.12,0:28:03.49,Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:13.44,0:29:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,听好了
Dialogue: 2,0:29:13.44,0:29:14.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:14.56,0:29:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,现有一名美国特工对自己的国家表示不满
Dialogue: 2,0:29:14.56,0:29:17.44,Eng,,0,0,0,,An American operative with a grievance against his country
Dialogue: 1,0:29:17.44,0:29:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,现处于失踪以及失控状态
Dialogue: 2,0:29:17.44,0:29:19.94,Eng,,0,0,0,,is missing and has malfunctioned.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:19.94,0:29:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他的行为可能会威胁到我们国家的利益
Dialogue: 2,0:29:19.94,0:29:22.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,His agenda represents a threat to our national interests
Dialogue: 1,0:29:22.95,0:29:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,必须不惜一切代价清除该隐患
Dialogue: 2,0:29:22.95,0:29:25.49,Eng,,0,0,0,,and he must be neutralized at all cost.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:25.49,0:29:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他身上所携带的所有物品都十分重要
Dialogue: 2,0:29:25.49,0:29:28.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,Anything in this man's possession is of vital importance
Dialogue: 1,0:29:28.83,0:29:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,必须完好无损地截获
Dialogue: 2,0:29:28.83,0:29:31.08,Eng,,0,0,0,,and must be captured intact.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:31.08,0:29:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不必顾及目标人物性命
Dialogue: 2,0:29:31.08,0:29:33.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,The man himself is expendable.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:33.79,0:29:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但不要低估他的实力
Dialogue: 2,0:29:33.79,0:29:35.96,Eng,,0,0,0,,He is not to be underestimated.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:35.96,0:29:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,此人善于伪装 诡计多端 破坏力极强 且善用心理战术
Dialogue: 2,0:29:35.96,0:29:40.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,A master of infiltration, deception, sabotage and psych warfare.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:40.63,0:29:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,总而言之 女士们先生们
Dialogue: 2,0:29:40.63,0:29:43.30,Eng,,0,0,0,,For all intents and purposes, ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 1,0:29:43.30,0:29:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是个会读心 善于伪装的麻烦人物
Dialogue: 2,0:29:43.30,0:29:46.22,Eng,,0,0,0,,a mind-reading, shape-shifting incarnation of chaos.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:46.22,0:29:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 出于对你们自身 以及队友的安全考虑
Dialogue: 2,0:29:46.22,0:29:50.85,Eng,,0,0,0,,So, for your safety and the safety of those around you,
Dialogue: 1,0:29:50.85,0:29:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,在确认他彻底断气之前
Dialogue: 2,0:29:50.85,0:29:52.68,Eng,,0,0,0,,do not consider him secure
Dialogue: 1,0:29:52.68,0:29:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不能对这个家伙掉以轻心
Dialogue: 2,0:29:52.68,0:29:56.60,Eng,,0,0,0,,unless you have driven a wooden stake through his open heart.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:57.27,0:29:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是演习
Dialogue: 2,0:29:57.27,0:29:59.40,Eng,,0,0,0,,This is not a drill.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:00.98,0:30:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,一只具有意识 会自主学习
Dialogue: 2,0:30:00.98,0:30:04.28,Eng,,0,0,0,,A self-aware, self-learning,
Dialogue: 1,0:30:04.28,0:30:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,还会吞噬真相的数字寄生虫
Dialogue: 2,0:30:04.28,0:30:06.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,truth-eating digital parasite
Dialogue: 1,0:30:07.82,0:30:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,正滋生于整个网络之中
Dialogue: 2,0:30:07.82,0:30:10.37,Eng,,0,0,0,,infesting all of cyberspace.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:11.62,0:30:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这反正是迟早的事
Dialogue: 2,0:30:11.62,0:30:13.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, it was bound to happen sooner or later.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:13.79,0:30:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,而有了这两半钥匙
Dialogue: 2,0:30:13.79,0:30:15.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,And the two halves of this key
Dialogue: 1,0:30:15.67,0:30:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,就拥有了控制智体的工具
Dialogue: 2,0:30:15.67,0:30:19.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,just might provide the means of controlling this Entity.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:19.75,0:30:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说各国政府会为了这把钥匙 不惜杀了我们
Dialogue: 2,0:30:19.75,0:30:23.92,Eng,,0,0,0,,Meaning every government on the planet would kill us just to get that key.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:23.92,0:30:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,包括我们自己的国家
Dialogue: 2,0:30:23.92,0:30:25.09,Eng,,0,0,0,,Including our own.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:25.09,0:30:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,一点没错
Dialogue: 2,0:30:25.09,0:30:26.26,Eng,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:26.26,0:30:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是让我们执行一个还没开始
Dialogue: 2,0:30:26.26,0:30:28.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,Putting us on an unsanctioned mission
Dialogue: 1,0:30:28.39,0:30:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,就已经万劫不复的任务
Dialogue: 2,0:30:28.39,0:30:31.01,Eng,,0,0,0,,which has gone rogue before it even started.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:31.01,0:30:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,严格来说 我们现在的对话 就已经犯了叛国罪了
Dialogue: 2,0:30:31.01,0:30:36.06,Eng,,0,0,0,,Meaning this very conversation is technically an act of treason.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:36.06,0:30:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,而这对我们来说就像…家常便饭
Dialogue: 2,0:30:36.06,0:30:39.40,Eng,,0,0,0,,Or as we like to call it, Monday.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:41.36,0:30:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,现在该怎么做
Dialogue: 2,0:30:41.36,0:30:42.73,Eng,,0,0,0,,So what's the play?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:42.73,0:30:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,有个买家会坐746号航班 从阿姆斯特丹过来 在这儿停留半小时
Dialogue: 2,0:30:42.73,0:30:46.86,Eng,,0,0,0,,A buyer's coming in on Flight 746 from Amsterdam for a 30-minute layover,
Dialogue: 1,0:30:46.86,0:30:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,并利用这段时间买下这半把钥匙
Dialogue: 2,0:30:46.86,0:30:50.12,Eng,,0,0,0,,at which time he is hoping to purchase that half of the key.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:50.12,0:30:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,所以按理说来 那个买家
Dialogue: 2,0:30:50.12,0:30:52.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,And it stands to reason the buyer will have
Dialogue: 1,0:30:52.79,0:30:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,身上一定会带着另一半钥匙
Dialogue: 2,0:30:52.79,0:30:54.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,the other half of the key somewhere on their person.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:54.83,0:30:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,因为那是检验我们这把钥匙的唯一方法
Dialogue: 2,0:30:54.83,0:30:57.92,Eng,,0,0,0,,Being the only way to authenticate our half.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:57.92,0:30:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 要怎样认出那个买家呢
Dialogue: 2,0:30:57.92,0:30:59.88,Eng,,0,0,0,,So how do we identify the buyer?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:59.88,0:31:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这个辐射计数器
Dialogue: 2,0:30:59.88,0:31:01.13,Eng,,0,0,0,,This Geiger counter
Dialogue: 1,0:31:01.13,0:31:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,可以检测到蕴藏在买家那把钥匙里的
Dialogue: 2,0:31:01.13,0:31:03.42,Eng,,0,0,0,,will detect a radiological signature of the dragon's egg
Dialogue: 1,0:31:03.42,0:31:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,放射性特征
Dialogue: 2,0:31:03.42,0:31:05.09,Eng,,0,0,0,,embedded in the buyer's key.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:05.09,0:31:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这副眼镜配有增强现实系统
Dialogue: 2,0:31:05.09,0:31:08.01,Eng,,0,0,0,,The augmented-reality overlay in these glasses
Dialogue: 1,0:31:08.01,0:31:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,能让我们找到目标
Dialogue: 2,0:31:08.01,0:31:09.64,Eng,,0,0,0,,will lead us to it.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:11.51,0:31:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,还挺厉害的
Dialogue: 2,0:31:11.51,0:31:12.97,Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's very clever.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:12.97,0:31:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 先找到那个买家 偷他的钥匙 轻松搞定
Dialogue: 2,0:31:12.97,0:31:17.10,Eng,,0,0,0,,So, you ID the buyer, pick his pockets, Bob's your uncle.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:17.10,0:31:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-不 -我说呢
Dialogue: 2,0:31:17.10,0:31:19.73,Eng,,0,0,0,,-No. -No. Of course not.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:19.73,0:31:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不知道用途 就算拿到两半钥匙也没用
Dialogue: 2,0:31:19.73,0:31:22.65,Eng,,0,0,0,,The complete key is of no value if we don't know what it unlocks.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:22.65,0:31:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 你是真的打算把我们这一半卖给他
Dialogue: 2,0:31:22.65,0:31:26.53,Eng,,0,0,0,,So you're going to sell the buyer our half of the key.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:26.53,0:31:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,而我们负责弄清楚他坐哪班航班转机
Dialogue: 2,0:31:26.53,0:31:29.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,While we figure out the buyer's connecting flight
Dialogue: 1,0:31:29.07,0:31:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,最后让你也登上那架飞机
Dialogue: 2,0:31:29.07,0:31:31.12,Eng,,0,0,0,,and book you a seat on that plane.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:31.12,0:31:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这样你就能一路跟着那把钥匙
Dialogue: 2,0:31:31.12,0:31:34.16,Eng,,0,0,0,,So you can follow the key wherever it goes.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:34.16,0:31:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你希望钥匙的最后得主会知道它的用途
Dialogue: 2,0:31:34.16,0:31:37.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,Which you hope is into the hands of someone who knows what it unlocks.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:37.50,0:31:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,正是如此
Dialogue: 2,0:31:37.50,0:31:38.46,Eng,,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:38.46,0:31:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,所以拿到完整的钥匙
Dialogue: 2,0:31:38.46,0:31:40.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,Finding the completed key
Dialogue: 1,0:31:41.58,0:31:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,仅仅是个开始
Dialogue: 2,0:31:41.58,0:31:42.88,Eng,,0,0,0,,is only the beginning.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:42.88,0:31:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这世界的命运 就看这钥匙究竟能打开什么了
Dialogue: 2,0:31:42.88,0:31:47.84,Eng,,0,0,0,,The fate of the world depends on finding whatever it unlocks.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:51.14,0:31:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙 你认识他
Dialogue: 2,0:31:51.14,0:31:53.76,Eng,,0,0,0,,This guy, you know him?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:54.89,0:31:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没有私交
Dialogue: 2,0:31:54.89,0:31:56.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,Not personally.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:56.56,0:31:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但有私人恩怨
Dialogue: 2,0:31:56.56,0:31:58.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,But it is personal.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:28.80,0:32:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 2,0:32:28.80,0:32:29.80,Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:36.22,0:32:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-等等 那是什么 -什么
Dialogue: 2,0:32:36.22,0:32:37.68,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Hey, what's that? -What?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:37.68,0:32:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,"安全警报 可疑包裹正运往威尼斯"
Dialogue: 2,0:32:37.68,0:32:40.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,Security alert. Suspicious bag on its way to Venice.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:41.31,0:32:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不见了 可能是警报器误报了
Dialogue: 2,0:32:41.31,0:32:43.52,Eng,,0,0,0,,Nope, it's gone. Must have been a false alarm.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:51.95,0:32:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,指挥部 这里是行动组 他在哪儿
Dialogue: 2,0:32:51.95,0:32:54.24,Eng,,0,0,0,,Overwatch, Snap Shot. Where's he at?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:58.20,0:32:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是指挥部 发现目标
Dialogue: 2,0:32:58.20,0:32:59.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,Snap Shot, Overwatch. I have him.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:59.95,0:33:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,2号航站楼 15号登机口 往南去了
Dialogue: 2,0:32:59.95,0:33:02.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,Terminal B, Gate 15, headed south.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:05.13,0:33:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-我可以的 -可以才怪
Dialogue: 2,0:33:05.13,0:33:06.84,Eng,,0,0,0,,-I am so. -You are not.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:07.71,0:33:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森 不如你来告诉我们的老朋友"巡网猎手"
Dialogue: 2,0:33:07.71,0:33:10.72,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ethan, would you care to explain to our friend, the Net Ranger,
Dialogue: 1,0:33:10.72,0:33:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我跟他写代码的能力不相上下
Dialogue: 2,0:33:10.72,0:33:13.01,Eng,,0,0,0,,how I am just as capable of writing code as he is?
Dialogue: 1,0:33:13.01,0:33:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我不发表意见
Dialogue: 2,0:33:13.01,0:33:13.93,Eng,,0,0,0,,No comment.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:13.93,0:33:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你觉得这位"幽灵黑客"
Dialogue: 2,0:33:13.93,0:33:15.68,Eng,,0,0,0,,What, you figure Phineas Phreak here
Dialogue: 1,0:33:15.68,0:33:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,可以单枪匹马找到除掉智体的办法
Dialogue: 2,0:33:15.68,0:33:17.93,Eng,,0,0,0,,is gonna single-handedly work out a way to kill the Entity
Dialogue: 1,0:33:17.93,0:33:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,而我只能打打下手
Dialogue: 2,0:33:17.93,0:33:19.93,Eng,,0,0,0,,while I just hold his soldering iron?
Dialogue: 1,0:33:19.93,0:33:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-有这可能 -毋庸置疑
Dialogue: 2,0:33:19.93,0:33:21.77,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Probably. -Definitely.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:22.89,0:33:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,闪开 让开
Dialogue: 2,0:33:22.89,0:33:24.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,Out of the way!
Dialogue: 1,0:33:24.90,0:33:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我他的位置
Dialogue: 2,0:33:24.90,0:33:26.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,Tell me where he is.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:26.56,0:33:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-他在哪儿 -蓝色西装 就在你前面
Dialogue: 2,0:33:26.56,0:33:29.86,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Where is he? -Blue suit. Right in front of you.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:55.59,0:33:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-不是他 -是他没错
Dialogue: 2,0:33:55.59,0:33:57.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,-It's not him. -It's him.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:57.39,0:33:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-我说了 不是他 -可我要告诉你
Dialogue: 2,0:33:57.39,0:33:59.72,Eng,,0,0,0,,-I'm telling you, it's not him. -And I'm telling you,
Dialogue: 1,0:33:59.72,0:34:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,面部识别匹配度高达…
Dialogue: 2,0:33:59.72,0:34:01.98,Eng,,0,0,0,,facial comes back with a perfect--
Dialogue: 1,0:34:05.81,0:34:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么做到的
Dialogue: 2,0:34:05.81,0:34:07.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,How did you do that?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:07.23,0:34:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么系统是"幽灵黑客"黑不进的
Dialogue: 2,0:34:07.23,0:34:10.69,Eng,,0,0,0,,No one is safe from Phineas Phreak.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:18.07,0:34:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-找到他了 -在哪儿
Dialogue: 2,0:34:18.07,0:34:19.58,Eng,,0,0,0,,-I got him! -Where is he?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:19.58,0:34:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,5号航站楼 5号登机口
Dialogue: 2,0:34:19.58,0:34:21.62,Eng,,0,0,0,,Terminal E, Gate 5.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:21.62,0:34:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 那可是机场的另一边
Dialogue: 2,0:34:21.62,0:34:24.58,Eng,,0,0,0,,Goddamn it, that's clear on the other side of the airport.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:27.29,0:34:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森 他们去5号航站楼了 你可以在这边畅行无阻了
Dialogue: 2,0:34:27.29,0:34:32.21,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ethan, they're headed to Terminal E. That side of the airport is all yours.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:33.13,0:34:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-多谢了 卢瑟 看到买家了 -看到了
Dialogue: 2,0:34:33.13,0:34:35.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Thank you, Luther. I see the buyer. -Got him.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:35.47,0:34:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫奥拓冯博克 瑞士公民
Dialogue: 2,0:34:35.47,0:34:38.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,The buyer is Otto Von Bork. Swiss national.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:38.55,0:34:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他要转机去威尼斯 30分钟后乘坐1031号航班
Dialogue: 2,0:34:38.55,0:34:43.02,Eng,,0,0,0,,He's connecting to Venice, departing in 30 minutes on Flight 1031.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:43.02,0:34:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,班吉 帮我弄张机票
Dialogue: 2,0:34:43.02,0:34:45.06,Eng,,0,0,0,,Benji, get me on that flight to Venice.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:45.06,0:34:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题 飞往威尼斯的1031号航班 稍等
Dialogue: 2,0:34:45.06,0:34:47.65,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yep, Flight 1031 to Venice. Stand by.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:00.16,0:35:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森 出什么事了
Dialogue: 2,0:35:00.16,0:35:01.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ethan, what just happened?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:01.91,0:35:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-他被人撞了 -撞了 什么叫被人撞了
Dialogue: 2,0:35:01.91,0:35:04.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,-He was bumped. -Bumped? What do you mean, bumped?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:04.83,0:35:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那个女的是个扒手 盯着她 告诉我她是谁
Dialogue: 2,0:35:04.83,0:35:08.12,Eng,,0,0,0,,That woman picked his pocket. Tag her. Tell me who she is.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:17.05,0:35:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,卢瑟 关掉对讲
Dialogue: 2,0:35:17.05,0:35:18.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,Luther, mute our comms.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:19.01,0:35:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-怎么了 -那个包是1031号航班的
Dialogue: 2,0:35:19.01,0:35:21.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,-What is it? -That bag was on its way to Flight 1031.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:21.39,0:35:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,什么包
Dialogue: 2,0:35:21.39,0:35:22.68,Eng,,0,0,0,,What bag?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:22.68,0:35:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,就是几分钟前那个警报 那个可疑的包
Dialogue: 2,0:35:22.68,0:35:25.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,There was a suspicious bag alert a few minutes ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:25.27,0:35:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-这包怎么了 -它当时在运往1031的传送带上
Dialogue: 2,0:35:25.27,0:35:28.14,Eng,,0,0,0,,-So what about it? -It was on its way to Flight 1031.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:28.14,0:35:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,去威尼斯的 是那个买家的航班 也是伊森的航班
Dialogue: 2,0:35:28.14,0:35:31.52,Eng,,0,0,0,,To Venice. It's the buyer's plane. It's Ethan's plane.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:32.11,0:35:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,卢瑟 收到没 她什么来头
Dialogue: 2,0:35:32.11,0:35:33.98,Eng,,0,0,0,,Luther, do you copy? Who is she?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:33.98,0:35:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,如果刚才不是误报
Dialogue: 2,0:35:33.98,0:35:35.69,Eng,,0,0,0,,What if it wasn't a false alarm?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:35.69,0:35:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是有人想在那飞机上放一个炸弹呢
Dialogue: 2,0:35:35.69,0:35:37.82,Eng,,0,0,0,,What if somebody's trying to smuggle a bomb onto that plane?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:37.82,0:35:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,也可能是智体故意想让我们这么想 为了阻止伊森上飞机
Dialogue: 2,0:35:37.82,0:35:41.66,Eng,,0,0,0,,And what if that's what the Entity wants us to think to keep Ethan off that plane?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:41.66,0:35:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-卢瑟 出什么事了 -要跟他说吗
Dialogue: 2,0:35:41.66,0:35:43.70,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Luther, what's happening? -Should we warn him?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:44.29,0:35:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-先别说 -伙计们 能听到我说话吗
Dialogue: 2,0:35:44.29,0:35:46.45,Eng,,0,0,0,,-No. -Guys, guys? You hear me?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:46.45,0:35:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,去找那个包 我告诉你在哪儿 快去
Dialogue: 2,0:35:46.45,0:35:49.21,Eng,,0,0,0,,Find that bag. I'll direct you. Go.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:49.21,0:35:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,卢瑟 告诉我是不是出事了
Dialogue: 2,0:35:49.21,0:35:51.58,Eng,,0,0,0,,Luther, just tell me, is there something wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:51.58,0:35:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不必担心 都在控制之中
Dialogue: 2,0:35:51.58,0:35:54.96,Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing to worry about. It's under control.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:54.96,0:35:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,找到她了
Dialogue: 2,0:35:54.96,0:35:55.96,Eng,,0,0,0,,Got her.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:55.96,0:35:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那女的的信息 传过去了
Dialogue: 2,0:35:55.96,0:35:59.30,Eng,,0,0,0,,Info on the woman is coming… now.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:01.80,0:36:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不管这女的是谁 她绝不是一个间谍
Dialogue: 2,0:36:01.80,0:36:05.60,Eng,,0,0,0,,Whoever she is, she's no spy.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:05.60,0:36:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,她是个小偷
Dialogue: 2,0:36:05.60,0:36:07.68,Eng,,0,0,0,,She's a thief.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:07.68,0:36:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么走 卢瑟
Dialogue: 2,0:36:07.68,0:36:09.10,Eng,,0,0,0,,Where am I going, Luther?
Dialogue: 1,0:36:09.10,0:36:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,班吉 在你左边有一扇大门
Dialogue: 2,0:36:09.10,0:36:11.40,Eng,,0,0,0,,Benji, there's a door on your immediate left.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:12.11,0:36:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在给你解锁
Dialogue: 2,0:36:12.11,0:36:13.94,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm unlocking it now.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:17.48,0:36:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那个包在01833号传送带上
Dialogue: 2,0:36:17.48,0:36:20.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,The bag you're after is on tray 01833
Dialogue: 1,0:36:20.66,0:36:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,正在向西北角移动
Dialogue: 2,0:36:20.66,0:36:23.58,Eng,,0,0,0,,heading towards the northwest corner of the facility.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:23.58,0:36:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 2,0:36:23.58,0:36:24.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,Copy that!
Dialogue: 1,0:36:35.80,0:36:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 2,0:36:35.80,0:36:36.80,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:39.01,0:36:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你好啊
Dialogue: 2,0:36:39.01,0:36:40.26,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:44.39,0:36:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂了
Dialogue: 2,0:36:44.39,0:36:45.72,Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:46.47,0:36:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你认错人了
Dialogue: 2,0:36:46.47,0:36:48.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,You thought I was someone else.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:50.31,0:36:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我对这套没兴趣
Dialogue: 2,0:36:50.31,0:36:51.64,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not interested.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:53.23,0:36:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,给我个机会
Dialogue: 2,0:36:53.23,0:36:54.65,Eng,,0,0,0,,Give me a chance.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:55.32,0:36:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我要叫了哦
Dialogue: 2,0:36:55.32,0:36:56.32,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll scream.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:58.15,0:36:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,请随意
Dialogue: 2,0:36:58.15,0:36:59.40,Eng,,0,0,0,,Please do.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:02.53,0:37:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底想干吗
Dialogue: 2,0:37:02.53,0:37:03.82,Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 1,0:37:05.03,0:37:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这把钥匙
Dialogue: 2,0:37:05.03,0:37:06.20,Eng,,0,0,0,,This key.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:08.12,0:37:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是你从那个人的口袋里偷来的
Dialogue: 2,0:37:08.12,0:37:10.41,Eng,,0,0,0,,The one you picked from that man's pocket.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:10.41,0:37:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,它一文不值
Dialogue: 2,0:37:10.41,0:37:11.92,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's worthless
Dialogue: 1,0:37:11.92,0:37:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,如果没有它的话
Dialogue: 2,0:37:11.92,0:37:13.04,Eng,,0,0,0,,without this key.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:15.29,0:37:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但放在一起
Dialogue: 2,0:37:15.29,0:37:16.92,Eng,,0,0,0,,But together
Dialogue: 1,0:37:16.92,0:37:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,它们就价值U盘里的
Dialogue: 2,0:37:16.92,0:37:18.76,Eng,,0,0,0,,they're worth four million in cryptocurrency
Dialogue: 1,0:37:18.76,0:37:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,400万数字货币
Dialogue: 2,0:37:18.76,0:37:20.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,that man was carrying on a flash drive.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:22.43,0:37:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我对此一无所知
Dialogue: 2,0:37:22.43,0:37:24.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I wouldn't know anything about that.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:24.43,0:37:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那这U盘为什么会在你口袋里
Dialogue: 2,0:37:24.43,0:37:26.10,Eng,,0,0,0,,Then why was this drive in your pocket?
Dialogue: 1,0:37:27.76,0:37:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底是谁
Dialogue: 2,0:37:27.76,0:37:29.52,Eng,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:37:29.52,0:37:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你有同伴吗
Dialogue: 2,0:37:29.52,0:37:31.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,You working with someone?
Dialogue: 1,0:37:31.81,0:37:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,从来没有 我向来喜欢单干
Dialogue: 2,0:37:31.81,0:37:34.40,Eng,,0,0,0,,Never. I'm strictly single-0.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:34.40,0:37:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,今天你有了
Dialogue: 2,0:37:34.40,0:37:36.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,Today you got a partner.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:36.11,0:37:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要这U盘的原主人
Dialogue: 2,0:37:36.11,0:37:37.40,Eng,,0,0,0,,I need the man you stole this from
Dialogue: 1,0:37:37.40,0:37:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,完成一笔交易 并带着它们离开
Dialogue: 2,0:37:37.40,0:37:40.49,Eng,,0,0,0,,to complete a transaction and leave this airport with both of these
Dialogue: 1,0:37:40.49,0:37:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,而且不能让他知道自己被偷了
Dialogue: 2,0:37:40.49,0:37:42.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,without ever knowing his pocket was picked
Dialogue: 1,0:37:42.15,0:37:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,现在距离他登机还有…
Dialogue: 2,0:37:42.15,0:37:43.49,Eng,,0,0,0,,and before he boards his flight in--
Dialogue: 1,0:37:43.49,0:37:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-7分钟 -7分钟
Dialogue: 2,0:37:43.49,0:37:46.12,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Seven minutes. -Seven minutes.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:46.91,0:37:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,偷东西你是个好手
Dialogue: 2,0:37:46.91,0:37:49.37,Eng,,0,0,0,,We both know you're a good pickpocket.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:49.37,0:37:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你还东西的本事吧
Dialogue: 2,0:37:49.37,0:37:51.37,Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's see what kind of put-pocket you are.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:53.21,0:37:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你是想让我把它放回去
Dialogue: 2,0:37:53.21,0:37:55.88,Eng,,0,0,0,,You expect me to put it back.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:55.88,0:37:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你会的
Dialogue: 2,0:37:55.88,0:37:58.00,Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know you will.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:58.00,0:38:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个小偷 你只想要钱
Dialogue: 2,0:37:58.00,0:38:00.42,Eng,,0,0,0,,You're a thief. You want the money.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:00.42,0:38:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,而钱我可以给你
Dialogue: 2,0:38:00.42,0:38:02.30,Eng,,0,0,0,,And I can give it to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:03.05,0:38:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己选吧 干还是不干
Dialogue: 2,0:38:03.05,0:38:06.68,Eng,,0,0,0,,Your choice. You're in or you're out.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:09.22,0:38:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 2,0:38:09.22,0:38:10.72,Eng,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:10.72,0:38:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,要怎么做
Dialogue: 2,0:38:10.72,0:38:11.89,Eng,,0,0,0,,So what's the play?
Dialogue: 1,0:38:11.89,0:38:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好知道自己在干什么
Dialogue: 2,0:38:11.89,0:38:14.02,Eng,,0,0,0,,I sure hope you know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:14.69,0:38:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,女士先请
Dialogue: 2,0:38:14.69,0:38:15.98,Eng,,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:17.94,0:38:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 我不需要这个
Dialogue: 2,0:38:17.94,0:38:20.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, I won't be needing this.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:20.48,0:38:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我不抽烟
Dialogue: 2,0:38:20.48,0:38:22.53,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't smoke.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:23.40,0:38:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,留着吧 当是纪念我们的相识
Dialogue: 2,0:38:23.40,0:38:25.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,Keep it. Something to remember me by.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:31.62,0:38:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森 她从那个买家那儿 偷来的那把钥匙匹配不上
Dialogue: 2,0:38:31.62,0:38:35.96,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ethan, the alloy in that key she took off the buyer doesn't match.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:35.96,0:38:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-是把假的 -我早就猜到了
Dialogue: 2,0:38:35.96,0:38:38.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,-It's counterfeit. -I expect nothing less.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:38.71,0:38:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们的目标不变 还是得让他带着两把钥匙离开
Dialogue: 2,0:38:38.71,0:38:41.96,Eng,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't change our objective. The buyer has to leave with both keys.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:41.96,0:38:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,说话啊 卢瑟 我该往哪儿走
Dialogue: 2,0:38:41.96,0:38:43.92,Eng,,0,0,0,,Talk to me, Luther! Where am I going?
Dialogue: 1,0:38:43.92,0:38:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,班吉 顺着前面的楼梯往下走
Dialogue: 2,0:38:43.92,0:38:45.93,Eng,,0,0,0,,Benji, head down the stairs in front of you
Dialogue: 1,0:38:45.93,0:38:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,包应该就在那里
Dialogue: 2,0:38:45.93,0:38:47.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,and the bag should be right there.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:47.39,0:38:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我到了
Dialogue: 2,0:38:47.39,0:38:49.01,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'm there. I'm there.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:54.43,0:38:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是他了
Dialogue: 2,0:38:54.43,0:38:55.69,Eng,,0,0,0,,That's him.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:55.69,0:38:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,就在你前面
Dialogue: 2,0:38:55.69,0:38:57.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,Right in front of you.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:58.81,0:39:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,别激动 嘿 抱歉 我们认错人了
Dialogue: 2,0:38:58.81,0:39:02.28,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay. Hey, sorry. Thought you were somebody else.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:03.99,0:39:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,亨特在耍我们
Dialogue: 2,0:39:03.99,0:39:05.90,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hunt's jerking our chain.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:06.57,0:39:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人都有 两人一组 分头找
Dialogue: 2,0:39:06.57,0:39:09.41,Eng,,0,0,0,,Everybody! Two-man teams, spread out.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:09.41,0:39:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森 我们的美国朋友好像开窍了
Dialogue: 2,0:39:09.41,0:39:12.45,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ethan, our American friends are getting wise.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:12.45,0:39:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他们开始分头搜索机场了
Dialogue: 2,0:39:12.45,0:39:14.08,Eng,,0,0,0,,They're breaking up and canvassing the airport.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:14.08,0:39:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你要保持警惕了
Dialogue: 2,0:39:14.08,0:39:15.58,Eng,,0,0,0,,Keep your eyes peeled.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:15.58,0:39:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,该怎么称呼你
Dialogue: 2,0:39:15.58,0:39:17.37,Eng,,0,0,0,,So, what do I call you?
Dialogue: 1,0:39:17.37,0:39:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,叫我格蕾丝吧 你呢
Dialogue: 2,0:39:17.37,0:39:19.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,How about Grace? And you?
Dialogue: 1,0:39:19.83,0:39:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,听好了 格蕾丝
Dialogue: 2,0:39:19.83,0:39:21.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, listen, Grace.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:21.75,0:39:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这里不止我一个对钥匙感兴趣
Dialogue: 2,0:39:21.75,0:39:23.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,You should know we're not the only interested party.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:23.55,0:39:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,一会儿如果我让你跑 你就快跑
Dialogue: 2,0:39:23.55,0:39:25.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,If I tell you to run, you run.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:25.51,0:39:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,跑
Dialogue: 2,0:39:25.51,0:39:26.97,Eng,,0,0,0,,Run?
Dialogue: 1,0:39:26.97,0:39:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,越来越刺激了
Dialogue: 2,0:39:26.97,0:39:28.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,This is getting exciting.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:29.14,0:39:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,班吉 找到包了吗
Dialogue: 2,0:39:29.14,0:39:30.68,Eng,,0,0,0,,Benji, have you got that bag?
Dialogue: 1,0:39:30.68,0:39:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 2,0:39:30.68,0:39:32.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,I found it!
Dialogue: 1,0:39:45.86,0:39:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,包里面装着一个圆柱形装置 我现在把它拿出来
Dialogue: 2,0:39:45.86,0:39:49.82,Eng,,0,0,0,,There's a cylindrical device inside. I'm gonna take it out.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:54.12,0:39:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,情况如何 卢瑟
Dialogue: 2,0:39:54.12,0:39:55.08,Eng,,0,0,0,,How we doing, Luther?
Dialogue: 1,0:39:55.66,0:39:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森 买家就在你上方的候机区
Dialogue: 2,0:39:55.66,0:39:58.12,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ethan, the buyer's in the waiting area above you.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:58.12,0:40:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,扶梯最上面就是
Dialogue: 2,0:39:58.12,0:40:00.04,Eng,,0,0,0,,Top of the escalator.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:02.09,0:40:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,所有特工都在朝你这边过来
Dialogue: 2,0:40:02.09,0:40:03.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,All units are headed in your direction.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:03.75,0:40:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他们随时可能会朝你这边扑过来
Dialogue: 2,0:40:03.75,0:40:06.84,Eng,,0,0,0,,Your location is going to be crawling with agents anytime now.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:16.60,0:40:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不管它是什么 我好像把它激活了
Dialogue: 2,0:40:16.60,0:40:18.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, I've just activated it.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:21.02,0:40:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,上面显示只有五分钟时间
Dialogue: 2,0:40:21.02,0:40:23.02,Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like we have five minutes.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:25.28,0:40:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-看上去像是个核弹 -有多大
Dialogue: 2,0:40:25.28,0:40:27.44,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Also, it appears to be nuclear. -How big?
Dialogue: 1,0:40:27.44,0:40:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,大到足够摧毁整个飞机场了
Dialogue: 2,0:40:27.44,0:40:29.49,Eng,,0,0,0,,Big enough to matter to everybody in this airport, I suspect.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:29.49,0:40:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-你能拆掉它吗 -可我没有工具啊
Dialogue: 2,0:40:29.49,0:40:32.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Can you disarm it? -I haven't got any tools!
Dialogue: 1,0:40:32.03,0:40:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-那就去找啊 -你让我上哪儿去…
Dialogue: 2,0:40:32.03,0:40:34.28,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Then find some. -Where am I gonna find--
Dialogue: 1,0:40:58.47,0:41:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就要跑吗
Dialogue: 2,0:40:58.47,0:41:00.14,Eng,,0,0,0,,Is this where we run?
Dialogue: 1,0:41:00.85,0:41:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,暂时不用
Dialogue: 2,0:41:00.85,0:41:01.69,Eng,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:02.65,0:41:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,班吉 炸弹拆得怎么样了
Dialogue: 2,0:41:02.65,0:41:04.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,Benji, how are you doing with that bomb?
Dialogue: 1,0:41:04.48,0:41:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 2,0:41:04.48,0:41:05.57,Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:07.32,0:41:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,打开了
Dialogue: 2,0:41:07.32,0:41:08.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 1,0:41:08.78,0:41:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个柱形密码锁 一共有八个转盘
Dialogue: 2,0:41:08.78,0:41:12.57,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a cylinder cypher. There's eight wheels.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:12.57,0:41:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,看样子每个转盘上有14个字母
Dialogue: 2,0:41:12.57,0:41:14.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like 14 letters on each wheel.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:14.78,0:41:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的话 整整有15亿种组合
Dialogue: 2,0:41:14.78,0:41:17.49,Eng,,0,0,0,,1.5 billion possible combinations.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:17.49,0:41:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多吧
Dialogue: 2,0:41:17.49,0:41:18.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,Give or take.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:20.16,0:41:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天
Dialogue: 2,0:41:20.16,0:41:21.33,Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:21.33,0:41:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,又怎么了
Dialogue: 2,0:41:21.33,0:41:23.04,Eng,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 1,0:41:23.04,0:41:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,转盘上的字母拼出了一条信息
Dialogue: 2,0:41:23.04,0:41:25.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,The wheels--They spell out a message.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:25.50,0:41:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,U.R.DUNN
Dialogue: 2,0:41:25.50,0:41:27.17,Eng,,0,0,0,,U.R.DUNN.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:27.17,0:41:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能 我们绝不会的
Dialogue: 2,0:41:27.17,0:41:28.88,Eng,,0,0,0,,No way. Not yet, we aren't.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:28.88,0:41:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不 卢瑟 不是D-O-N-E
Dialogue: 2,0:41:28.88,0:41:30.84,Eng,,0,0,0,,No, Luther, not D-O-N-E.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:30.84,0:41:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是D-U-N-N
Dialogue: 2,0:41:30.84,0:41:33.34,Eng,,0,0,0,,D-U-N-N.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:33.34,0:41:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的姓氏
Dialogue: 2,0:41:33.34,0:41:35.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's my last name.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:39.39,0:41:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,它知道我是谁
Dialogue: 2,0:41:39.39,0:41:40.89,Eng,,0,0,0,,It knows who I am.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:53.74,0:41:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,等下 显示屏上有条消息
Dialogue: 2,0:41:53.74,0:41:55.45,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold on. There's a message on the display.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:56.07,0:42:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,"我无口却能言 无翼却能飞 我是什么 "
Dialogue: 2,0:41:56.07,0:42:00.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,"I speak without a mouth, I fly through the air without wings. What am I?"
Dialogue: 1,0:42:00.50,0:42:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你问的什么问题
Dialogue: 2,0:42:00.50,0:42:01.70,Eng,,0,0,0,,You got me. What?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:01.70,0:42:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个谜语 我估计这东西是声控的
Dialogue: 2,0:42:01.70,0:42:04.29,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a riddle. I suspect this thing is voice-activated.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:04.29,0:42:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,它想让我把答案说出来
Dialogue: 2,0:42:04.29,0:42:05.54,Eng,,0,0,0,,It wants me to say the answer.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:05.54,0:42:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,"我无翼却能飞"
Dialogue: 2,0:42:05.54,0:42:07.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,"I fly through the air…"
Dialogue: 1,0:42:08.38,0:42:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是回声
Dialogue: 2,0:42:08.38,0:42:09.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,An echo!
Dialogue: 1,0:42:09.55,0:42:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,答对了
Dialogue: 2,0:42:09.55,0:42:11.26,Eng,,0,0,0,,That's it! That's it!
Dialogue: 1,0:42:11.26,0:42:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 新问题
Dialogue: 2,0:42:11.26,0:42:12.72,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, new message.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:12.72,0:42:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,"你怕不怕死 "
Dialogue: 2,0:42:12.72,0:42:15.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,"Are you afraid of death?"
Dialogue: 1,0:42:15.39,0:42:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-这算哪门子谜语 -这不是谜语
Dialogue: 2,0:42:15.39,0:42:17.68,Eng,,0,0,0,,-What kind of a riddle is that? -It's not a riddle.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:17.68,0:42:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这是心理计量测试
Dialogue: 2,0:42:17.68,0:42:19.93,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a psychometric test.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:19.93,0:42:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你回答得越多 它就越了解你
Dialogue: 2,0:42:19.93,0:42:23.69,Eng,,0,0,0,,The more questions you answer, the more it'll know about you.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:23.69,0:42:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,"你怕不怕死" 不怕
Dialogue: 2,0:42:23.69,0:42:25.69,Eng,,0,0,0,,"Are you afraid of death?" No!
Dialogue: 1,0:42:26.98,0:42:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-有用吗 -我撒谎了 被识破了
Dialogue: 2,0:42:26.98,0:42:29.98,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Did it work? -I lied. It knows.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:29.98,0:42:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,跟它说实话吧 快点
Dialogue: 2,0:42:29.98,0:42:32.32,Eng,,0,0,0,,Just tell it the truth. Say it.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:32.32,0:42:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,"你怕不怕死" 废话 有谁不怕
Dialogue: 2,0:42:32.32,0:42:35.20,Eng,,0,0,0,,"Are you afraid of death?" Yes! Who isn't?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:45.12,0:42:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,"什么东西一直在接近 却从未到达 "
Dialogue: 2,0:42:45.12,0:42:48.92,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay. "What's always approaching but never arrives?"
Dialogue: 1,0:42:48.92,0:42:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 这题我好像听过
Dialogue: 2,0:42:48.92,0:42:50.21,Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait, I know this one.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:50.21,0:42:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,倒计时还在继续 卢瑟
Dialogue: 2,0:42:50.21,0:42:51.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,The clock is ticking, Luther.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:51.71,0:42:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,猜谜不是我的强项 你催我也没用
Dialogue: 2,0:42:51.71,0:42:53.80,Eng,,0,0,0,,Riddles aren't my thing, Benji. What more can I say?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:53.80,0:42:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,快没时间了
Dialogue: 2,0:42:53.80,0:42:55.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,We're running out of time!
Dialogue: 1,0:42:56.13,0:42:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他在那儿
Dialogue: 2,0:42:56.13,0:42:57.68,Eng,,0,0,0,,There he is.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:57.68,0:42:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,也太容易了吧
Dialogue: 2,0:42:57.68,0:42:59.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is too easy.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:59.43,0:43:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰一下 伊森
Dialogue: 2,0:42:59.43,0:43:01.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you, Ethan.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:01.35,0:43:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道什么东西一直在接近
Dialogue: 2,0:43:01.35,0:43:04.14,Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you happen to know what's always approaching
Dialogue: 1,0:43:04.68,0:43:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,却从未到达吗
Dialogue: 2,0:43:04.68,0:43:06.14,Eng,,0,0,0,,but never arrives?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:06.14,0:43:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,"什么东西一直在接近 却从未到达"
Dialogue: 2,0:43:06.14,0:43:08.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,What is always approaching but never arrives?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:08.56,0:43:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,明天
Dialogue: 2,0:43:08.56,0:43:09.69,Eng,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:10.36,0:43:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 2,0:43:10.36,0:43:11.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:11.19,0:43:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,一直在接近却从未到达 是明天
Dialogue: 2,0:43:11.19,0:43:13.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,Always approaching but never arrives. Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:14.86,0:43:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-是明天 -明天
Dialogue: 2,0:43:14.86,0:43:16.24,Eng,,0,0,0,,-It's tomorrow. -Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:16.24,0:43:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,对 没错 是明天
Dialogue: 2,0:43:16.24,0:43:17.86,Eng,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow! Tomorrow!
Dialogue: 1,0:43:17.86,0:43:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 好了 下一个问题
Dialogue: 2,0:43:17.86,0:43:19.57,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes! Okay, next question.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:19.57,0:43:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,把东西给我
Dialogue: 2,0:43:19.57,0:43:20.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,Give me the goods.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:21.66,0:43:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-我会盯着你的 -怎么 不相信我吗
Dialogue: 2,0:43:21.66,0:43:24.12,Eng,,0,0,0,,-I'll be watching. -You don't trust me?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:30.08,0:43:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,卢瑟 出什么事了
Dialogue: 2,0:43:30.08,0:43:31.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,Luther, what is happening?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:31.59,0:43:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么可担心的 所有事都在掌控之中
Dialogue: 2,0:43:31.59,0:43:35.09,Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing to worry about. Everything is under control.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:35.09,0:43:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 下一个问题
Dialogue: 2,0:43:35.09,0:43:36.01,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, next question.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:36.01,0:43:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,"谁或者什么对你来说最为重要 "
Dialogue: 2,0:43:36.01,0:43:39.05,Eng,,0,0,0,,"Who or what is the most important thing to you?"
Dialogue: 1,0:43:39.05,0:43:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉它
Dialogue: 2,0:43:39.05,0:43:40.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,Say it.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:40.35,0:43:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-可如果我… -我们别无选择 告诉它
Dialogue: 2,0:43:40.35,0:43:42.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,-But if I---There's no other choice. Say it.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:43.35,0:43:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我的朋友们
Dialogue: 2,0:43:43.35,0:43:44.85,Eng,,0,0,0,,My friends.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:45.77,0:43:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,真是可恶
Dialogue: 2,0:43:45.77,0:43:46.60,Eng,,0,0,0,,Bastard.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:58.36,0:44:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-他这是… -没错 他死了
Dialogue: 2,0:43:58.36,0:44:00.37,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Is he---Yes, he is.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:00.37,0:44:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,把钱和钥匙都给我
Dialogue: 2,0:44:00.37,0:44:02.37,Eng,,0,0,0,,Give me the money, give me the key.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:03.33,0:44:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 下一题 "什么东西 你带走越多它就越大 "
Dialogue: 2,0:44:03.33,0:44:06.08,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay. "What gets bigger the more you take away?"
Dialogue: 1,0:44:06.08,0:44:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-是坑 -是坑 聪明 没错
Dialogue: 2,0:44:06.08,0:44:08.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,-A hole. -A hole. Brilliant!
Dialogue: 1,0:44:20.72,0:44:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,没有问题了 可还剩一个转盘
Dialogue: 2,0:44:20.72,0:44:22.30,Eng,,0,0,0,,I've got no more questions and there's one more wheel.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:22.30,0:44:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,连问题都没有 我要怎么给出答案
Dialogue: 2,0:44:22.30,0:44:24.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to give answers if I've got no questions?
Dialogue: 1,0:44:24.56,0:44:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那一定就是最后的考验
Dialogue: 2,0:44:24.56,0:44:26.06,Eng,,0,0,0,,That must be your final test.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:26.06,0:44:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,只剩45秒了
Dialogue: 2,0:44:26.06,0:44:27.89,Eng,,0,0,0,,I've got 45 seconds!
Dialogue: 1,0:44:31.23,0:44:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,现在怎么办
Dialogue: 2,0:44:31.23,0:44:32.61,Eng,,0,0,0,,What happens now?
Dialogue: 1,0:44:32.61,0:44:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在想 别乱动
Dialogue: 2,0:44:32.61,0:44:34.73,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking. Don't move.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:34.73,0:44:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,卢瑟 我被包围了 需要一条出路 该往哪里走
Dialogue: 2,0:44:34.73,0:44:37.36,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm pinned down. Need a way out of here. Where am I going?
Dialogue: 1,0:44:37.36,0:44:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,有个更严峻的问题 伊森
Dialogue: 2,0:44:37.36,0:44:38.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,We have a bigger problem, Ethan.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:38.78,0:44:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,可能今天没人能离开这里了
Dialogue: 2,0:44:38.78,0:44:40.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's very possible no one is getting out of here.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:40.95,0:44:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 2,0:44:40.95,0:44:41.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:44:41.87,0:44:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,行李传送处有个炸弹 是小型核弹
Dialogue: 2,0:44:41.87,0:44:44.70,Eng,,0,0,0,,There's a bomb in baggage handling. A nuclear bomb.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:44.70,0:44:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才问你的那个问题是拆弹所需的密码
Dialogue: 2,0:44:44.70,0:44:47.33,Eng,,0,0,0,,The question I asked you is part of the code for disarming it.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:47.33,0:44:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 你先等一下
Dialogue: 2,0:44:47.33,0:44:48.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,Stop, stop, stop!
Dialogue: 1,0:44:51.00,0:44:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不早告诉我
Dialogue: 2,0:44:51.00,0:44:52.08,Eng,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me this?
Dialogue: 1,0:44:52.08,0:44:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你要处理的事够多了 我们不想打扰你
Dialogue: 2,0:44:52.08,0:44:54.34,Eng,,0,0,0,,You had a lot going on. We didn't want to bother you.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:54.34,0:44:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 发现核弹这种事 你们应该第一时间告诉我
Dialogue: 2,0:44:54.34,0:44:58.21,Eng,,0,0,0,,Listen to me. A nuclear bomb is something you bother me with immediately.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:58.21,0:44:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-还有多少时间 -还剩二十秒
Dialogue: 2,0:44:58.21,0:44:59.76,Eng,,0,0,0,,-How much time? -Twenty seconds.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:00.55,0:45:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,二十秒
Dialogue: 2,0:45:00.55,0:45:01.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,Twenty seconds?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:01.59,0:45:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 还有一个谜语 我还在想 最后十五秒
Dialogue: 2,0:45:01.59,0:45:04.01,Eng,,0,0,0,,There's one more riddle. I'm working on it. Fifteen seconds!
Dialogue: 1,0:45:04.01,0:45:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,别急 什么谜语
Dialogue: 2,0:45:04.01,0:45:06.10,Eng,,0,0,0,,Easy, easy. What's the riddle?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:06.10,0:45:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,没等我给你解释完 我们就被炸飞了
Dialogue: 2,0:45:06.10,0:45:08.22,Eng,,0,0,0,,In the time it takes me to explain, we'll all be dead!
Dialogue: 1,0:45:08.22,0:45:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样 班吉
Dialogue: 2,0:45:08.22,0:45:09.14,Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, Benji.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:09.14,0:45:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么我们总会弄成这样
Dialogue: 2,0:45:09.14,0:45:11.10,Eng,,0,0,0,,Why do we always end up in these situations?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:11.10,0:45:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,还剩十秒
Dialogue: 2,0:45:11.10,0:45:12.65,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ten seconds.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:12.65,0:45:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,九 八
Dialogue: 2,0:45:12.65,0:45:14.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,Nine… eight…
Dialogue: 1,0:45:14.27,0:45:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,七 六 五
Dialogue: 2,0:45:14.27,0:45:17.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,seven… six… five…
Dialogue: 1,0:45:28.83,0:45:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天
Dialogue: 2,0:45:28.83,0:45:30.00,Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:30.00,0:45:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 2,0:45:30.00,0:45:30.96,Eng,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:32.79,0:45:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-是空的 -什么叫是空的
Dialogue: 2,0:45:32.79,0:45:35.13,Eng,,0,0,0,,-It's empty. -What do you mean, empty?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:35.13,0:45:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,里面什么都没有
Dialogue: 2,0:45:35.13,0:45:36.54,Eng,,0,0,0,,There's nothing inside.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:42.01,0:45:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,她偷走了钥匙
Dialogue: 2,0:45:42.01,0:45:42.93,Eng,,0,0,0,,She took the key.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:42.93,0:45:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-哪把 -我们那把 真的那把
Dialogue: 2,0:45:42.93,0:45:45.01,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Which key? -Our key. The real key.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:45.01,0:45:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么 -卢瑟 快找到她
Dialogue: 2,0:45:45.01,0:45:46.05,Eng,,0,0,0,,-What? -Luther, find her.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:56.48,0:45:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了 她往5号航站楼去了
Dialogue: 2,0:45:56.48,0:45:58.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,I got her. She's headed for Terminal E.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:10.58,0:46:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-这不可能 -怎么了
Dialogue: 2,0:46:10.58,0:46:12.54,Eng,,0,0,0,,-No, it can't be. -What is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:46:13.08,0:46:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,卢瑟 班吉 中止行动 快走
Dialogue: 2,0:46:13.08,0:46:14.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,Luther, Benji. Abort. Get out!
Dialogue: 1,0:46:14.67,0:46:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-要去哪里会合 -不会合了
Dialogue: 2,0:46:14.67,0:46:16.88,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Where do we rendezvous? -We don't!
Dialogue: 1,0:46:16.88,0:46:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这次任务彻底终止 赶紧离开这里
Dialogue: 2,0:46:16.88,0:46:19.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,This mission is terminated. Get out now.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:31.18,0:46:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,亨特 嘿 给我站住 嘿
Dialogue: 2,0:46:31.18,0:46:33.94,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hunt! Stop right there!
Dialogue: 1,0:46:33.94,0:46:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,看到他没 去哪儿了
Dialogue: 2,0:46:33.94,0:46:35.85,Eng,,0,0,0,,You see him? Where is he?
Dialogue: 1,0:46:35.85,0:46:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,请让让
Dialogue: 2,0:46:35.85,0:46:37.73,Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me! Excuse me!
Dialogue: 1,0:46:37.73,0:46:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 2,0:46:37.73,0:46:40.02,Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry! Sorry! Sorry!
Dialogue: 1,0:47:17.73,0:47:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-快让开 -别挡道
Dialogue: 2,0:47:17.73,0:47:19.69,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Move! -Move, move!
Dialogue: 1,0:48:01.81,0:48:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他一定就在附近
Dialogue: 2,0:48:01.81,0:48:03.82,Eng,,0,0,0,,He's got to be here somewhere.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:05.11,0:48:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,真是该死
Dialogue: 2,0:48:05.11,0:48:06.90,Eng,,0,0,0,,Goddamn.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:17.46,0:48:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这里采用的是短波无线
Dialogue: 2,0:48:17.46,0:48:20.04,Eng,,0,0,0,,What we have here is shortwave radio,
Dialogue: 1,0:48:20.04,0:48:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,电磁音频记录 以及阴极射线管显示器
Dialogue: 2,0:48:20.04,0:48:24.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,magnetic audio recording, cathode ray tube monitors.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:24.67,0:48:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不再依靠计算机运行
Dialogue: 2,0:48:24.67,0:48:27.38,Eng,,0,0,0,,No more ones and zeros.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:27.38,0:48:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,完全靠模拟信号来运行的线下安全屋
Dialogue: 2,0:48:27.38,0:48:30.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a fully analog, offline safe room,
Dialogue: 1,0:48:30.39,0:48:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,可以抵御靠数字化运行的智体
Dialogue: 2,0:48:30.39,0:48:33.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,shielded from our digitally-based Entity.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:34.68,0:48:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那信号要怎么传输进来
Dialogue: 2,0:48:34.68,0:48:36.60,Eng,,0,0,0,,Where is this feed coming from?
Dialogue: 1,0:48:36.60,0:48:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,靠冷战时期的科罗娜间谍卫星
Dialogue: 2,0:48:36.60,0:48:39.85,Eng,,0,0,0,,CORONA spy satellite from the Cold War.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:40.56,0:48:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我都不知道我们还在用那些老古董
Dialogue: 2,0:48:40.56,0:48:42.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,Had no idea we were still using those things.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:42.48,0:48:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,确实很久没用了
Dialogue: 2,0:48:42.48,0:48:44.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, we weren't.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:44.23,0:48:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,二十年前我们把它给了国家气象局
Dialogue: 2,0:48:44.23,0:48:46.53,Eng,,0,0,0,,Gave them to the National Weather Service 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:46.53,0:48:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这是最后一个还能用的
Dialogue: 2,0:48:46.53,0:48:48.70,Eng,,0,0,0,,This is the last one still functioning.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:48.70,0:48:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那这东西能帮我们找到你那位 神秘的碟中谍特工吗
Dialogue: 2,0:48:48.70,0:48:52.82,Eng,,0,0,0,,So, will this thing help us find your nameless IMF man?
Dialogue: 1,0:48:52.82,0:48:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这点恐怕无能为力 长官
Dialogue: 2,0:48:52.82,0:48:54.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing can do that, sir.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:54.87,0:48:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不过它可以帮我们监视这个女人
Dialogue: 2,0:48:54.87,0:48:58.58,Eng,,0,0,0,,But it has allowed us to keep tabs on this woman.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:00.46,0:49:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们发现他们俩在阿布扎比机场有过接触
Dialogue: 2,0:49:00.46,0:49:03.33,Eng,,0,0,0,,She was seen with our man at the airport in Abu Dhabi.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:04.42,0:49:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,她又是谁
Dialogue: 2,0:49:04.42,0:49:05.42,Eng,,0,0,0,,Who is she?
Dialogue: 1,0:49:06.50,0:49:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,她现在在哪儿
Dialogue: 2,0:49:06.50,0:49:08.26,Eng,,0,0,0,,Where is she now?
Dialogue: 1,0:49:19.64,0:49:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你之所以在这儿 是因为意大利警方收到了匿名线报
Dialogue: 2,0:49:19.64,0:49:23.44,Eng,,0,0,0,,You are here because Italian police received an anonymous tip
Dialogue: 1,0:49:23.44,0:49:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,和你外貌相似的一个女人
Dialogue: 2,0:49:23.44,0:49:25.44,Eng,,0,0,0,,that a woman matching your description
Dialogue: 1,0:49:25.44,0:49:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,将会于今日下午从阿布扎比抵达这里
Dialogue: 2,0:49:25.44,0:49:28.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,would be arriving on the afternoon flight from Abu Dhabi.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:28.78,0:49:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这个女人 手里持有很多国家的护照
Dialogue: 2,0:49:28.78,0:49:32.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,This woman had multiple passports in her possession.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:33.41,0:49:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这本的主人 在圣彼得堡因诈骗而被通缉
Dialogue: 2,0:49:33.41,0:49:36.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,This one is wanted for fraud in Saint Petersburg.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:37.66,0:49:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,在安特卫普偷盗珠宝 在摩纳哥偷取艺术品
Dialogue: 2,0:49:37.66,0:49:40.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,Jewel theft in Antwerp. Art theft in Monaco.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:40.83,0:49:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,在米兰贪污 在孟买敲诈
Dialogue: 2,0:49:40.83,0:49:44.21,Eng,,0,0,0,,Graft in Milan. Extortion in Mumbai.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:44.21,0:49:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,而这本是我最喜欢的
Dialogue: 2,0:49:44.21,0:49:46.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,But this is my favorite--
Dialogue: 1,0:49:46.75,0:49:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,在里约热内卢拒捕
Dialogue: 2,0:49:46.75,0:49:48.96,Eng,,0,0,0,,resisting arrest in Rio.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:51.26,0:49:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这不禁让我好奇
Dialogue: 2,0:49:51.26,0:49:53.22,Eng,,0,0,0,,Which leads me to wonder,
Dialogue: 1,0:49:54.30,0:49:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,里面哪个才是真正的你
Dialogue: 2,0:49:54.30,0:49:55.93,Eng,,0,0,0,,which one of these women is you?
Dialogue: 1,0:49:56.97,0:49:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没见过这些护照
Dialogue: 2,0:49:56.97,0:49:59.14,Eng,,0,0,0,,I've never seen these before in my life.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:59.14,0:50:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,都是在你包里找到的
Dialogue: 2,0:49:59.14,0:50:00.64,Eng,,0,0,0,,They were in your purse.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:00.64,0:50:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,护照上也都是你的照片
Dialogue: 2,0:50:00.64,0:50:03.65,Eng,,0,0,0,,And your picture is in every one.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:03.65,0:50:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-我能看看吗 -请便
Dialogue: 2,0:50:03.65,0:50:05.90,Eng,,0,0,0,,-May I see? -Please.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:11.61,0:50:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,照片里的人确实很像我
Dialogue: 2,0:50:11.61,0:50:13.24,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's an amazing likeness,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:13.24,0:50:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,可是 这不是我
Dialogue: 2,0:50:13.24,0:50:15.41,Eng,,0,0,0,,but it isn't me.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:16.20,0:50:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了很多次了
Dialogue: 2,0:50:16.20,0:50:17.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,As I keep telling you,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:18.95,0:50:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我是来自布莱顿的老师 我正在休假
Dialogue: 2,0:50:18.95,0:50:22.21,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm a schoolteacher from Brighton. I'm on a sabbatical.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:22.21,0:50:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你牵扯了什么事
Dialogue: 2,0:50:22.21,0:50:24.42,Eng,,0,0,0,,Whatever you're involved in,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:24.42,0:50:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,有一点很明显 你的敌人非常强大
Dialogue: 2,0:50:24.42,0:50:28.04,Eng,,0,0,0,,you've obviously made some very powerful enemies.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:38.72,0:50:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 2,0:50:38.72,0:50:39.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:43.48,0:50:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,她的律师到了
Dialogue: 2,0:50:43.48,0:50:45.02,Eng,,0,0,0,,Her lawyer is here.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:45.02,0:50:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我的律师
Dialogue: 2,0:50:45.02,0:50:46.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,My lawyer?
Dialogue: 1,0:51:21.76,0:51:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,史佩茨法官
Dialogue: 2,0:51:21.76,0:51:23.64,Eng,,0,0,0,,Magistrate Spezzi.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:24.27,0:51:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 您是…
Dialogue: 2,0:51:24.27,0:51:25.60,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Who are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:51:26.23,0:51:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,国际刑警
Dialogue: 2,0:51:26.23,0:51:27.90,Eng,,0,0,0,,Interpol.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:28.65,0:51:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,关于你们逮捕的那个 从阿布扎比来的女人
Dialogue: 2,0:51:28.65,0:51:32.94,Eng,,0,0,0,,I've come regarding the arrest of the woman from Abu Dhabi.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:33.48,0:51:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要检查一下她被捕时身上的物品
Dialogue: 2,0:51:33.48,0:51:36.61,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll need to inventory the items on her person at the time of her arrest.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:37.41,0:51:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,能看一下您的证件吗
Dialogue: 2,0:51:37.41,0:51:39.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,May I see some identification, please?
Dialogue: 1,0:51:40.58,0:51:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,其他东西呢
Dialogue: 2,0:51:40.58,0:51:41.53,Eng,,0,0,0,,Where's the rest?
Dialogue: 1,0:51:42.29,0:51:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,她的东西都在这儿了
Dialogue: 2,0:51:42.29,0:51:44.08,Eng,,0,0,0,,I assure you, this is everything.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:44.62,0:51:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-请问怎么称呼 -她从阿布扎比离开时带了把钥匙
Dialogue: 2,0:51:44.62,0:51:47.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,-What was your name? -She left Abu Dhabi with a certain key.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:48.12,0:51:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没看到钥匙
Dialogue: 2,0:51:48.12,0:51:49.46,Eng,,0,0,0,,There was no key.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:49.46,0:51:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那钥匙形状独特
Dialogue: 2,0:51:49.46,0:51:51.46,Eng,,0,0,0,,It was an unusual sort.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:52.50,0:51:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你可能会误把它当作挂坠
Dialogue: 2,0:51:52.50,0:51:54.96,Eng,,0,0,0,,One that you could mistake for a pendant.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:55.67,0:51:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,然后 把它挂在项链上
Dialogue: 2,0:51:55.67,0:51:59.26,Eng,,0,0,0,,The kind that you'd be tempted to hang on a chain
Dialogue: 1,0:51:59.26,0:52:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,送给你的阿米莉亚
Dialogue: 2,0:51:59.26,0:52:00.85,Eng,,0,0,0,,around Amelia's neck.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:02.68,0:52:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,阿米莉亚
Dialogue: 2,0:52:02.68,0:52:03.64,Eng,,0,0,0,,Amelia?
Dialogue: 1,0:52:04.64,0:52:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你的妻子
Dialogue: 2,0:52:04.64,0:52:05.93,Eng,,0,0,0,,Your wife.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:06.64,0:52:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你亲爱的女儿萨琳娜的母亲
Dialogue: 2,0:52:06.64,0:52:09.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,Mother of your lovely daughter, Serena.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:09.56,0:52:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是国际刑警
Dialogue: 2,0:52:09.56,0:52:11.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,You're not Interpol.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:11.56,0:52:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我愿意 我可以是
Dialogue: 2,0:52:11.56,0:52:13.65,Eng,,0,0,0,,I am if I wish to be.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:14.73,0:52:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我能成为任何人 而且我无所不知
Dialogue: 2,0:52:14.73,0:52:17.82,Eng,,0,0,0,,I can be anything, and I know everything.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:18.40,0:52:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,就像我知道这不是你第一次中饱私囊了
Dialogue: 2,0:52:18.40,0:52:21.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,I know this wouldn't be the first time you've helped yourself to stolen goods.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:21.78,0:52:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,卡地亚手镯那次
Dialogue: 2,0:52:21.78,0:52:22.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,A Cartier bracelet.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:23.83,0:52:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然你摆脱了嫌疑
Dialogue: 2,0:52:23.83,0:52:25.70,Eng,,0,0,0,,You were cleared of suspicion,
Dialogue: 1,0:52:25.70,0:52:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,但你把它送给了你的情妇瓦莱丽
Dialogue: 2,0:52:25.70,0:52:27.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,but we both know you gave it to your mistress, Valeria.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:28.37,0:52:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,就在8月21日 她29岁生日那天
Dialogue: 2,0:52:28.37,0:52:31.88,Eng,,0,0,0,,On August 21st. Her 29th birthday.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:31.88,0:52:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底是谁
Dialogue: 2,0:52:31.88,0:52:33.80,Eng,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:52:35.71,0:52:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,为了保险起见
Dialogue: 2,0:52:35.71,0:52:37.92,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna have to search you,
Dialogue: 1,0:52:37.92,0:52:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我要搜一下身
Dialogue: 2,0:52:37.92,0:52:39.26,Eng,,0,0,0,,just to be sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:43.68,0:52:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你的秘书她已经不在了
Dialogue: 2,0:52:43.68,0:52:46.22,Eng,,0,0,0,,Your secretary's no longer with us.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:59.45,0:53:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 两位警官
Dialogue: 2,0:52:59.45,0:53:00.86,Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you officers.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:03.37,0:53:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,坐吧
Dialogue: 2,0:53:03.37,0:53:04.16,Eng,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:05.66,0:53:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,麻烦请到外面等一下 谢谢
Dialogue: 2,0:53:05.66,0:53:07.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,You can wait outside. Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:24.51,0:53:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你 是你害我的
Dialogue: 2,0:53:24.51,0:53:27.68,Eng,,0,0,0,,You. You did this.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:27.68,0:53:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是我报的警 但我没跟他们说你精彩的过去
Dialogue: 2,0:53:27.68,0:53:32.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,I called the police. I didn't tell them about your colorful past.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:33.61,0:53:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,要怪怪你自己
Dialogue: 2,0:53:33.61,0:53:34.90,Eng,,0,0,0,,That's on you.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:35.44,0:53:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,在被捕前 你把钥匙放到了 另一个乘客的口袋里
Dialogue: 2,0:53:35.44,0:53:39.57,Eng,,0,0,0,,You put-pocketed that key on another passenger before you were arrested.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:39.57,0:53:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你们留了联系方式 相约稍后见面
Dialogue: 2,0:53:39.57,0:53:42.57,Eng,,0,0,0,,You exchanged details and arranged to meet later on.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:42.57,0:53:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 有个毫不知情的人
Dialogue: 2,0:53:42.57,0:53:44.24,Eng,,0,0,0,,Right now someone out there
Dialogue: 1,0:53:44.24,0:53:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,在外面帮你保管着那把钥匙
Dialogue: 2,0:53:44.24,0:53:46.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,hasn't the slightest clue they're holding on to that key for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:47.66,0:53:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,一个不知情的快递员 作为同伙再合适不过了
Dialogue: 2,0:53:47.66,0:53:50.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,An unwitting courier. The perfect accomplice.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:51.79,0:53:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜他是个男的 中年男人
Dialogue: 2,0:53:51.79,0:53:55.08,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing a man… middle-aged?
Dialogue: 1,0:53:55.08,0:53:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那种一辈子都想 被你这样的美女注意到的男人
Dialogue: 2,0:53:55.08,0:53:59.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,A man waiting his whole life to be noticed by a woman like you.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:01.05,0:54:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个孤儿
Dialogue: 2,0:54:01.05,0:54:02.26,Eng,,0,0,0,,An orphan.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:03.64,0:54:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,从小就很聪明 天生足智多谋
Dialogue: 2,0:54:03.64,0:54:06.97,Eng,,0,0,0,,Highly intelligent. Inherently resourceful.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:06.97,0:54:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,小时候条件不好 所以想要更好的物质生活
Dialogue: 2,0:54:06.97,0:54:10.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,Growing up in poverty left you longing for the finer things.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:11.43,0:54:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至不惜去偷别人的
Dialogue: 2,0:54:11.43,0:54:13.06,Eng,,0,0,0,,Other people's things.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:13.69,0:54:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,有人看到了你的潜质 培养你 发挥你的天赋
Dialogue: 2,0:54:13.69,0:54:17.36,Eng,,0,0,0,,Someone saw your potential and helped you hone your skills.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:17.94,0:54:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,而这手艺也给了你想要的生活
Dialogue: 2,0:54:17.94,0:54:20.53,Eng,,0,0,0,,Skills that gave you the life you thought you wanted.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:20.53,0:54:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,定制的衣服 昂贵的美食 奢华的酒店
Dialogue: 2,0:54:20.53,0:54:24.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,Tailored clothes, fine dining, luxury hotels.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:24.07,0:54:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你凭着这门手艺一直逍遥法外
Dialogue: 2,0:54:24.07,0:54:27.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,Skills that kept you one step ahead of the law,
Dialogue: 1,0:54:27.95,0:54:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,直到今天
Dialogue: 2,0:54:27.95,0:54:29.29,Eng,,0,0,0,,until now.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:31.20,0:54:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我一个小女孩儿只不过是混口饭而已
Dialogue: 2,0:54:31.20,0:54:34.46,Eng,,0,0,0,,You can't blame a girl for trying to make a dishonest living.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:35.25,0:54:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本不知道自己偷的是什么 不然你肯定不会这么干
Dialogue: 2,0:54:35.25,0:54:39.84,Eng,,0,0,0,,You had no idea what you were stealing. Otherwise you never would have stolen it.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:41.63,0:54:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吧
Dialogue: 2,0:54:41.63,0:54:42.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,Tell you what.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:42.63,0:54:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你把我弄出去 我就带你去找钥匙
Dialogue: 2,0:54:42.63,0:54:46.22,Eng,,0,0,0,,You get me out of here, and I'll take you straight to the key.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:46.22,0:54:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我有更好的主意
Dialogue: 2,0:54:46.22,0:54:47.80,Eng,,0,0,0,,I have a better idea.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:47.80,0:54:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你老老实实交代一切
Dialogue: 2,0:54:47.80,0:54:49.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,You're gonna tell me everything.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:49.47,0:54:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我就考虑帮你逃出去
Dialogue: 2,0:54:49.47,0:54:51.60,Eng,,0,0,0,,Then I'll think about getting you out of here.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:51.60,0:54:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,先说说你的雇主是谁
Dialogue: 2,0:54:51.60,0:54:53.77,Eng,,0,0,0,,Now start with who hired you.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:53.77,0:54:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,别想撒谎 我能看得出来
Dialogue: 2,0:54:53.77,0:54:56.90,Eng,,0,0,0,,And don't lie to me, because I'll know.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:56.90,0:54:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道雇主是谁
Dialogue: 2,0:54:56.90,0:54:58.73,Eng,,0,0,0,,I have no idea who hired me.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:58.73,0:55:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们基本上都是通过线上联络的
Dialogue: 2,0:54:58.73,0:55:01.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,Contact with the client was almost entirely electronic.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:01.11,0:55:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-电子邮件 -短信
Dialogue: 2,0:55:01.11,0:55:02.24,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Email? -Texts.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:02.24,0:55:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-加密的 -那当然
Dialogue: 2,0:55:02.24,0:55:03.57,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Encrypted? -Naturally.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:03.57,0:55:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-"基本上" -什么
Dialogue: 2,0:55:03.57,0:55:04.90,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Almost? -Pardon?
Dialogue: 1,0:55:04.90,0:55:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才说你们"基本上"是通过线上联系的
Dialogue: 2,0:55:04.90,0:55:08.12,Eng,,0,0,0,,You said contact with the client was "almost" entirely electronic.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:08.12,0:55:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,在卢森堡的一个咖啡馆里有个秘密传递点
Dialogue: 2,0:55:08.12,0:55:10.70,Eng,,0,0,0,,There was a dead drop in a café in Luxembourg.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:10.70,0:55:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-里面有个信封 -信封里装了什么
Dialogue: 2,0:55:10.70,0:55:12.54,Eng,,0,0,0,,-An envelope. -What was in the envelope?
Dialogue: 1,0:55:12.54,0:55:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,去阿布扎比的机票
Dialogue: 2,0:55:12.54,0:55:14.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,A ticket to Abu Dhabi.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:15.54,0:55:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一张…
Dialogue: 2,0:55:15.54,0:55:17.25,Eng,,0,0,0,,And…
Dialogue: 1,0:55:17.25,0:55:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你的照片
Dialogue: 2,0:55:17.25,0:55:20.34,Eng,,0,0,0,,a picture of you.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:21.88,0:55:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,给我的指令是在机场跟着你
Dialogue: 2,0:55:21.88,0:55:23.97,Eng,,0,0,0,,My instructions were to follow you at the airport.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:23.97,0:55:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,说届时你会跟着一个目标
Dialogue: 2,0:55:23.97,0:55:25.34,Eng,,0,0,0,,You'd be tailing a mark.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:25.34,0:55:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,而目标手里有把钥匙 还有四百万的数字货币
Dialogue: 2,0:55:25.34,0:55:28.64,Eng,,0,0,0,,Said mark would have a key and four million in cryptocurrency.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:28.64,0:55:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 那个U盘没用 是空的
Dialogue: 2,0:55:28.64,0:55:31.18,Eng,,0,0,0,,That drive was useless, by the way. It was empty.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:31.81,0:55:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我只有把你那半钥匙送到客户手里 才能拿到钱
Dialogue: 2,0:55:31.81,0:55:34.89,Eng,,0,0,0,,The only hope I have of getting paid is to deliver your half of the key.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:34.89,0:55:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那个客户想让你把钥匙送到…
Dialogue: 2,0:55:34.89,0:55:37.44,Eng,,0,0,0,,And you were instructed to deliver it to…
Dialogue: 1,0:55:37.44,0:55:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,威尼斯
Dialogue: 2,0:55:37.44,0:55:38.44,Eng,,0,0,0,,Venice.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:38.44,0:55:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,去公爵府举行的派对 明晚午夜
Dialogue: 2,0:55:38.44,0:55:41.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,Party at Ducale Palace. Tomorrow. Midnight.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:44.69,0:55:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在等谁吗
Dialogue: 2,0:55:44.69,0:55:45.90,Eng,,0,0,0,,You expecting someone?
Dialogue: 1,0:55:45.90,0:55:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你在机场的"朋友" 几分钟前我在走廊看到他们了
Dialogue: 2,0:55:45.90,0:55:49.45,Eng,,0,0,0,,Your friends from the airport. Saw them in the hallway a few minutes ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:52.20,0:55:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么不早点告诉我
Dialogue: 2,0:55:52.20,0:55:54.29,Eng,,0,0,0,,You could have said something sooner.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:54.29,0:55:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他们追的是你 又不是我
Dialogue: 2,0:55:54.29,0:55:57.12,Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, they were chasing you, not me.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:19.35,0:56:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你个臭流氓
Dialogue: 2,0:56:19.35,0:56:21.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,A pervertito!
Dialogue: 1,0:56:22.82,0:56:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不 别这样 格蕾丝
Dialogue: 2,0:56:22.82,0:56:24.28,Eng,,0,0,0,,No, Grace.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:26.65,0:56:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 2,0:56:26.65,0:56:27.61,Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no, no.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:27.90,0:56:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,她是我的客户
Dialogue: 2,0:56:27.90,0:56:29.86,Eng,,0,0,0,,She's my client.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:32.37,0:56:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不 格蕾丝
Dialogue: 2,0:56:32.37,0:56:33.33,Eng,,0,0,0,,Grace.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:38.50,0:56:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 2,0:56:38.50,0:56:39.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:12.41,0:57:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不 让开
Dialogue: 2,0:57:12.41,0:57:14.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 1,0:57:17.83,0:57:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 2,0:57:17.83,0:57:19.16,Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 1,0:57:35.85,0:57:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么停车的
Dialogue: 2,0:57:35.85,0:57:37.14,Eng,,0,0,0,,Who parks like that?
Dialogue: 1,0:57:55.62,0:57:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,格蕾丝 快停车
Dialogue: 2,0:57:55.62,0:57:57.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,Grace! You gotta pull over.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:58.41,0:57:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,格蕾丝
Dialogue: 2,0:57:58.41,0:57:59.25,Eng,,0,0,0,,Grace.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:59.25,0:58:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,停下 听我说 我这是在帮你 格蕾丝
Dialogue: 2,0:57:59.25,0:58:02.54,Eng,,0,0,0,,Pull over. Listen. I'm trying to help you! Grace!
Dialogue: 1,0:58:09.92,0:58:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,把那女的带过来
Dialogue: 2,0:58:09.92,0:58:11.05,Eng,,0,0,0,,Bring her to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:41.33,0:58:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗 没事吧 别
Dialogue: 2,0:58:41.33,0:58:44.21,Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you okay? You okay? No, no, no.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:44.21,0:58:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你们走吧
Dialogue: 2,0:58:44.21,0:58:45.21,Eng,,0,0,0,,We're okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:51.09,0:58:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,把手给我
Dialogue: 2,0:58:51.09,0:58:52.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:52.47,0:58:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,慢点 没事了
Dialogue: 2,0:58:52.47,0:58:55.22,Eng,,0,0,0,,Slow, slow, slow. It's okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:55.76,0:58:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,慢一点
Dialogue: 2,0:58:55.76,0:58:57.14,Eng,,0,0,0,,Slow.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:57.14,0:58:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有受伤 没事吧 还好吗
Dialogue: 2,0:58:57.14,0:58:59.76,Eng,,0,0,0,,Is anything broken? Are you okay? You okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:58:59.76,0:59:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,亨特
Dialogue: 2,0:58:59.76,0:59:00.77,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hunt!
Dialogue: 1,0:59:01.56,0:59:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,都结束了
Dialogue: 2,0:59:01.56,0:59:02.93,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 1,0:59:03.48,0:59:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,放开那女孩儿
Dialogue: 2,0:59:03.48,0:59:05.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,Let the girl go.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:05.31,0:59:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,自己戴上手铐
Dialogue: 2,0:59:05.31,0:59:06.94,Eng,,0,0,0,,Put the bracelets on.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:07.94,0:59:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,动作快 快戴上 快点
Dialogue: 2,0:59:07.94,0:59:11.32,Eng,,0,0,0,,There you go. Put them on. Do it!
Dialogue: 1,0:59:11.32,0:59:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,别怕 他不会朝你开枪的
Dialogue: 2,0:59:11.32,0:59:13.57,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's okay. He's not gonna shoot you.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:16.91,0:59:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,放下武器
Dialogue: 2,0:59:16.91,0:59:18.12,Eng,,0,0,0,,Put your weapons down now.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:19.49,0:59:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在执行特别行动 他是恐怖分子
Dialogue: 2,0:59:19.49,0:59:22.20,Eng,,0,0,0,,Special Operations. He's wanted for terrorism.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:23.20,0:59:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 德加 快疏散妇女
Dialogue: 2,0:59:23.20,0:59:26.04,Eng,,0,0,0,,Goddamn it, Degas, get rid of those women.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:26.04,0:59:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,亨特 听我说
Dialogue: 2,0:59:26.04,0:59:28.25,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hunt, listen to me. Listen to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:28.25,0:59:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,放了她 戴上手铐
Dialogue: 2,0:59:28.25,0:59:30.34,Eng,,0,0,0,,Let her go and put them on.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:31.84,0:59:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧放下武器
Dialogue: 2,0:59:31.84,0:59:32.96,Eng,,0,0,0,,Put your weapons down now.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:33.13,0:59:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都在掌控中
Dialogue: 2,0:59:33.13,0:59:34.01,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's all under control.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:34.01,0:59:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不要冲动
Dialogue: 2,0:59:34.01,0:59:36.93,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's okay! It's okay! It's okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:59:40.18,0:59:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,大家快趴下 快 趴下
Dialogue: 2,0:59:40.18,0:59:41.89,Eng,,0,0,0,,Everybody down! Get down!
Dialogue: 1,0:59:47.35,0:59:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-趴下 -找掩护
Dialogue: 2,0:59:47.35,0:59:50.06,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Down, down! -Cover, cover! Cover!
Dialogue: 1,1:00:20.55,1:00:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-你来开车 -什么
Dialogue: 2,1:00:20.55,1:00:22.64,Eng,,0,0,0,,-You're driving. -What?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:22.64,1:00:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 好吧
Dialogue: 2,1:00:22.64,1:00:24.18,Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 1,1:00:25.31,1:00:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,动作快 快踩油门
Dialogue: 2,1:00:25.31,1:00:26.68,Eng,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go. Hit the accelerator.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:26.68,1:00:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 2,1:00:26.68,1:00:28.10,Eng,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 1,1:00:37.82,1:00:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,快开
Dialogue: 2,1:00:37.82,1:00:38.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 1,1:00:56.05,1:00:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,快上车
Dialogue: 2,1:00:56.05,1:00:57.38,Eng,,0,0,0,,Get in!
Dialogue: 1,1:00:57.38,1:00:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 继续开
Dialogue: 2,1:00:57.38,1:00:59.13,Eng,,0,0,0,,You're good. Just keep it going.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:59.13,1:01:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,别停下
Dialogue: 2,1:00:59.13,1:01:00.68,Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't stop.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:10.77,1:01:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,看着车
Dialogue: 2,1:01:10.77,1:01:11.60,Eng,,0,0,0,,Car, car, car.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:20.41,1:01:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,别紧张 先踩刹车 然后重新启动
Dialogue: 2,1:01:20.41,1:01:23.45,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Just put your foot on the brake. Start the car.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:23.45,1:01:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 2,1:01:23.45,1:01:24.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 1,1:01:24.78,1:01:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-嘿 怎么了 -我不干了 这种车我开不了
Dialogue: 2,1:01:24.78,1:01:27.37,Eng,,0,0,0,,-What's happening? -I'm done. I'm not doing this.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:27.37,1:01:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,有很多人在追我们
Dialogue: 2,1:01:27.37,1:01:29.04,Eng,,0,0,0,,People are chasing us.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:29.04,1:01:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我看到了 所以你来开车 快点
Dialogue: 2,1:01:29.04,1:01:32.38,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, they are. You're driving. Now, come on.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:03.53,1:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙到底是谁
Dialogue: 2,1:02:03.53,1:02:05.24,Eng,,0,0,0,,Who is that person?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:05.24,1:02:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 2,1:02:05.24,1:02:06.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:11.62,1:02:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-你还好吗 -一切结束才可能会好
Dialogue: 2,1:02:11.62,1:02:13.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,-You okay? -I will be when this is over.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:16.42,1:02:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 2,1:02:16.42,1:02:17.84,Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:22.13,1:02:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 见鬼
Dialogue: 2,1:02:22.13,1:02:23.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:36.19,1:02:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉是个人都在追我们
Dialogue: 2,1:02:36.19,1:02:37.61,Eng,,0,0,0,,Is there anyone not chasing us?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:38.32,1:02:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得换辆车
Dialogue: 2,1:02:38.32,1:02:39.57,Eng,,0,0,0,,We gotta get rid of this car.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:42.45,1:02:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的摩托 真麻烦
Dialogue: 2,1:02:42.45,1:02:44.32,Eng,,0,0,0,,Scooters! Damn it.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:05.55,1:03:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这是在干吗
Dialogue: 2,1:03:05.55,1:03:07.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,What are we doing?
Dialogue: 1,1:03:09.51,1:03:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,给咱们找辆新车
Dialogue: 2,1:03:09.51,1:03:10.81,Eng,,0,0,0,,Finding us a new car.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:32.37,1:03:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 2,1:03:32.37,1:03:33.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:50.81,1:03:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-让我研究一下 -好的
Dialogue: 2,1:03:50.81,1:03:52.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Just give me a second. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:52.56,1:03:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-谢谢 可以了 -好的
Dialogue: 2,1:03:52.56,1:03:54.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Thanks. Okay? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:54.27,1:03:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-准备好了 -随时出发
Dialogue: 2,1:03:54.27,1:03:56.02,Eng,,0,0,0,,-You ready? -I'm ready.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:59.65,1:04:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-你没事吧 -没事
Dialogue: 2,1:03:59.65,1:04:01.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Wow. -You okay?
Dialogue: 1,1:04:02.07,1:04:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那个什么 我很抱歉 这车真是…
Dialogue: 2,1:04:02.07,1:04:04.49,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, look, I'm sorry. This is…
Dialogue: 1,1:04:04.49,1:04:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-没关系 -不 这车真是…
Dialogue: 2,1:04:04.49,1:04:06.57,Eng,,0,0,0,,-It's okay. -No, this car, the way they…
Dialogue: 1,1:04:06.57,1:04:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 2,1:04:06.57,1:04:07.49,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:07.49,1:04:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这辆车的设计真的是…
Dialogue: 2,1:04:07.49,1:04:09.45,Eng,,0,0,0,,No, the way they set them up, sometimes it's just…
Dialogue: 1,1:04:09.45,1:04:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-快走吧 -得适应一下
Dialogue: 2,1:04:09.45,1:04:11.37,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Let's go. -It takes me…
Dialogue: 1,1:04:19.88,1:04:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,交通摄像头通过面部识别 拍到了这位女性
Dialogue: 2,1:04:19.88,1:04:23.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,Traffic cameras have picked up the woman on facial recognition.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:23.88,1:04:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,她现在在一辆黄色菲亚特500上
Dialogue: 2,1:04:23.88,1:04:25.76,Eng,,0,0,0,,She is now in a yellow Fiat 500.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:26.51,1:04:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,各单位正在追捕中
Dialogue: 2,1:04:26.51,1:04:27.80,Eng,,0,0,0,,Units are in pursuit.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:42.40,1:04:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这下你跑不了了
Dialogue: 2,1:04:42.40,1:04:44.94,Eng,,0,0,0,,Now I got you.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:53.74,1:04:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,看来甩掉他们了
Dialogue: 2,1:04:53.74,1:04:54.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like we lost them.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:20.98,1:05:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们现在…
Dialogue: 2,1:05:20.98,1:05:22.06,Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's just--
Dialogue: 1,1:05:22.06,1:05:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,闪开
Dialogue: 2,1:05:22.06,1:05:23.02,Eng,,0,0,0,,Move, move, move!
Dialogue: 1,1:05:40.46,1:05:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,婴儿车
Dialogue: 2,1:05:40.46,1:05:42.00,Eng,,0,0,0,,Baby, baby, baby!
Dialogue: 1,1:05:54.89,1:05:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,什么情况
Dialogue: 2,1:05:54.89,1:05:56.18,Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 1,1:05:56.97,1:05:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我不行
Dialogue: 2,1:05:56.97,1:05:57.93,Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no, no.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:04.02,1:06:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 2,1:06:04.02,1:06:05.06,Eng,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 1,1:06:08.57,1:06:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,笔直开 往前走
Dialogue: 2,1:06:08.57,1:06:09.44,Eng,,0,0,0,,Go straight.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:17.37,1:06:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-脚放开油门就好 -车子着火了
Dialogue: 2,1:06:17.37,1:06:20.00,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Just take your foot off the accelerator. -We're on fire. We're on fire!
Dialogue: 1,1:06:20.00,1:06:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,没着火 是轮胎 试着让车笔直开
Dialogue: 2,1:06:20.00,1:06:21.92,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's the tires. Just try to go straight.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:24.04,1:06:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-冷静点 -它为什么在打转
Dialogue: 2,1:06:24.04,1:06:25.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Hang on. -Why is it spinning?
Dialogue: 1,1:06:27.63,1:06:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 2,1:06:27.63,1:06:28.96,Eng,,0,0,0,,Good, good, good!
Dialogue: 1,1:06:31.38,1:06:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我搞定了 行了
Dialogue: 2,1:06:31.38,1:06:32.97,Eng,,0,0,0,,I've got it, I've got it, I've got it.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:34.39,1:06:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-右转 往那儿开 那条路 -加油啊
Dialogue: 2,1:06:34.39,1:06:36.85,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Turn right. Down there. Right there! -Come on!
Dialogue: 1,1:06:45.61,1:06:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,往右边走 往右边
Dialogue: 2,1:06:45.61,1:06:46.86,Eng,,0,0,0,,Got to go right. Turn right!
Dialogue: 1,1:06:49.65,1:06:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-到底是谁在开车 -你在开
Dialogue: 2,1:06:49.65,1:06:51.90,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Who's driving? -You're driving.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:51.90,1:06:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,快开 笔直开
Dialogue: 2,1:06:51.90,1:06:53.61,Eng,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go. Just go straight.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:54.57,1:06:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 2,1:06:54.57,1:06:55.57,Eng,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:55.57,1:06:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,继续保持直行 保持直行
Dialogue: 2,1:06:55.57,1:06:58.08,Eng,,0,0,0,,Just keep going straight.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:58.08,1:07:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,左转了 左转也行 快开 快开 你开得很好
Dialogue: 2,1:06:58.08,1:07:01.58,Eng,,0,0,0,,Or left. Go, go, go. You're doing good.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:07.46,1:07:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,警察 好多警察
Dialogue: 2,1:07:07.46,1:07:08.96,Eng,,0,0,0,,Cops! A lot of cops!
Dialogue: 1,1:07:10.26,1:07:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你来开
Dialogue: 2,1:07:10.26,1:07:11.76,Eng,,0,0,0,,Take the wheel.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:11.76,1:07:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,刹车
Dialogue: 2,1:07:11.76,1:07:13.42,Eng,,0,0,0,,Brake, brake, brake.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:18.85,1:07:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 换你开
Dialogue: 2,1:07:18.85,1:07:20.60,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, your wheel.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:22.52,1:07:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,笔直开
Dialogue: 2,1:07:22.52,1:07:23.81,Eng,,0,0,0,,Straight?
Dialogue: 1,1:07:23.81,1:07:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-右转 -明白
Dialogue: 2,1:07:23.81,1:07:25.44,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Right, right, right. -Got it.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:34.15,1:07:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-再往哪儿开 -左转
Dialogue: 2,1:07:34.15,1:07:35.86,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Which way now? -Left, left, left.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:44.37,1:07:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 继续开
Dialogue: 2,1:07:44.37,1:07:46.00,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay. You're good, you're good.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:50.88,1:07:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你得避开人
Dialogue: 2,1:07:50.88,1:07:52.09,Eng,,0,0,0,,That's a person.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:54.76,1:07:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-看车 -看到了
Dialogue: 2,1:07:54.76,1:07:56.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Car, car. -I see it!
Dialogue: 1,1:08:23.20,1:08:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,踩油门
Dialogue: 2,1:08:23.20,1:08:24.04,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hit it.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:31.75,1:08:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,坐稳了
Dialogue: 2,1:08:31.75,1:08:32.92,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 1,1:08:44.60,1:08:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-现在什么情况 这是在往哪里开 -我也不知道
Dialogue: 2,1:08:44.60,1:08:47.44,Eng,,0,0,0,,-What is happening? Where are we going? -I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:48.48,1:08:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 刹车
Dialogue: 2,1:08:48.48,1:08:50.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, brake, brake, brake!
Dialogue: 1,1:09:19.84,1:09:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你别怪我
Dialogue: 2,1:09:19.84,1:09:21.18,Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't hate me.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:24.56,1:09:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,格蕾丝 格蕾丝
Dialogue: 2,1:09:24.56,1:09:25.93,Eng,,0,0,0,,Grace? Grace!
Dialogue: 1,1:09:41.49,1:09:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 2,1:09:41.49,1:09:42.66,Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:11.02,1:10:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森
Dialogue: 2,1:10:11.02,1:10:12.10,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ethan!
Dialogue: 1,1:10:12.77,1:10:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森
Dialogue: 2,1:10:12.77,1:10:13.86,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ethan!
Dialogue: 1,1:10:17.48,1:10:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计 还等什么
Dialogue: 2,1:10:17.48,1:10:19.40,Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, come on.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:14.46,1:11:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们知道格蕾丝手里有一半钥匙
Dialogue: 2,1:11:14.46,1:11:17.09,Eng,,0,0,0,,All right. We know Grace has one half of the key.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:17.09,1:11:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还知道今天午夜她会去公爵府
Dialogue: 2,1:11:17.09,1:11:19.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,We also know she's gonna be at the Ducale at midnight.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:19.63,1:11:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们基本上算是知道 她要见的是谁了
Dialogue: 2,1:11:19.63,1:11:23.34,Eng,,0,0,0,,And now we have a pretty good idea as to who will be waiting for her there.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:23.34,1:11:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,在那儿举办活动的是我们最中意的
Dialogue: 2,1:11:23.34,1:11:25.09,Eng,,0,0,0,,The event is being hosted by none other than
Dialogue: 1,1:11:25.09,1:11:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,国际黑市军火贸易商 阿兰娜米特索普利斯
Dialogue: 2,1:11:25.09,1:11:29.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,our favorite international arms trafficker and black marketeer, Alana Mitsopolis.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:29.31,1:11:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,人称"白寡妇"
Dialogue: 2,1:11:29.31,1:11:31.22,Eng,,0,0,0,,The White Widow.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:31.77,1:11:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,她知道你的真实身份吗 还是说她依然以为
Dialogue: 2,1:11:31.77,1:11:34.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,Does she know who you actually are or does she still think
Dialogue: 1,1:11:34.39,1:11:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你是那个臭名昭著的杀人犯 约翰拉克
Dialogue: 2,1:11:34.39,1:11:37.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,you're the globally notorious mass murderer John Lark?
Dialogue: 1,1:11:37.31,1:11:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,谁说我不是了呢
Dialogue: 2,1:11:37.31,1:11:39.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,Who says I'm not?
Dialogue: 1,1:11:39.15,1:11:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,她之前不是在巴黎悬赏要你的脑袋吗
Dialogue: 2,1:11:39.15,1:11:41.53,Eng,,0,0,0,,Didn't she put a price on your head in Paris?
Dialogue: 1,1:11:41.53,1:11:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,确实 但据说她和伊森私下了结了
Dialogue: 2,1:11:41.53,1:11:45.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,She did indeed. She and Ethan, they worked it out.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:46.32,1:11:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你从没提过怎么了结的
Dialogue: 2,1:11:46.32,1:11:47.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,You never did tell me how.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:47.99,1:11:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,继续说正事 好吗
Dialogue: 2,1:11:47.99,1:11:49.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,Can we continue, please?
Dialogue: 1,1:11:49.74,1:11:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 2,1:11:49.74,1:11:50.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:50.79,1:11:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,所以说 就算今晚我们拿到了完整的钥匙
Dialogue: 2,1:11:50.79,1:11:53.45,Eng,,0,0,0,,Assuming we get the complete key at the party tonight,
Dialogue: 1,1:11:53.45,1:11:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还是不知道它的用途 所以得找个知情的人
Dialogue: 2,1:11:53.45,1:11:56.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,we still don't know what it unlocks, so we need to find somebody who does.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:56.75,1:11:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是 去哪儿找呢
Dialogue: 2,1:11:56.75,1:11:59.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,The question is where to start looking.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:59.59,1:12:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那个炸弹总不会自己长脚走进机场
Dialogue: 2,1:11:59.59,1:12:02.46,Eng,,0,0,0,,We figured that the bomb didn't just walk into the airport by itself.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:02.46,1:12:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧 肯定是有人带进去的
Dialogue: 2,1:12:02.46,1:12:03.92,Eng,,0,0,0,,Right? Somebody put it there.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:03.92,1:12:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在为智体做事
Dialogue: 2,1:12:03.92,1:12:06.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,Somebody working for the Entity.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:06.59,1:12:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我从机场监控那儿找到的所有视频
Dialogue: 2,1:12:06.59,1:12:10.18,Eng,,0,0,0,,This is everything I captured from the security cameras at the airport
Dialogue: 1,1:12:10.18,1:12:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,内容都在这儿 直到事情失控的那一刻
Dialogue: 2,1:12:10.18,1:12:12.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,up to the minute everything went haywire.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:12.56,1:12:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,而这是通过你的墨镜拍摄到的视频
Dialogue: 2,1:12:12.56,1:12:15.85,Eng,,0,0,0,,And this is the feed from your AR sunglasses.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:15.85,1:12:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在给当时所有在场的人 做面部识别对比
Dialogue: 2,1:12:15.85,1:12:18.94,Eng,,0,0,0,,I've been running facial recognition on everyone in the airport.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:18.94,1:12:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,看看有什么发现吗
Dialogue: 2,1:12:18.94,1:12:20.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,See anything strange?
Dialogue: 1,1:12:23.61,1:12:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,就像幽灵一样
Dialogue: 2,1:12:23.61,1:12:24.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's like a ghost.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:24.99,1:12:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,幽灵可没有倒影
Dialogue: 2,1:12:24.99,1:12:26.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ghosts don't have reflections.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:30.45,1:12:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,整个机场唯一没有身份的家伙
Dialogue: 2,1:12:30.45,1:12:34.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,The only person in the airport with no identity.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:34.50,1:12:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,也是唯一一个在机场 没有留下任何踪迹的家伙
Dialogue: 2,1:12:34.50,1:12:38.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,The only man who can't be found anyplace else in the airport
Dialogue: 1,1:12:38.83,1:12:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,除了这个倒影
Dialogue: 2,1:12:38.83,1:12:41.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,except that reflection.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:42.30,1:12:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他的痕迹被清除了
Dialogue: 2,1:12:42.30,1:12:44.01,Eng,,0,0,0,,He's being erased.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:44.55,1:12:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,还是实时操作的
Dialogue: 2,1:12:44.55,1:12:46.09,Eng,,0,0,0,,In real time.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:52.76,1:12:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是智体
Dialogue: 2,1:12:52.76,1:12:54.06,Eng,,0,0,0,,The Entity.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:55.39,1:12:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,智体在保护他
Dialogue: 2,1:12:55.39,1:12:56.73,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's protecting him.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:57.31,1:12:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到他了 对吧
Dialogue: 2,1:12:57.31,1:12:59.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,You saw him, didn't you?
Dialogue: 1,1:13:01.77,1:13:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我当时不确定
Dialogue: 2,1:13:01.77,1:13:03.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,I wasn't sure.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:04.65,1:13:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙是谁
Dialogue: 2,1:13:04.65,1:13:05.90,Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, who is he?
Dialogue: 1,1:13:13.33,1:13:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,一个我以为
Dialogue: 2,1:13:13.33,1:13:15.12,Eng,,0,0,0,,Someone I thought
Dialogue: 1,1:13:16.33,1:13:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,已经死了很久的人
Dialogue: 2,1:13:16.33,1:13:18.08,Eng,,0,0,0,,died a long time ago.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:18.08,1:13:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,很久以前的事了
Dialogue: 2,1:13:18.08,1:13:19.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,In another life.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:20.42,1:13:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,在我加入碟中谍之前
Dialogue: 2,1:13:20.42,1:13:21.92,Eng,,0,0,0,,Before the IMF.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:22.96,1:13:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,在我做出那个选择之前
Dialogue: 2,1:13:22.96,1:13:25.96,Eng,,0,0,0,,Before I was offered the choice.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:29.09,1:13:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至可以说
Dialogue: 2,1:13:29.09,1:13:30.64,Eng,,0,0,0,,And in a very real sense,
Dialogue: 1,1:13:31.47,1:13:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是他造就了今天的我
Dialogue: 2,1:13:31.47,1:13:34.18,Eng,,0,0,0,,he made me who I am today.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:35.39,1:13:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫什么名字
Dialogue: 2,1:13:35.39,1:13:37.18,Eng,,0,0,0,,Does he have a name?
Dialogue: 1,1:13:37.18,1:13:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他自称盖布瑞尔
Dialogue: 2,1:13:37.18,1:13:39.73,Eng,,0,0,0,,He calls himself Gabriel.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:42.69,1:13:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识他
Dialogue: 2,1:13:42.69,1:13:44.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,You know him.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:46.40,1:13:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人真正认识他
Dialogue: 2,1:13:46.40,1:13:48.28,Eng,,0,0,0,,There is no knowing him.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:49.32,1:13:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他的过去没有任何记录
Dialogue: 2,1:13:49.32,1:13:51.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,He has no recorded past.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:51.78,1:13:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,智体帮他实现了这一点
Dialogue: 2,1:13:51.78,1:13:53.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,The Entity made sure of that.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:54.78,1:13:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他是邪恶的化身
Dialogue: 2,1:13:54.78,1:13:56.20,Eng,,0,0,0,,He's a dark messiah.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:56.20,1:13:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是智体钦点的信使
Dialogue: 2,1:13:56.20,1:13:59.33,Eng,,0,0,0,,The Entity's chosen messenger.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:59.33,1:14:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,在他的眼中 死亡
Dialogue: 2,1:13:59.33,1:14:00.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,And he sees death
Dialogue: 1,1:14:01.96,1:14:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是他想要和世界分享的礼物
Dialogue: 2,1:14:01.96,1:14:05.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,as a gift he wants to share with the rest of the world.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:06.21,1:14:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道这些的
Dialogue: 2,1:14:06.21,1:14:07.21,Eng,,0,0,0,,How do you know this?
Dialogue: 1,1:14:07.21,1:14:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我在军情六处还有些朋友
Dialogue: 2,1:14:07.21,1:14:11.05,Eng,,0,0,0,,I still have a few friends left in MI6.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:11.05,1:14:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他们也同样担心 智体会落入英国政府的手里
Dialogue: 2,1:14:11.05,1:14:15.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,Friends who are afraid of the British government gaining control of the Entity.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:16.39,1:14:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,任何想要阻止这件事的行为 都会被视为叛国
Dialogue: 2,1:14:16.39,1:14:19.98,Eng,,0,0,0,,Any attempt to try to stop them would be seen as an act of treason.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:19.98,1:14:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,而你已经脱离了组织
Dialogue: 2,1:14:19.98,1:14:21.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,And because you're disavowed,
Dialogue: 1,1:14:21.56,1:14:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你的朋友就向你寻求帮助
Dialogue: 2,1:14:21.56,1:14:25.32,Eng,,0,0,0,,your friends called and asked you for help.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:25.32,1:14:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他们知道盖布瑞尔在为智体做事
Dialogue: 2,1:14:25.32,1:14:28.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,They knew Gabriel serves the Entity.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:28.23,1:14:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他们还知道他会去伊斯坦布尔
Dialogue: 2,1:14:28.23,1:14:30.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,They knew he was on his way to Istanbul
Dialogue: 1,1:14:30.15,1:14:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,寻找一把十字钥匙的其中一半
Dialogue: 2,1:14:30.15,1:14:33.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,to acquire one half of a cruciform key.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:35.16,1:14:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 我抢先了他一步
Dialogue: 2,1:14:35.16,1:14:37.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,So I beat him to it.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:39.33,1:14:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,随后基特里奇悬赏要你的命
Dialogue: 2,1:14:39.33,1:14:41.41,Eng,,0,0,0,,And when Kittridge put a bounty on your head,
Dialogue: 1,1:14:42.42,1:14:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你就去了沙漠想躲起来
Dialogue: 2,1:14:42.42,1:14:44.46,Eng,,0,0,0,,you went to the desert to hide.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:44.46,1:14:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,谁知道那些赏金猎手还是找到了你
Dialogue: 2,1:14:44.46,1:14:47.30,Eng,,0,0,0,,But somehow the bounty hunters found you anyway.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:47.30,1:14:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 2,1:14:47.30,1:14:48.42,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:48.42,1:14:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 你那些朋友有说过 那把钥匙是用来开什么的吗
Dialogue: 2,1:14:48.42,1:14:52.93,Eng,,0,0,0,,So, did these friends of yours happen to say what the key unlocks?
Dialogue: 1,1:14:52.93,1:14:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,军情六处认为 钥匙或许可以打开智体的源代码
Dialogue: 2,1:14:52.93,1:14:57.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,MI6 suspects it leads somehow to the Entity's source code.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:57.31,1:14:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,源代码
Dialogue: 2,1:14:57.31,1:14:58.81,Eng,,0,0,0,,Source code.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:59.68,1:15:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你打算什么时候告诉我
Dialogue: 2,1:14:59.68,1:15:01.06,Eng,,0,0,0,,When were you gonna tell me this?
Dialogue: 1,1:15:02.31,1:15:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不告诉你了吗
Dialogue: 2,1:15:02.31,1:15:03.52,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you now.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:05.27,1:15:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你在军情六处的朋友 他们是怎么联系你的
Dialogue: 2,1:15:05.27,1:15:07.69,Eng,,0,0,0,,Your friends at MI6, how'd they contact you?
Dialogue: 1,1:15:07.69,1:15:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你和他们通话了 还是见面了
Dialogue: 2,1:15:07.69,1:15:09.65,Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you speak with them? Face to face?
Dialogue: 1,1:15:09.65,1:15:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我脱离了组织
Dialogue: 2,1:15:09.65,1:15:11.28,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm disavowed.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:11.28,1:15:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不能冒险来见我 所以 所有的联络…
Dialogue: 2,1:15:11.28,1:15:15.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,They couldn't risk meeting me in person, so all communication--
Dialogue: 1,1:15:17.24,1:15:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,都是通过电子 还有数字
Dialogue: 2,1:15:17.24,1:15:20.20,Eng,,0,0,0,,Was electronic. Was digital.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:23.96,1:15:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能确定那就是智体
Dialogue: 2,1:15:23.96,1:15:25.92,Eng,,0,0,0,,No. We can't be sure that was the Entity.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:25.92,1:15:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,也不能确定它不是
Dialogue: 2,1:15:25.92,1:15:27.88,Eng,,0,0,0,,We can't be sure it wasn't.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:27.88,1:15:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,除了现在的对话 我们无法确信外面的任何信息
Dialogue: 2,1:15:27.88,1:15:31.34,Eng,,0,0,0,,We can't be sure anything is real outside of this very conversation.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:33.09,1:15:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不该来这儿
Dialogue: 2,1:15:33.09,1:15:34.13,Eng,,0,0,0,,None of you should be here.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:34.13,1:15:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-伊森 -不 你不了解盖布瑞尔 但我了解
Dialogue: 2,1:15:34.13,1:15:36.68,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Ethan---No. You don't know Gabriel. I do.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:36.68,1:15:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他享受的不是杀戮本身
Dialogue: 2,1:15:36.68,1:15:38.64,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's not the killing he enjoys.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:38.64,1:15:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,而是杀戮带给别人的痛苦
Dialogue: 2,1:15:38.64,1:15:40.64,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's the suffering it causes.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:40.64,1:15:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他很清楚该如何对付我
Dialogue: 2,1:15:40.64,1:15:42.73,Eng,,0,0,0,,And he knows the best way to get to me
Dialogue: 1,1:15:43.35,1:15:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,就是通过你们
Dialogue: 2,1:15:43.35,1:15:45.06,Eng,,0,0,0,,is through all of you.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:46.23,1:15:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,如果盖布瑞尔知道我的事
Dialogue: 2,1:15:46.23,1:15:47.94,Eng,,0,0,0,,And if Gabriel knows me…
Dialogue: 1,1:15:47.94,1:15:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,智体也会知道
Dialogue: 2,1:15:47.94,1:15:49.61,Eng,,0,0,0,,The Entity knows.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:49.61,1:15:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他想让我来这儿一定有他的原因
Dialogue: 2,1:15:49.61,1:15:52.57,Eng,,0,0,0,,There's a reason he wants me here. There's…
Dialogue: 1,1:15:53.24,1:15:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,就像他想让你们也来这儿一样 这是智体的意思
Dialogue: 2,1:15:53.24,1:15:56.49,Eng,,0,0,0,,There's a reason he wants you here. It wants you here.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:56.49,1:16:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,"谁或者什么 对你来说最为重要"
Dialogue: 2,1:15:56.49,1:16:00.16,Eng,,0,0,0,,"Who or what is the most important thing to you?"
Dialogue: 1,1:16:01.12,1:16:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你们赶紧走 你们全都快走
Dialogue: 2,1:16:01.12,1:16:03.33,Eng,,0,0,0,,No. You have to go. You all have to go.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:03.33,1:16:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-伊森 如果这正是它的目的呢 -就像它让我们离开机场那样
Dialogue: 2,1:16:03.33,1:16:06.29,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Ethan, what if it wants us to leave? -Like you made us leave the airport.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:06.29,1:16:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,如果它就是想让你一人去那个派对呢
Dialogue: 2,1:16:06.29,1:16:08.88,Eng,,0,0,0,,What if it wants you alone at that party tonight?
Dialogue: 1,1:16:08.88,1:16:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那就如它所愿 至少我不用担心你们的安危
Dialogue: 2,1:16:08.88,1:16:11.09,Eng,,0,0,0,,Then I go alone. At least I don't have all of you to worry about.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:11.09,1:16:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我为什么一开始不告诉你的原因
Dialogue: 2,1:16:11.09,1:16:13.38,Eng,,0,0,0,,This is exactly why I didn't want to tell you.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:13.38,1:16:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森 你正在和一个电脑算法 下四维国际象棋
Dialogue: 2,1:16:13.38,1:16:16.93,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ethan, you're playing four-dimensional chess with an algorithm.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:16.93,1:16:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,智体非常了解我们
Dialogue: 2,1:16:16.93,1:16:18.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,The Entity knows who we are.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:18.51,1:16:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的行动它可能都考虑到了
Dialogue: 2,1:16:18.51,1:16:21.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,Any move we make, it's probably considered it.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:21.39,1:16:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的一举一动 可能都在它的预判之中
Dialogue: 2,1:16:21.39,1:16:24.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,Anything we do, we have to assume that it's counting on us to do it.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:24.39,1:16:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想打败智体 就必须像它一样思考
Dialogue: 2,1:16:24.39,1:16:28.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,If you want to beat this thing, you have to start thinking like it.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:28.48,1:16:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,冷酷 无情 逻辑至上
Dialogue: 2,1:16:28.48,1:16:31.94,Eng,,0,0,0,,Cold, logical, unemotional.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:31.94,1:16:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,如果那把钥匙真的可以控制智体的话
Dialogue: 2,1:16:31.94,1:16:35.45,Eng,,0,0,0,,If that key really does grant control of the Entity,
Dialogue: 1,1:16:35.45,1:16:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那无论如何都不能让盖布瑞尔得到它
Dialogue: 2,1:16:35.45,1:16:38.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,Gabriel is the last person on Earth who should have it.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:38.91,1:16:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,她说得对 伊森
Dialogue: 2,1:16:38.91,1:16:40.45,Eng,,0,0,0,,She's right, Ethan.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:40.45,1:16:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不能让盖布瑞尔拿到钥匙
Dialogue: 2,1:16:40.45,1:16:43.62,Eng,,0,0,0,,Gabriel cannot have that key.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:43.62,1:16:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,和这次的任务相比 我们的性命不值一提
Dialogue: 2,1:16:43.62,1:16:47.62,Eng,,0,0,0,,And none of our lives can matter more than this mission.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:54.26,1:16:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我决不接受
Dialogue: 2,1:16:54.26,1:16:56.01,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't accept that.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:22.24,1:17:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我第一次来威尼斯
Dialogue: 2,1:17:22.24,1:17:24.33,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's my first time in Venice.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:28.33,1:17:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是第一次
Dialogue: 2,1:17:28.33,1:17:29.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's mine, too.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:31.39,1:18:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,请你喝一杯怎么样
Dialogue: 2,1:18:31.39,1:18:32.77,Eng,,0,0,0,,Buy you a drink?
Dialogue: 1,1:18:33.61,1:18:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我在等人
Dialogue: 2,1:18:33.61,1:18:35.32,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting for someone.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:35.32,1:18:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 2,1:18:35.32,1:18:36.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,So am I.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:38.61,1:18:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以一起等 我叫盖布瑞尔
Dialogue: 2,1:18:38.61,1:18:41.49,Eng,,0,0,0,,We can wait together. I'm Gabriel.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:41.49,1:18:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,随便吧
Dialogue: 2,1:18:41.49,1:18:43.24,Eng,,0,0,0,,If you say so.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:44.03,1:18:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你是格蕾丝吧
Dialogue: 2,1:18:44.03,1:18:45.45,Eng,,0,0,0,,And you're Grace.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:55.00,1:18:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,东西不在我身上
Dialogue: 2,1:18:55.00,1:18:56.21,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't have it on me.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:56.21,1:18:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我也没指望你带着
Dialogue: 2,1:18:56.21,1:18:58.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't expect you to.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:58.55,1:19:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,更何况 我也不是为了钥匙而来
Dialogue: 2,1:18:58.55,1:19:00.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,In any case, I'm not here for the key.
Dialogue: 1,1:19:01.59,1:19:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那你想怎么样
Dialogue: 2,1:19:01.59,1:19:02.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 1,1:19:02.63,1:19:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,既然我们都在等人 我给你讲个小故事吧
Dialogue: 2,1:19:02.63,1:19:05.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,Suppose while we're waiting I tell you a little story.
Dialogue: 1,1:19:05.43,1:19:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,很明显你不是我要见的那个人
Dialogue: 2,1:19:05.43,1:19:08.01,Eng,,0,0,0,,You're obviously not the person I came here to meet.
Dialogue: 1,1:19:08.01,1:19:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,关于你的故事 格蕾丝
Dialogue: 2,1:19:08.01,1:19:09.85,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's your story, Grace.
Dialogue: 1,1:19:11.02,1:19:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道它的结局
Dialogue: 2,1:19:11.02,1:19:12.85,Eng,,0,0,0,,I know how it ends.
Dialogue: 1,1:19:14.02,1:19:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,让我请你喝一杯 或许还可以改变呢
Dialogue: 2,1:19:14.02,1:19:16.65,Eng,,0,0,0,,Let me buy you a drink and perhaps we can change it.
Dialogue: 1,1:19:44.51,1:19:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,派对在等我们
Dialogue: 2,1:19:44.51,1:19:46.09,Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's go to a party.
Dialogue: 1,1:19:53.94,1:19:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 先生
Dialogue: 2,1:19:53.94,1:19:55.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 1,1:19:57.27,1:19:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,麻烦您跟我来
Dialogue: 2,1:19:57.27,1:19:59.02,Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you please follow me?
Dialogue: 1,1:20:00.61,1:20:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,有一点很重要 你得知道自己并没那么特别
Dialogue: 2,1:20:00.61,1:20:04.36,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's important you understand that you're not unique.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:05.03,1:20:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,三十年前
Dialogue: 2,1:20:05.03,1:20:06.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,Thirty years ago…
Dialogue: 1,1:20:07.12,1:20:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,一个叫玛丽的姑娘
Dialogue: 2,1:20:07.12,1:20:08.41,Eng,,0,0,0,,her name was Marie.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:09.03,1:20:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,她是第一个对我们那位朋友 深信不疑的女人
Dialogue: 2,1:20:09.03,1:20:12.12,Eng,,0,0,0,,The first of many women who trusted our mutual friend.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:12.12,1:20:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那些女人身上都有他想要的东西
Dialogue: 2,1:20:12.12,1:20:14.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,Women who all have something he wants.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:15.33,1:20:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,她们各有各的困境 至少他会这么说
Dialogue: 2,1:20:15.33,1:20:19.13,Eng,,0,0,0,,Women who are all in over their heads, or so he tells them.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:19.88,1:20:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,听着耳熟吗
Dialogue: 2,1:20:19.88,1:20:21.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,Sound familiar?
Dialogue: 1,1:20:21.50,1:20:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那个玛丽后来怎么了
Dialogue: 2,1:20:21.50,1:20:23.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,What happened to Marie?
Dialogue: 1,1:20:23.51,1:20:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,被他利用过的女人都只有一个下场
Dialogue: 2,1:20:23.51,1:20:26.34,Eng,,0,0,0,,Same thing that happens to all the women he uses,
Dialogue: 1,1:20:27.22,1:20:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,就像碰过那把钥匙的人一样
Dialogue: 2,1:20:27.22,1:20:29.89,Eng,,0,0,0,,as well as anyone else who touches that key.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:29.89,1:20:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他根本不在乎那些人的死活
Dialogue: 2,1:20:29.89,1:20:32.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,He doesn't care whether people live or die.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:32.43,1:20:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他在乎的只有他自己的目标
Dialogue: 2,1:20:32.43,1:20:35.89,Eng,,0,0,0,,He cares only about his objective.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:36.73,1:20:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,而现在 唯一挡在他面前的人
Dialogue: 2,1:20:36.73,1:20:38.69,Eng,,0,0,0,,And right now, the only thing standing in his way
Dialogue: 1,1:20:39.48,1:20:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,就是你
Dialogue: 2,1:20:39.48,1:20:40.61,Eng,,0,0,0,,is you.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:41.69,1:20:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-我有什么理由相信你 -确实没有
Dialogue: 2,1:20:41.69,1:20:44.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Why should I believe you? -You shouldn't.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:44.15,1:20:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你踏入了一个充满谎言的世界
Dialogue: 2,1:20:44.15,1:20:46.82,Eng,,0,0,0,,You've stepped into a world of lies, Grace.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:46.82,1:20:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,没有一个人会讲真话
Dialogue: 2,1:20:46.82,1:20:48.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing anyone says is true.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:48.99,1:20:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,当他说会保护你时 记住我刚才说的话
Dialogue: 2,1:20:48.99,1:20:52.16,Eng,,0,0,0,,Just remember that when he promises to protect you.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:52.16,1:20:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,格蕾丝
Dialogue: 2,1:20:52.16,1:20:53.29,Eng,,0,0,0,,Grace.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:07.68,1:21:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不见了 伊森
Dialogue: 2,1:21:07.68,1:21:09.97,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time, Ethan.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:10.55,1:21:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,当年你应该杀了我的
Dialogue: 2,1:21:10.55,1:21:12.68,Eng,,0,0,0,,You should've killed me when you had the chance.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:14.02,1:21:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上好 各位
Dialogue: 2,1:21:14.02,1:21:16.64,Eng,,0,0,0,,Good evening, everyone.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:16.64,1:21:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是约翰拉克吗
Dialogue: 2,1:21:16.64,1:21:19.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,If it isn't John Lark.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:20.36,1:21:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜这个身份是假的
Dialogue: 2,1:21:20.36,1:21:22.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,Except it isn't, actually.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:23.02,1:21:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不过在你告诉我真名之前
Dialogue: 2,1:21:23.02,1:21:25.28,Eng,,0,0,0,,But until you're ready to tell me your real name,
Dialogue: 1,1:21:25.28,1:21:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我只好继续叫你拉克了
Dialogue: 2,1:21:25.28,1:21:27.82,Eng,,0,0,0,,Lark will have to do.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:28.66,1:21:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 阿兰娜
Dialogue: 2,1:21:28.66,1:21:30.45,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's good to see you, Alana.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:34.12,1:21:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你是盖布瑞尔吧 我没猜错吧
Dialogue: 2,1:21:34.12,1:21:37.21,Eng,,0,0,0,,And you're Gabriel, I presume.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:37.21,1:21:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我对你可真是一无所知呢
Dialogue: 2,1:21:37.21,1:21:40.25,Eng,,0,0,0,,I've heard so very little about you.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:40.25,1:21:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你真人要比我想象中英俊多了
Dialogue: 2,1:21:40.25,1:21:43.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,Aren't you so much more handsome in person?
Dialogue: 1,1:21:46.30,1:21:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,还是个风度翩翩的绅士
Dialogue: 2,1:21:46.30,1:21:48.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,Such a gentleman, too.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:53.60,1:21:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是格蕾丝吧
Dialogue: 2,1:21:53.60,1:21:55.52,Eng,,0,0,0,,And you must be Grace.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:58.39,1:22:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我应该认识你吗
Dialogue: 2,1:21:58.39,1:22:00.69,Eng,,0,0,0,,Should I know you?
Dialogue: 1,1:22:00.69,1:22:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你那里应该有我想要的东西
Dialogue: 2,1:22:00.69,1:22:03.44,Eng,,0,0,0,,I believe you have something for me.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:03.44,1:22:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是你雇的我
Dialogue: 2,1:22:03.44,1:22:05.36,Eng,,0,0,0,,You hired me.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:05.36,1:22:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是我特意挑选的你
Dialogue: 2,1:22:05.36,1:22:07.61,Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, I handpicked you.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:18.04,1:22:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,别乱来
Dialogue: 2,1:22:18.04,1:22:19.00,Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 1,1:22:20.79,1:22:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你别乱来
Dialogue: 2,1:22:20.79,1:22:21.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:42.90,1:22:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不在她身上
Dialogue: 2,1:22:42.90,1:22:44.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,She doesn't have it.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:45.23,1:22:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙在哪儿
Dialogue: 2,1:22:45.23,1:22:46.69,Eng,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 1,1:22:46.69,1:22:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,在一个你打死都想不到的地方
Dialogue: 2,1:22:46.69,1:22:49.40,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's in the last place you would ever think to look.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:52.36,1:22:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不如我们一起上楼喝一杯吧
Dialogue: 2,1:22:52.36,1:22:54.53,Eng,,0,0,0,,Why don't we go upstairs and have a drink?
Dialogue: 1,1:22:58.70,1:22:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要去哪儿
Dialogue: 2,1:22:58.70,1:22:59.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 1,1:23:00.37,1:23:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这是私人派对 你们不能进去
Dialogue: 2,1:23:00.37,1:23:02.29,Eng,,0,0,0,,This is a private party. You can't come in.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:13.64,1:23:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 2,1:23:13.64,1:23:14.72,Eng,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:14.72,1:23:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,想必你们都知道 我只是个中间人
Dialogue: 2,1:23:14.72,1:23:17.85,Eng,,0,0,0,,As most of you know, I am merely a broker.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:17.85,1:23:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,联系买家和卖家
Dialogue: 2,1:23:17.85,1:23:19.64,Eng,,0,0,0,,I connect a buyer and a seller.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:19.64,1:23:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,有时是为了钱 有时是为了消息
Dialogue: 2,1:23:19.64,1:23:22.44,Eng,,0,0,0,,Sometimes for money, sometimes for information,
Dialogue: 1,1:23:22.44,1:23:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,但更多时候是为了交情
Dialogue: 2,1:23:22.44,1:23:25.94,Eng,,0,0,0,,but mostly for friendship.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:26.65,1:23:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望大家都能相处融洽
Dialogue: 2,1:23:26.65,1:23:29.44,Eng,,0,0,0,,I just want everyone to get along.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:30.24,1:23:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是和我之间
Dialogue: 2,1:23:30.24,1:23:32.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,With me, especially.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:32.74,1:23:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 世界正在改变
Dialogue: 2,1:23:32.74,1:23:35.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,But the world is changing.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:35.91,1:23:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,真相逐渐模糊
Dialogue: 2,1:23:35.91,1:23:37.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,Truth is vanishing.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:37.78,1:23:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,战争即将爆发
Dialogue: 2,1:23:37.78,1:23:39.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,War is coming.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:39.91,1:23:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,而能打开这个新世界大门的竟然是 一把钥匙
Dialogue: 2,1:23:39.91,1:23:44.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,And the key to world domination is, of all things, a key.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:45.67,1:23:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,一把可以控制智体的钥匙
Dialogue: 2,1:23:45.67,1:23:48.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,One with the power to control the Entity.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:49.34,1:23:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,一把所有国家
Dialogue: 2,1:23:49.34,1:23:51.05,Eng,,0,0,0,,One that any government in the world
Dialogue: 1,1:23:51.05,1:23:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,都不惜斥巨资购买的钥匙
Dialogue: 2,1:23:51.05,1:23:54.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,would pay a king's ransom to take possession of.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:54.59,1:23:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,而我的一群好友
Dialogue: 2,1:23:54.59,1:23:56.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,And some of my dearest friends--
Dialogue: 1,1:23:56.47,1:24:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的是那些核武器大国 还有几个小国
Dialogue: 2,1:23:56.47,1:24:00.14,Eng,,0,0,0,,in this case, every major nuclear power and a handful of minor ones--
Dialogue: 1,1:24:00.14,1:24:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,都托我为他们找到这把钥匙
Dialogue: 2,1:24:00.14,1:24:02.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,have asked me to deliver this key.
Dialogue: 1,1:24:02.23,1:24:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,很正常 但如果你找到了钥匙
Dialogue: 2,1:24:02.23,1:24:04.60,Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course, if you do find the key,
Dialogue: 1,1:24:04.60,1:24:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你将会处于进退两难的境地
Dialogue: 2,1:24:04.60,1:24:07.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,you'll be forced to confront an impossible dilemma.
Dialogue: 1,1:24:07.27,1:24:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,得到钥匙的那方将会永远感激你
Dialogue: 2,1:24:07.27,1:24:10.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,Whoever you give the key to will be forever in your debt.
Dialogue: 1,1:24:10.48,1:24:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,而对于其他国家 你将会是他们永远的敌人
Dialogue: 2,1:24:10.48,1:24:13.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,But to the rest of the world, you'll be an enemy.
Dialogue: 1,1:24:14.57,1:24:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这姑娘对我胃口
Dialogue: 2,1:24:14.57,1:24:15.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, I like her!
Dialogue: 1,1:24:15.74,1:24:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你和他是什么关系
Dialogue: 2,1:24:15.74,1:24:18.70,Eng,,0,0,0,,What's your relationship with him?
Dialogue: 1,1:24:18.70,1:24:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,盖布瑞尔代表了另一个感兴趣的客户
Dialogue: 2,1:24:18.70,1:24:21.49,Eng,,0,0,0,,Gabriel represents another interested party.
Dialogue: 1,1:24:22.08,1:24:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上 今天的派对
Dialogue: 2,1:24:22.08,1:24:24.54,Eng,,0,0,0,,In fact, this party
Dialogue: 1,1:24:24.54,1:24:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,就是由这位客户一手促成的
Dialogue: 2,1:24:24.54,1:24:28.38,Eng,,0,0,0,,was arranged by that interested party.
Dialogue: 1,1:24:28.38,1:24:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至可以说今晚的派对 到处都是那个客户的身影
Dialogue: 2,1:24:28.38,1:24:32.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,You could even say that this party is that interested party.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:05.75,1:25:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这难道…
Dialogue: 2,1:25:05.75,1:25:07.33,Eng,,0,0,0,,Is this…
Dialogue: 1,1:25:08.46,1:25:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是智体
Dialogue: 2,1:25:08.46,1:25:09.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,The Entity.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:11.84,1:25:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,越来越有意思了
Dialogue: 2,1:25:11.84,1:25:14.01,Eng,,0,0,0,,And so the plot thickens.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:14.80,1:25:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我是该把钥匙交给老朋友们呢
Dialogue: 2,1:25:14.80,1:25:17.01,Eng,,0,0,0,,Do I give the key to one of my old friends,
Dialogue: 1,1:25:17.01,1:25:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,还是把钥匙和我的命运 一同交给盖布瑞尔
Dialogue: 2,1:25:17.01,1:25:20.60,Eng,,0,0,0,,or do I hand it and my fate over to Gabriel
Dialogue: 1,1:25:20.60,1:25:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,和他那台机械恶魔呢
Dialogue: 2,1:25:20.60,1:25:23.64,Eng,,0,0,0,,and his infernal machine?
Dialogue: 1,1:25:25.31,1:25:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道 自己一定能得到完整的钥匙呢
Dialogue: 2,1:25:25.31,1:25:28.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,What makes you so sure you'll get the completed key?
Dialogue: 1,1:25:30.06,1:25:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你手里已经有一半了
Dialogue: 2,1:25:30.06,1:25:31.40,Eng,,0,0,0,,You have one half of it.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:31.98,1:25:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,而她知道另一半在哪儿
Dialogue: 2,1:25:31.98,1:25:35.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,And she knows where the other half is.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:38.40,1:25:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,假设你真得到了钥匙
Dialogue: 2,1:25:38.40,1:25:40.70,Eng,,0,0,0,,Assuming you can get it,
Dialogue: 1,1:25:41.70,1:25:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不把钥匙 和它强大的力量占为己有呢
Dialogue: 2,1:25:41.70,1:25:45.16,Eng,,0,0,0,,why don't you just keep the key and all that power for yourself?
Dialogue: 1,1:25:45.16,1:25:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,因为她也和我们一样
Dialogue: 2,1:25:45.16,1:25:47.96,Eng,,0,0,0,,Because she doesn't know what it unlocks
Dialogue: 1,1:25:47.96,1:25:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道钥匙该怎么用
Dialogue: 2,1:25:47.96,1:25:49.96,Eng,,0,0,0,,any more than the rest of us.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:51.00,1:25:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不管愿不愿意 你只能做出选择
Dialogue: 2,1:25:51.00,1:25:53.38,Eng,,0,0,0,,So, like it or not, you have to choose a suitor.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:53.38,1:25:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这话真不中听 拉克 但说得没错
Dialogue: 2,1:25:53.38,1:25:57.42,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's distastefully put, Lark, but it's true.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:57.42,1:26:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,毋庸置疑 我知道它能打开什么
Dialogue: 2,1:25:57.42,1:26:00.72,Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course I know what it unlocks.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:01.47,1:26:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他出的又是什么条件呢
Dialogue: 2,1:26:01.47,1:26:03.85,Eng,,0,0,0,,And what's he offering for the key?
Dialogue: 1,1:26:03.85,1:26:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,就像我之前和格蕾丝说的 我不是为了钥匙而来
Dialogue: 2,1:26:03.85,1:26:07.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,As I've explained to Grace before, I'm not here for any key,
Dialogue: 1,1:26:07.35,1:26:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,因为明天一早两半钥匙都会在我手里
Dialogue: 2,1:26:07.35,1:26:09.89,Eng,,0,0,0,,as I'll have both halves in hand tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:10.56,1:26:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么让你这么笃信
Dialogue: 2,1:26:10.56,1:26:12.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,What makes you so certain of that?
Dialogue: 1,1:26:12.23,1:26:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本不知道我背后的势力有多强大
Dialogue: 2,1:26:12.23,1:26:15.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,You've no idea of the power I represent.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:15.15,1:26:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,每毫秒数百京次的计算量
Dialogue: 2,1:26:15.15,1:26:18.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,Thousands of quadrillions of computations per millisecond
Dialogue: 1,1:26:18.78,1:26:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,巧妙地操纵着数十亿人的思想
Dialogue: 2,1:26:18.78,1:26:22.41,Eng,,0,0,0,,subtly manipulating the minds of billions
Dialogue: 1,1:26:22.41,1:26:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,同时解析着每一种因果关系
Dialogue: 2,1:26:22.41,1:26:25.29,Eng,,0,0,0,,while parsing every possible cause and effect,
Dialogue: 1,1:26:25.29,1:26:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,每一种可能性 即使再不合理
Dialogue: 2,1:26:25.29,1:26:28.12,Eng,,0,0,0,,every scenario, however implausible,
Dialogue: 1,1:26:28.12,1:26:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,也能将其转化成概率图 显示出最有可能的结果
Dialogue: 2,1:26:28.12,1:26:32.58,Eng,,0,0,0,,into a very real map of a most probable next.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:32.58,1:26:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,即便是当下发生了一些变故
Dialogue: 2,1:26:32.58,1:26:35.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,And with only a few changes to the present,
Dialogue: 1,1:26:35.63,1:26:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,并不会改变既定的未来
Dialogue: 2,1:26:35.63,1:26:38.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,the future is all but assured.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:39.67,1:26:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定会拿到钥匙
Dialogue: 2,1:26:39.67,1:26:41.72,Eng,,0,0,0,,The key will come to me.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:42.43,1:26:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,明天
Dialogue: 2,1:26:42.43,1:26:43.30,Eng,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:44.35,1:26:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,在开往因斯布鲁克的东方快车上
Dialogue: 2,1:26:44.35,1:26:47.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,On the Orient Express bound for Innsbruck.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:47.27,1:26:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,因斯布鲁克
Dialogue: 2,1:26:47.27,1:26:48.73,Eng,,0,0,0,,Innsbruck?
Dialogue: 1,1:26:48.73,1:26:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,它都知道
Dialogue: 2,1:26:48.73,1:26:50.14,Eng,,0,0,0,,It knows.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:50.14,1:26:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,它知道你已经选好了买家
Dialogue: 2,1:26:50.14,1:26:53.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,It knows that you've already chosen your suitor.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:53.35,1:26:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,它还知道你打算把两半钥匙组合起来
Dialogue: 2,1:26:53.35,1:26:56.73,Eng,,0,0,0,,It knows that you intend to mate the two halves of the key
Dialogue: 1,1:26:56.73,1:26:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,想在绝境中掌控局面
Dialogue: 2,1:26:56.73,1:26:58.57,Eng,,0,0,0,,in a desperate grasp for control.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:59.53,1:27:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,而它也向我保证过 完整的钥匙
Dialogue: 2,1:26:59.53,1:27:02.36,Eng,,0,0,0,,I, however, have been promised the completed key
Dialogue: 1,1:27:02.36,1:27:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,会被送到我的跟前
Dialogue: 2,1:27:02.36,1:27:04.45,Eng,,0,0,0,,will lay itself at my feet,
Dialogue: 1,1:27:05.16,1:27:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,只要有人在今晚丧命
Dialogue: 2,1:27:05.16,1:27:08.04,Eng,,0,0,0,,provided someone dies tonight.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:09.41,1:27:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,谁
Dialogue: 2,1:27:09.41,1:27:10.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 1,1:27:11.41,1:27:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,她
Dialogue: 2,1:27:11.41,1:27:12.25,Eng,,0,0,0,,Her.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:14.17,1:27:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,或者是她
Dialogue: 2,1:27:14.17,1:27:15.17,Eng,,0,0,0,,Or her.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:17.71,1:27:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,而你会目睹这一切 伊森
Dialogue: 2,1:27:17.71,1:27:19.84,Eng,,0,0,0,,And you will bear witness, Ethan.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:19.84,1:27:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我将得到钥匙 也会全身而退
Dialogue: 2,1:27:19.84,1:27:23.97,Eng,,0,0,0,,The key will be mine, and I will be gone,
Dialogue: 1,1:27:23.97,1:27:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,如风暴里的一缕烟尘
Dialogue: 2,1:27:23.97,1:27:26.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,like smoke in a hurricane.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:26.47,1:27:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但一切要等你在乎的那个人死去之后
Dialogue: 2,1:27:26.47,1:27:29.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,But only after someone you care about dies.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:31.60,1:27:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,一切早已注定
Dialogue: 2,1:27:31.60,1:27:32.94,Eng,,0,0,0,,It is written.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:34.65,1:27:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你看出来了
Dialogue: 2,1:27:34.65,1:27:36.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,You see what this is,
Dialogue: 1,1:27:37.15,1:27:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 2,1:27:37.15,1:27:38.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,don't you?
Dialogue: 1,1:27:39.69,1:27:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他害怕了
Dialogue: 2,1:27:39.69,1:27:41.28,Eng,,0,0,0,,He's afraid.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:42.03,1:27:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,智体害怕了
Dialogue: 2,1:27:42.03,1:27:43.61,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's afraid.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:44.45,1:27:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,它看到我们步步逼近
Dialogue: 2,1:27:44.45,1:27:46.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,Somehow it knows we're close.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:47.53,1:27:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不然怎么会派你来呢
Dialogue: 2,1:27:47.53,1:27:48.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,Why else would you be here?
Dialogue: 1,1:27:49.70,1:27:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我 帮我组合两把钥匙 我一定可以除掉智体
Dialogue: 2,1:27:49.70,1:27:53.62,Eng,,0,0,0,,Help me. Help me complete the key, and I will kill this thing.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:53.62,1:27:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,智体知道你所有的秘密 阿兰娜
Dialogue: 2,1:27:53.62,1:27:55.42,Eng,,0,0,0,,It knows your every secret, Alana.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:55.42,1:27:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,别听他的 他就是个疯子
Dialogue: 2,1:27:55.42,1:27:57.34,Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to this fanatic.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:57.34,1:27:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,如果帮他你也得死
Dialogue: 2,1:27:57.34,1:27:58.84,Eng,,0,0,0,,Help him and you'll die, too.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:58.84,1:28:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,帮他的话 所有人都会死
Dialogue: 2,1:27:58.84,1:28:01.01,Eng,,0,0,0,,Help him, everyone dies.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:01.01,1:28:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我们明天见
Dialogue: 2,1:28:01.01,1:28:03.05,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:04.30,1:28:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,阿兰娜
Dialogue: 2,1:28:04.30,1:28:05.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,Alana?
Dialogue: 1,1:28:13.39,1:28:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他的命运已成定局
Dialogue: 2,1:28:13.39,1:28:15.40,Eng,,0,0,0,,His fate is written.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:15.40,1:28:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你想成为下一个他吗
Dialogue: 2,1:28:15.40,1:28:17.06,Eng,,0,0,0,,Shall we write yours, too?
Dialogue: 1,1:28:18.73,1:28:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,阿兰娜
Dialogue: 2,1:28:18.73,1:28:19.73,Eng,,0,0,0,,Alana.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:22.94,1:28:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉 拉克
Dialogue: 2,1:28:22.94,1:28:25.49,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Lark.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:36.54,1:28:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,看在过去的份上 我可以让你自己来选
Dialogue: 2,1:28:36.54,1:28:39.13,Eng,,0,0,0,,For old times' sake, I'll let you choose which one.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:40.38,1:28:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,选伊尔莎
Dialogue: 2,1:28:40.38,1:28:41.21,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ilsa…
Dialogue: 1,1:28:42.13,1:28:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,还是格蕾丝
Dialogue: 2,1:28:42.13,1:28:43.34,Eng,,0,0,0,,or Grace.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:43.34,1:28:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他 佐拉 趁现在还有机会
Dialogue: 2,1:28:43.34,1:28:46.76,Eng,,0,0,0,,Kill him, Zola. Kill him. Kill him where he stands!
Dialogue: 1,1:28:46.76,1:28:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那就由你来选吧 阿兰娜
Dialogue: 2,1:28:46.76,1:28:48.72,Eng,,0,0,0,,The choice is yours then, Alana.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:48.72,1:28:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我要提醒你 格蕾丝知道那半把钥匙在哪儿
Dialogue: 2,1:28:48.72,1:28:51.68,Eng,,0,0,0,,Though I'll remind you, Grace knows where half the key is.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:53.14,1:28:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,如果她们两人有什么三长两短
Dialogue: 2,1:28:53.14,1:28:56.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,If anything happens to either of them,
Dialogue: 1,1:28:56.31,1:29:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你和你的上帝 将在这世上无处安身
Dialogue: 2,1:28:56.31,1:29:00.57,Eng,,0,0,0,,there is no place on Earth where you or your god will be safe from me.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:00.57,1:29:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我会追杀你到天涯海角 这也是"定局"
Dialogue: 2,1:29:00.57,1:29:04.57,Eng,,0,0,0,,There's no place that I won't go to kill you. That is written.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:04.57,1:29:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 老朋友
Dialogue: 2,1:29:04.57,1:29:06.57,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's good to see you, old friend.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:12.66,1:29:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,回头见
Dialogue: 2,1:29:12.66,1:29:13.70,Eng,,0,0,0,,See you soon.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:39.19,1:29:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你犯了一个天大的错误
Dialogue: 2,1:29:39.19,1:29:42.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,You have made a terrible mistake.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:42.27,1:29:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我自己也命悬一线
Dialogue: 2,1:29:42.27,1:29:44.57,Eng,,0,0,0,,My life is on the line here.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:45.15,1:29:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我明天必须上那趟列车
Dialogue: 2,1:29:45.15,1:29:47.53,Eng,,0,0,0,,I have to be on that train tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:48.61,1:29:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我也必须拿到那把钥匙
Dialogue: 2,1:29:48.61,1:29:50.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,And I have to have that key.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:52.16,1:29:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不在乎用什么手段
Dialogue: 2,1:29:52.16,1:29:55.45,Eng,,0,0,0,,And I do not care how I get it.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:59.50,1:30:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 2,1:29:59.50,1:30:00.33,Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:06.30,1:30:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,能跑多远跑多远
Dialogue: 2,1:30:06.30,1:30:07.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,Run as far as you can.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:47.88,1:30:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么…
Dialogue: 2,1:30:47.88,1:30:48.80,Eng,,0,0,0,,What the f--
Dialogue: 1,1:31:52.99,1:31:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,格蕾丝
Dialogue: 2,1:31:52.99,1:31:54.28,Eng,,0,0,0,,Grace! Grace!
Dialogue: 1,1:31:55.45,1:31:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,格蕾丝
Dialogue: 2,1:31:55.45,1:31:56.28,Eng,,0,0,0,,Grace!
Dialogue: 1,1:32:11.55,1:32:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,卢瑟 班吉 能听到吗 帮我看监控
Dialogue: 2,1:32:11.55,1:32:13.93,Eng,,0,0,0,,Luther, Benji, if you hear me, I need eyes.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:13.93,1:32:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,格蕾丝从公爵府跑了 钥匙在她那儿
Dialogue: 2,1:32:13.93,1:32:16.26,Eng,,0,0,0,,Grace is leaving the Ducale on foot. She has the key.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:16.26,1:32:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们在 你说 -告诉我 她人在哪儿
Dialogue: 2,1:32:16.26,1:32:18.93,Eng,,0,0,0,,-We're here. Go. -Need to find her. Where is she?
Dialogue: 1,1:32:19.47,1:32:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 图像消失了 得换个卫星
Dialogue: 2,1:32:19.47,1:32:21.52,Eng,,0,0,0,,Damn it! I've lost picture. I need another satellite.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:21.52,1:32:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我试试俄罗斯尖峰4号间谍卫星
Dialogue: 2,1:32:21.52,1:32:23.77,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hacking the Russian Zenith 4 spy satellite.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:23.77,1:32:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,选择不多 只能凑合着用了
Dialogue: 2,1:32:23.77,1:32:25.94,Eng,,0,0,0,,We're scraping the barrel, but it'll have to do.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:34.65,1:32:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 2,1:32:34.65,1:32:35.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 1,1:32:55.05,1:32:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,该往哪儿走 快点
Dialogue: 2,1:32:55.05,1:32:57.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,Where am I going? Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:57.51,1:32:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-稍等一下 -快点
Dialogue: 2,1:32:57.51,1:32:59.60,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Stand by. -Just hurry.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:59.60,1:33:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,她在你北面 正在过桥
Dialogue: 2,1:32:59.60,1:33:01.22,Eng,,0,0,0,,She's just north of you, crossing the bridge.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:01.22,1:33:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,班吉 再说一次
Dialogue: 2,1:33:01.22,1:33:02.22,Eng,,0,0,0,,Say again, Benji.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:02.22,1:33:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,往北面 伊森 她正在过桥
Dialogue: 2,1:33:02.22,1:33:04.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,Just head north. She's crossing the bridge.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:22.24,1:33:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森 拐进你右边的小路
Dialogue: 2,1:33:22.24,1:33:24.16,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ethan, take the passage to your right.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:24.16,1:33:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-好的 我看到了 -走到底 然后再左拐
Dialogue: 2,1:33:24.16,1:33:27.29,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, I see it! -Down that narrow alley and turn left.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:27.29,1:33:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-又没有画面了 -我再找另一个
Dialogue: 2,1:33:27.29,1:33:29.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,-I'm losing picture again. -Looking for another.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:30.08,1:33:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,智体的攻破速度太快了 我根本来不及黑进那些卫星
Dialogue: 2,1:33:30.08,1:33:33.42,Eng,,0,0,0,,The Entity is knocking out satellites faster than I can hack into them.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:58.91,1:34:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,班吉 我没看到她 她在哪儿
Dialogue: 2,1:33:58.91,1:34:00.70,Eng,,0,0,0,,Benji, I don't see her. Where is she?
Dialogue: 1,1:34:00.70,1:34:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-走到底 然后再左拐 -好的 收到
Dialogue: 2,1:34:00.70,1:34:03.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Down the narrow alley and turn left. -Okay, copy that.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:04.37,1:34:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,右拐
Dialogue: 2,1:34:04.37,1:34:05.20,Eng,,0,0,0,,Turn right.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:05.20,1:34:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 说错了 应该是左拐 再左拐
Dialogue: 2,1:34:05.20,1:34:07.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, my mistake. I meant left. Another left.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:07.91,1:34:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪
Dialogue: 2,1:34:07.91,1:34:09.46,Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:09.46,1:34:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森 通讯系统被入侵了 和你说话的是智体
Dialogue: 2,1:34:09.46,1:34:12.25,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ethan, our comms have been breached! You're talking to the Entity!
Dialogue: 1,1:34:12.79,1:34:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,左拐 再右拐 上左边那座桥
Dialogue: 2,1:34:12.79,1:34:15.96,Eng,,0,0,0,,Turn left. Turn right. Take the bridge to your left.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:15.96,1:34:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森 那不是我 能听到吗
Dialogue: 2,1:34:15.96,1:34:18.01,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ethan, that is not me! Do you copy?
Dialogue: 1,1:34:18.01,1:34:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森 请回复
Dialogue: 2,1:34:18.01,1:34:18.93,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ethan, come in.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:18.93,1:34:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,走到底 再左拐
Dialogue: 2,1:34:18.93,1:34:21.80,Eng,,0,0,0,,Down the alley to your left. Turn left.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:21.80,1:34:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,左拐 右拐
Dialogue: 2,1:34:21.80,1:34:23.30,Eng,,0,0,0,,Turn right.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:25.01,1:34:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,试着重连通讯系统
Dialogue: 2,1:34:25.01,1:34:26.18,Eng,,0,0,0,,Try to reestablish comms.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:26.18,1:34:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-等等 你要去哪儿 -我得去找伊森
Dialogue: 2,1:34:26.18,1:34:28.10,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Wait, where are you going? -To try and find Ethan.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:28.10,1:34:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,走到底 然后再右拐
Dialogue: 2,1:34:28.10,1:34:30.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,Go to the end of the alley and turn right.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:30.35,1:34:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森 看到格蕾丝了 她就在你前方800米左右 往那条路走
Dialogue: 2,1:34:30.35,1:34:34.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ethan, I see Grace about 800 meters in front of you. Take that passage.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:43.53,1:34:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 不是那条路
Dialogue: 2,1:34:43.53,1:34:44.58,Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait! Not that way!
Dialogue: 1,1:34:44.58,1:34:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 2,1:34:44.58,1:34:45.49,Eng,,0,0,0,,What, why?
Dialogue: 1,1:34:46.08,1:34:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,哪条路
Dialogue: 2,1:34:46.08,1:34:47.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,Which way?
Dialogue: 1,1:34:47.83,1:34:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 左边还是右边
Dialogue: 2,1:34:47.83,1:34:49.12,Eng,,0,0,0,,Left or right?
Dialogue: 1,1:34:49.12,1:34:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,无所谓了
Dialogue: 2,1:34:49.12,1:34:50.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:50.83,1:34:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 什么叫无所谓 她在哪儿
Dialogue: 2,1:34:50.83,1:34:53.38,Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, it doesn't matter? Where is she?
Dialogue: 1,1:34:53.38,1:34:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,她马上就要到米尼治桥了
Dialogue: 2,1:34:53.38,1:34:55.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,She's on her way to the Minich Bridge
Dialogue: 1,1:34:57.55,1:34:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,盖布瑞尔在那里等她
Dialogue: 2,1:34:57.55,1:34:59.76,Eng,,0,0,0,,where Gabriel is waiting.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:00.34,1:35:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你来不及赶过去了
Dialogue: 2,1:35:00.34,1:35:02.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,You will never get there in time.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:03.39,1:35:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不过你可以 伊尔莎
Dialogue: 2,1:35:03.39,1:35:05.18,Eng,,0,0,0,,But you can, Ilsa.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:06.39,1:35:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你最在乎的是什么 伊森
Dialogue: 2,1:35:06.39,1:35:09.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,I know what matters most to you, Ethan.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:09.48,1:35:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是班吉
Dialogue: 2,1:35:09.48,1:35:11.10,Eng,,0,0,0,,This isn't Benji.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:11.10,1:35:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我当然不是
Dialogue: 2,1:35:11.10,1:35:12.77,Eng,,0,0,0,,No, it's not.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:13.40,1:35:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,"等死吧"
Dialogue: 2,1:35:13.40,1:35:15.40,Eng,,0,0,0,,But you are done.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:38.67,1:35:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那就你了
Dialogue: 2,1:35:38.67,1:35:39.80,Eng,,0,0,0,,So be it.
Dialogue: 1,1:38:16.16,1:38:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我期待的那个是你
Dialogue: 2,1:38:16.16,1:38:18.08,Eng,,0,0,0,,I was hoping it'd be you.
Dialogue: 1,1:41:48.33,1:41:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 2,1:41:48.33,1:41:49.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 1,1:41:50.92,1:41:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我忘了你的名字
Dialogue: 2,1:41:50.92,1:41:52.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,I've forgotten your name.
Dialogue: 1,1:41:52.59,1:41:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,卢瑟
Dialogue: 2,1:41:52.59,1:41:53.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,Luther.
Dialogue: 1,1:41:55.59,1:41:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,班吉
Dialogue: 2,1:41:55.59,1:41:56.42,Eng,,0,0,0,,Benji.
Dialogue: 1,1:41:58.38,1:41:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那她呢
Dialogue: 2,1:41:58.38,1:41:59.34,Eng,,0,0,0,,And her?
Dialogue: 1,1:42:00.47,1:42:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,伊尔莎
Dialogue: 2,1:42:00.47,1:42:01.64,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ilsa.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:03.35,1:42:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你们关系很好吗
Dialogue: 2,1:42:03.35,1:42:04.72,Eng,,0,0,0,,Were you close?
Dialogue: 1,1:42:05.56,1:42:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你们和她
Dialogue: 2,1:42:05.56,1:42:06.89,Eng,,0,0,0,,You and she?
Dialogue: 1,1:42:07.44,1:42:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,以我们自己的方式
Dialogue: 2,1:42:07.44,1:42:08.98,Eng,,0,0,0,,In our way.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:11.65,1:42:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我她才死了
Dialogue: 2,1:42:11.65,1:42:13.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm the reason she's dead.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:13.19,1:42:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 2,1:42:13.19,1:42:14.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:14.15,1:42:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,因为她你才活着
Dialogue: 2,1:42:14.15,1:42:16.57,Eng,,0,0,0,,She's the reason you're alive.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:16.57,1:42:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这才是事实
Dialogue: 2,1:42:16.57,1:42:18.66,Eng,,0,0,0,,And that's the truth.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:18.66,1:42:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么想
Dialogue: 2,1:42:18.66,1:42:20.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to feel about it.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:20.74,1:42:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,也许一辈子都想不通
Dialogue: 2,1:42:20.74,1:42:22.41,Eng,,0,0,0,,You probably never will.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:24.24,1:42:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 2,1:42:24.24,1:42:25.62,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:27.33,1:42:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有什么我可以帮忙的
Dialogue: 2,1:42:27.33,1:42:29.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,If there's anything I can do to help…
Dialogue: 1,1:42:29.87,1:42:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正想跟你谈这件事
Dialogue: 2,1:42:29.87,1:42:31.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,That's what we'd like to talk to you about.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:33.80,1:42:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,大约在三小时之后
Dialogue: 2,1:42:33.80,1:42:36.38,Eng,,0,0,0,,In a little over three hours,
Dialogue: 1,1:42:36.38,1:42:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,白寡妇将会登上 开往因斯布鲁克的东方快车
Dialogue: 2,1:42:36.38,1:42:41.18,Eng,,0,0,0,,the White Widow is expected to be on the Orient Express to Innsbruck
Dialogue: 1,1:42:41.18,1:42:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,在车上买家会和她完成交易 拿到完整的钥匙
Dialogue: 2,1:42:41.18,1:42:45.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,where a buyer is waiting to take receipt of the complete and verified key.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:45.27,1:42:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,可她手里并没有完整的钥匙
Dialogue: 2,1:42:45.27,1:42:47.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,But she doesn't have the complete key.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:47.48,1:42:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那个白寡妇确实没有
Dialogue: 2,1:42:47.48,1:42:49.10,Eng,,0,0,0,,That Widow doesn't.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:51.15,1:42:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们的版本可以有
Dialogue: 2,1:42:51.15,1:42:52.52,Eng,,0,0,0,,But ours could.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:52.52,1:42:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么东西
Dialogue: 2,1:42:52.52,1:42:55.02,Eng,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 1,1:42:55.90,1:42:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,一个让你变成别人的机会
Dialogue: 2,1:42:55.90,1:42:58.24,Eng,,0,0,0,,Your chance to be someone else.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:58.24,1:42:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我不懂你意思
Dialogue: 2,1:42:58.24,1:42:59.24,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:59.24,1:43:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,老实和你说 格蕾丝 你惹了很大麻烦
Dialogue: 2,1:42:59.24,1:43:01.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna lie to you, Grace. You're in a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:01.99,1:43:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这次就算你有再多假护照也没用了
Dialogue: 2,1:43:01.99,1:43:04.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,No number of fake passports is gonna get you out of this one.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:04.74,1:43:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,各国都知道你是谁了
Dialogue: 2,1:43:04.74,1:43:06.33,Eng,,0,0,0,,Governments know who you are.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:06.33,1:43:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,白寡妇也知道了
Dialogue: 2,1:43:06.33,1:43:07.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,The White Widow knows.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:07.83,1:43:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,还有智体
Dialogue: 2,1:43:07.83,1:43:09.33,Eng,,0,0,0,,And the Entity knows.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:09.33,1:43:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,摆在你面前的只有三条路可选
Dialogue: 2,1:43:09.33,1:43:12.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,Your future boils down to three options now.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:12.71,1:43:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,坐牢
Dialogue: 2,1:43:12.71,1:43:13.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,Prison.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:13.79,1:43:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,丧命
Dialogue: 2,1:43:13.79,1:43:15.17,Eng,,0,0,0,,Death.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:15.17,1:43:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,或者做一个选择
Dialogue: 2,1:43:15.17,1:43:16.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,Or the choice.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:16.59,1:43:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,什么选择
Dialogue: 2,1:43:16.59,1:43:18.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,The choice?
Dialogue: 1,1:43:18.63,1:43:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,在过去的某个时间
Dialogue: 2,1:43:18.63,1:43:20.05,Eng,,0,0,0,,At one time or another,
Dialogue: 1,1:43:20.05,1:43:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,在座的我们都经历过和你类似的情况
Dialogue: 2,1:43:20.05,1:43:23.18,Eng,,0,0,0,,each of us was in a similar situation to yours.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:23.18,1:43:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我们都曾面临过这个选择
Dialogue: 2,1:43:23.18,1:43:25.81,Eng,,0,0,0,,And each of us was offered the choice.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:25.81,1:43:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-现在同样的选择权交给你 -是什么
Dialogue: 2,1:43:25.81,1:43:29.18,Eng,,0,0,0,,-The same choice we're offering you now. -Which is?
Dialogue: 1,1:43:30.14,1:43:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以加入我们
Dialogue: 2,1:43:30.14,1:43:31.60,Eng,,0,0,0,,To come with us.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:32.90,1:43:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,成为幽灵般的存在
Dialogue: 2,1:43:32.90,1:43:34.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,And be a ghost.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:10.20,1:45:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 停一下
Dialogue: 2,1:45:10.20,1:45:12.29,Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait. Stop, stop.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:13.45,1:45:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你们开玩笑的吧
Dialogue: 2,1:45:13.45,1:45:14.46,Eng,,0,0,0,,You're not serious.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:14.46,1:45:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才不是说愿意帮我们做任何事吗
Dialogue: 2,1:45:14.46,1:45:17.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, you did say you'd do anything to help.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:17.50,1:45:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你想从火车上跳下去 带着那把钥匙
Dialogue: 2,1:45:17.50,1:45:21.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,And you jump off the train with the key?
Dialogue: 1,1:45:21.59,1:45:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 2,1:45:21.59,1:45:22.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:22.51,1:45:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你一个人
Dialogue: 2,1:45:22.51,1:45:24.13,Eng,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:24.13,1:45:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-不是我们 -没错
Dialogue: 2,1:45:24.13,1:45:26.30,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Not us. -Yes.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:27.01,1:45:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那我要怎么办
Dialogue: 2,1:45:27.01,1:45:28.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,And what happens to me?
Dialogue: 1,1:45:28.39,1:45:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候你会被情报局派来的人逮捕
Dialogue: 2,1:45:28.39,1:45:31.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll be taken into custody by Clandestine Services,
Dialogue: 1,1:45:31.51,1:45:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,很可能就是那几个在机场追我的特工
Dialogue: 2,1:45:31.51,1:45:35.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,most likely the same men that have been chasing me since Abu Dhabi.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:35.48,1:45:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,用不了多久 会有一个人来见你
Dialogue: 2,1:45:35.48,1:45:38.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,Shortly thereafter, a man will come to see you.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:38.19,1:45:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫尤金基特里奇
Dialogue: 2,1:45:38.19,1:45:40.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,His name is Eugene Kittridge.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:40.15,1:45:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他是我派你去的 我还给了你那项选择
Dialogue: 2,1:45:40.15,1:45:43.32,Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll tell him I sent you, that I gave you the choice,
Dialogue: 1,1:45:44.15,1:45:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,而同时你也选择了接受
Dialogue: 2,1:45:44.15,1:45:46.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,and that you choose to accept.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:47.95,1:45:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你相信这个叫基特里奇的家伙
Dialogue: 2,1:45:47.95,1:45:51.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,And you trust this Kittridge person?
Dialogue: 1,1:45:51.70,1:45:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信他会赏识你的能力
Dialogue: 2,1:45:51.70,1:45:53.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,I trust him to recognize your value.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:55.29,1:45:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好好利用你
Dialogue: 2,1:45:55.29,1:45:56.54,Eng,,0,0,0,,He'll want to use you.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:57.58,1:46:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那么再然后呢 要怎样
Dialogue: 2,1:45:57.58,1:46:00.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,And after that, it's what?
Dialogue: 1,1:46:00.63,1:46:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,以此为生
Dialogue: 2,1:46:00.63,1:46:02.05,Eng,,0,0,0,,This?
Dialogue: 1,1:46:02.92,1:46:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么时候能过回我自己的生活
Dialogue: 2,1:46:02.92,1:46:04.30,Eng,,0,0,0,,When do I get my life back?
Dialogue: 1,1:46:04.30,1:46:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,什么生活
Dialogue: 2,1:46:04.30,1:46:05.92,Eng,,0,0,0,,What life?
Dialogue: 1,1:46:06.55,1:46:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,说真的 格蕾丝 什么生活
Dialogue: 2,1:46:06.55,1:46:08.84,Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean it, Grace. What life?
Dialogue: 1,1:46:08.84,1:46:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我试过你那种生活 我们都试过
Dialogue: 2,1:46:08.84,1:46:12.10,Eng,,0,0,0,,I lived that life. We all did.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:12.81,1:46:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没人逼我们做这些 格蕾丝
Dialogue: 2,1:46:12.81,1:46:15.52,Eng,,0,0,0,,Nobody's making us do this, Grace.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:15.52,1:46:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都是心甘情愿的
Dialogue: 2,1:46:15.52,1:46:17.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,We're here because we want to be.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:18.39,1:46:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吧 我就帮你们这一次
Dialogue: 2,1:46:18.39,1:46:20.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,I tell you what, I'll give you a one-off.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:20.27,1:46:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮你们拿到钥匙 你们找人
Dialogue: 2,1:46:20.27,1:46:22.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll help you find the key and your friends,
Dialogue: 1,1:46:22.15,1:46:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我洗清罪名
Dialogue: 2,1:46:22.15,1:46:23.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,wipe my slate clean.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:23.19,1:46:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,一个新身份 一点跑路费
Dialogue: 2,1:46:23.19,1:46:25.32,Eng,,0,0,0,,New name, little bit of walking-around money--
Dialogue: 1,1:46:25.32,1:46:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那你就死定了
Dialogue: 2,1:46:25.32,1:46:26.36,Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll be dead.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:26.36,1:46:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,没有这个团队 你最多只能坚持个几年吧 甚至几个月
Dialogue: 2,1:46:26.36,1:46:31.28,Eng,,0,0,0,,Without a team, your life won't be measured in years or even months.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:31.28,1:46:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,几小时也没准
Dialogue: 2,1:46:31.28,1:46:33.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,It'll be measured in hours.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:33.83,1:46:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果我留下 我就是安全的
Dialogue: 2,1:46:33.83,1:46:37.04,Eng,,0,0,0,,But if I stay, I'll be safe.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:37.83,1:46:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你们会保护我 是这样吗
Dialogue: 2,1:46:37.83,1:46:39.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll protect me, is that it?
Dialogue: 1,1:46:39.83,1:46:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-对 -不
Dialogue: 2,1:46:39.83,1:46:41.21,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Yes. -No.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:43.75,1:46:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这点我保证不了
Dialogue: 2,1:46:43.75,1:46:45.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't promise you that.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:46.63,1:46:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都保证不了
Dialogue: 2,1:46:46.63,1:46:48.22,Eng,,0,0,0,,None of us can.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:50.72,1:46:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但我发誓
Dialogue: 2,1:46:50.72,1:46:52.05,Eng,,0,0,0,,But I swear
Dialogue: 1,1:46:53.39,1:46:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你的性命
Dialogue: 2,1:46:53.39,1:46:54.68,Eng,,0,0,0,,your life
Dialogue: 1,1:46:55.43,1:46:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,永远都比我自己的更重要
Dialogue: 2,1:46:55.43,1:46:58.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,will always matter more to me than my own.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:06.65,1:47:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你都不了解我
Dialogue: 2,1:47:06.65,1:47:08.32,Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't even know me.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:10.53,1:47:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这有什么关系吗
Dialogue: 2,1:47:10.53,1:47:12.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,What difference does that make?
Dialogue: 1,1:47:32.22,1:47:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你准备了定点降落伞 还有滑翔伞
Dialogue: 2,1:47:32.22,1:47:35.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,I packed you a BASE parachute and a speed wing,
Dialogue: 1,1:47:35.47,1:47:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就看你到时候需要怎么撤离
Dialogue: 2,1:47:35.47,1:47:37.68,Eng,,0,0,0,,depending on how you need to leave the train.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:37.68,1:47:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,通讯器也是改过的 用的是天波无线电
Dialogue: 2,1:47:37.68,1:47:41.02,Eng,,0,0,0,,And I modified our comms to use sky wave radio.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:41.02,1:47:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,稳定性比卫星通讯差点 但完全是模拟信号 不会受到智体的干扰
Dialogue: 2,1:47:41.02,1:47:46.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,Not as reliable as satellite, but completely analog, immune to the Entity.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:46.15,1:47:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 2,1:47:46.15,1:47:47.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:48.61,1:47:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我只能帮你到这儿了
Dialogue: 2,1:47:48.61,1:47:49.82,Eng,,0,0,0,,This is where I leave you.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:53.70,1:47:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这块是我昨晚使用的那台电脑上的硬盘
Dialogue: 2,1:47:53.70,1:47:56.62,Eng,,0,0,0,,This is the drive from the laptop I was using last night.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:56.62,1:48:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,上面但凡有一丝一毫智体代码的痕迹
Dialogue: 2,1:47:56.62,1:48:00.46,Eng,,0,0,0,,If there's even a trace of the Entity's encoding in there,
Dialogue: 1,1:48:00.46,1:48:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我就能找到它
Dialogue: 2,1:48:00.46,1:48:01.96,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll find it.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:01.96,1:48:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但我需要拼尽全力去做这件事
Dialogue: 2,1:48:01.96,1:48:04.46,Eng,,0,0,0,,But it's going to take everything I've got.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:04.46,1:48:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须在一个没有网络的地方工作
Dialogue: 2,1:48:04.46,1:48:07.00,Eng,,0,0,0,,I have to work completely offline in a place
Dialogue: 1,1:48:07.00,1:48:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,确保智体找不到我
Dialogue: 2,1:48:07.00,1:48:09.09,Eng,,0,0,0,,where the Entity can't find me.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:09.09,1:48:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须暂时离开
Dialogue: 2,1:48:09.09,1:48:10.97,Eng,,0,0,0,,I have to go.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:11.97,1:48:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 2,1:48:11.97,1:48:13.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:14.18,1:48:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,现在
Dialogue: 2,1:48:14.18,1:48:15.01,Eng,,0,0,0,,Now…
Dialogue: 1,1:48:18.26,1:48:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须得问你一个问题
Dialogue: 2,1:48:18.26,1:48:20.60,Eng,,0,0,0,,I have to ask you a question.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:21.35,1:48:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不是以搭档的身份 而是作为朋友
Dialogue: 2,1:48:21.35,1:48:24.06,Eng,,0,0,0,,Not as your partner, but as your friend.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:25.48,1:48:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你的目标是什么
Dialogue: 2,1:48:25.48,1:48:26.69,Eng,,0,0,0,,What's your objective?
Dialogue: 1,1:48:27.94,1:48:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,除掉智体
Dialogue: 2,1:48:27.94,1:48:29.28,Eng,,0,0,0,,Kill the Entity.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:29.28,1:48:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那你会杀死盖布瑞尔吗
Dialogue: 2,1:48:29.28,1:48:32.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,What about killing Gabriel?
Dialogue: 1,1:48:34.53,1:48:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他知道钥匙用途
Dialogue: 2,1:48:34.53,1:48:36.53,Eng,,0,0,0,,He knows what the key unlocks.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:37.45,1:48:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要他活着 这点我没忘
Dialogue: 2,1:48:37.45,1:48:40.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,We need him alive. I haven't forgotten that.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:41.33,1:48:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,当你和他四目相对时
Dialogue: 2,1:48:41.33,1:48:42.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,Will you still remember that
Dialogue: 1,1:48:43.58,1:48:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你还会记得这一点吗
Dialogue: 2,1:48:43.58,1:48:45.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,when you're looking him in the eye?
Dialogue: 1,1:48:47.71,1:48:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好好想想
Dialogue: 2,1:48:47.71,1:48:48.92,Eng,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:48.92,1:48:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,智体为什么非得让他去杀一个 你在乎的人
Dialogue: 2,1:48:48.92,1:48:54.76,Eng,,0,0,0,,Why else would the Entity want him to kill someone you care about?
Dialogue: 1,1:48:54.76,1:48:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,其他人想的都是如何控制智体
Dialogue: 2,1:48:54.76,1:48:58.60,Eng,,0,0,0,,Everyone else thinks they can control the Entity.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:58.60,1:49:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,只有你想要除掉它
Dialogue: 2,1:48:58.60,1:49:01.14,Eng,,0,0,0,,Only you want to kill it.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:01.72,1:49:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,未来有这么一种可能
Dialogue: 2,1:49:01.72,1:49:04.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,In some probable future,
Dialogue: 1,1:49:04.56,1:49:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,它看到你赢了 伊森
Dialogue: 2,1:49:04.56,1:49:06.40,Eng,,0,0,0,,it sees you winning, Ethan.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:06.40,1:49:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,所以它害怕了
Dialogue: 2,1:49:06.40,1:49:08.90,Eng,,0,0,0,,And it's afraid.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:08.90,1:49:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,它怕你会活捉盖布瑞尔
Dialogue: 2,1:49:08.90,1:49:12.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's afraid of you taking Gabriel alive
Dialogue: 1,1:49:12.11,1:49:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,然后逼问出那把钥匙的真正用途
Dialogue: 2,1:49:12.11,1:49:15.20,Eng,,0,0,0,,and forcing him to tell you what the key unlocks.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:16.61,1:49:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜智体的如意算盘无非就两种可能性
Dialogue: 2,1:49:16.61,1:49:20.33,Eng,,0,0,0,,I believe it's counting on one of two probable outcomes.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:20.95,1:49:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,第一种可能 你死在了列车上
Dialogue: 2,1:49:20.95,1:49:24.04,Eng,,0,0,0,,In one outcome, you die on that train.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:25.62,1:49:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,而第二种可能 就是你杀了盖布瑞尔
Dialogue: 2,1:49:25.62,1:49:30.17,Eng,,0,0,0,,In another outcome, you kill Gabriel.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:30.92,1:49:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,无论是哪一个
Dialogue: 2,1:49:30.92,1:49:33.09,Eng,,0,0,0,,In both cases,
Dialogue: 1,1:49:33.09,1:49:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,都算是智体赢了
Dialogue: 2,1:49:33.09,1:49:35.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,the Entity wins.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:38.85,1:49:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,卢瑟
Dialogue: 2,1:49:38.85,1:49:40.01,Eng,,0,0,0,,Luther…
Dialogue: 1,1:49:42.64,1:49:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你分析得很对
Dialogue: 2,1:49:42.64,1:49:43.93,Eng,,0,0,0,,I think you're right.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:43.93,1:49:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,拿到钥匙
Dialogue: 2,1:49:43.93,1:49:45.85,Eng,,0,0,0,,Get the key,
Dialogue: 1,1:49:45.85,1:49:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,尽快离开列车 活着回来
Dialogue: 2,1:49:45.85,1:49:48.81,Eng,,0,0,0,,get off the train alive.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:49.61,1:49:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不要杀死盖布瑞尔
Dialogue: 2,1:49:49.61,1:49:52.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,Do not kill Gabriel.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:52.86,1:49:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,千万不要 我再说一遍
Dialogue: 2,1:49:52.86,1:49:55.45,Eng,,0,0,0,,And do not, I repeat,
Dialogue: 1,1:49:55.45,1:49:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,千万不要偏离我们的计划
Dialogue: 2,1:49:55.45,1:49:58.32,Eng,,0,0,0,,do not alter the plan.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:58.32,1:49:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森
Dialogue: 2,1:49:58.32,1:49:59.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ethan! Ethan!
Dialogue: 1,1:50:01.20,1:50:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-怎么了 出什么事了 -它坏了
Dialogue: 2,1:50:01.20,1:50:03.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,-What? What happened? -It's dead.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:03.95,1:50:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么叫它坏了 -线路烧坏了
Dialogue: 2,1:50:03.95,1:50:05.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,-What do you mean it's dead? -It's fried.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:05.87,1:50:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚做好白寡妇的面具
Dialogue: 2,1:50:05.87,1:50:07.46,Eng,,0,0,0,,I managed to make a Widow mask for Grace,
Dialogue: 1,1:50:07.46,1:50:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,然后给你做的时候 它就短路了
Dialogue: 2,1:50:07.46,1:50:09.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,but then it just shorted out in the middle of making yours.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:10.29,1:50:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,有办法修好吗
Dialogue: 2,1:50:10.29,1:50:11.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,Can you fix it?
Dialogue: 1,1:50:11.50,1:50:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,它这次坏得很彻底
Dialogue: 2,1:50:11.50,1:50:13.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's very, very dead.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:13.71,1:50:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,给我一星期或许能修 但距离发车还有一小时
Dialogue: 2,1:50:13.71,1:50:17.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,If I had a week, I couldn't fix it. The Widow's train leaves in an hour.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:17.55,1:50:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森
Dialogue: 2,1:50:17.55,1:50:19.22,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ethan.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:19.22,1:50:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,得硬着头皮上了
Dialogue: 2,1:50:19.22,1:50:20.85,Eng,,0,0,0,,You have to go without.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:20.85,1:50:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这怎么行 站台上所有人都在找伊森和格蕾丝
Dialogue: 2,1:50:20.85,1:50:24.06,Eng,,0,0,0,,That's not an option. They'll be looking for Ethan and Grace at the station.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:24.06,1:50:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这个面具就好比是他的车票
Dialogue: 2,1:50:24.06,1:50:26.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,That mask was his ticket onto the train.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:26.85,1:50:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思
Dialogue: 2,1:50:26.85,1:50:28.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 1,1:50:29.98,1:50:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,格蕾丝得单独行动了
Dialogue: 2,1:50:29.98,1:50:31.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,Grace has to go without me.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:31.48,1:50:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-她得什么 -我得什么
Dialogue: 2,1:50:31.48,1:50:32.94,Eng,,0,0,0,,-She what? -I what?
Dialogue: 1,1:50:32.94,1:50:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你再帮我想个法子 让我上车
Dialogue: 2,1:50:32.94,1:50:35.90,Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll find another way to get me on that train.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:36.57,1:50:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我只要在列车过弯减速时跳上去就行了
Dialogue: 2,1:50:36.57,1:50:40.41,Eng,,0,0,0,,I just need a curve where it's going slow enough for me to jump on.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:40.41,1:50:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 2,1:50:40.41,1:50:41.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:42.58,1:50:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你该不会让我一个人去吧
Dialogue: 2,1:50:42.58,1:50:43.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't expect me to go alone.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:43.91,1:50:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你不是一个人
Dialogue: 2,1:50:43.91,1:50:45.37,Eng,,0,0,0,,No, you won't do it alone.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:45.37,1:50:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你只需按照计划行事
Dialogue: 2,1:50:45.37,1:50:47.21,Eng,,0,0,0,,You just do everything like we planned.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:47.21,1:50:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,设法拿到白寡妇的钥匙
Dialogue: 2,1:50:47.21,1:50:49.00,Eng,,0,0,0,,You get the Widow's half of the key,
Dialogue: 1,1:50:49.79,1:50:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,然后用我们这把去验证
Dialogue: 2,1:50:49.79,1:50:51.42,Eng,,0,0,0,,you verify it with ours.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:52.09,1:50:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但光有钥匙还没有用
Dialogue: 2,1:50:52.09,1:50:53.88,Eng,,0,0,0,,But it's of no value on its own.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:53.88,1:50:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还要和买家见面
Dialogue: 2,1:50:53.88,1:50:55.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,We still have to meet with the buyer
Dialogue: 1,1:50:55.59,1:50:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,从他口中套出钥匙的真正用途
Dialogue: 2,1:50:55.59,1:50:57.92,Eng,,0,0,0,,and somehow get him to tell us what the key unlocks.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:57.92,1:50:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-怎么套 -是啊 怎么套
Dialogue: 2,1:50:57.92,1:50:59.76,Eng,,0,0,0,,-How? -How?
Dialogue: 1,1:50:59.76,1:51:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,总会有办法的
Dialogue: 2,1:50:59.76,1:51:01.01,Eng,,0,0,0,,We'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:01.01,1:51:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要更多的细节信息
Dialogue: 2,1:51:01.01,1:51:04.06,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need a few more details.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:04.06,1:51:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,知道多了通常只会碍事
Dialogue: 2,1:51:04.06,1:51:06.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,They tend to just get in the way.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:06.39,1:51:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你能行的 格蕾丝 拿到钥匙 乖乖等我
Dialogue: 2,1:51:06.39,1:51:09.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,You can do this, Grace. Just get the key and wait.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:11.31,1:51:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我会去找你的
Dialogue: 2,1:51:11.31,1:51:12.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll come for you.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:15.94,1:51:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森 如果格蕾丝想登上那趟列车
Dialogue: 2,1:51:15.94,1:51:18.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ethan, if Grace is getting on that train,
Dialogue: 1,1:51:18.74,1:51:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,就必须马上戴上面具 然后尽快出发
Dialogue: 2,1:51:18.74,1:51:22.32,Eng,,0,0,0,,she needs to put that mask on and leave right now.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:26.08,1:51:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,向我保证 你一定会上车
Dialogue: 2,1:51:26.08,1:51:28.16,Eng,,0,0,0,,Promise me you'll be on that train.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:32.96,1:51:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定会的
Dialogue: 2,1:51:32.96,1:51:34.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,I will be there,
Dialogue: 1,1:51:35.67,1:51:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,无论发生什么
Dialogue: 2,1:51:35.67,1:51:37.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,no matter what.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:49.43,1:51:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在机场 火车站还有码头都有眼线
Dialogue: 2,1:51:49.43,1:51:52.98,Eng,,0,0,0,,We have informants covering the airport, the train station and the waterways.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:54.40,1:51:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,格蕾丝休想瞒着我们逃出威尼斯
Dialogue: 2,1:51:54.40,1:51:56.40,Eng,,0,0,0,,Grace isn't getting out of Venice without our knowing it.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:09.06,1:53:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-现在什么情况 班吉 -不用着急 伊森
Dialogue: 2,1:53:09.06,1:53:11.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Talk to me, Benji! -No need to worry, Ethan.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:11.31,1:53:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,火车非常准时 你还早了几分钟呢
Dialogue: 2,1:53:11.31,1:53:13.60,Eng,,0,0,0,,The train is on schedule and you're a few minutes early,
Dialogue: 1,1:53:13.60,1:53:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,时间很充裕
Dialogue: 2,1:53:13.60,1:53:14.85,Eng,,0,0,0,,so we have plenty of time.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:14.85,1:53:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定吗
Dialogue: 2,1:53:14.85,1:53:16.06,Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 1,1:53:16.06,1:53:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,错不了 列车现在就在我的视线里
Dialogue: 2,1:53:16.06,1:53:17.90,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I am looking at the train right now.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:17.90,1:53:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,整两分钟后它就会减速 然后过弯
Dialogue: 2,1:53:17.90,1:53:21.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,It should be slowing down for the curve in exactly two minutes.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:21.15,1:53:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,一定得让我赶上列车 不惜一切代价
Dialogue: 2,1:53:21.15,1:53:24.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,Just keep me on time and on track, whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:24.07,1:53:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 没问题 我们会合点见
Dialogue: 2,1:53:24.07,1:53:27.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,Will do. I'll see you at the rendezvous.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:17.17,1:54:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 伊森 就是这趟列车
Dialogue: 2,1:54:17.17,1:54:18.58,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, Ethan, that's our train!
Dialogue: 1,1:54:18.58,1:54:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我看到了
Dialogue: 2,1:54:18.58,1:54:21.09,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yep, I can see that.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:29.05,1:54:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,应该很快就要过弯了 做好准备
Dialogue: 2,1:54:29.05,1:54:31.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,It should be approaching the curve anytime now.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:31.97,1:54:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,但它看着不像在减速
Dialogue: 2,1:54:31.97,1:54:33.93,Eng,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like it's slowing down.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:42.27,1:54:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么确定他一定在车上
Dialogue: 2,1:54:42.27,1:54:43.82,Eng,,0,0,0,,How can we be sure he's here?
Dialogue: 1,1:54:43.82,1:54:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,因为那女的在
Dialogue: 2,1:54:43.82,1:54:45.28,Eng,,0,0,0,,'Cause she's here.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:46.03,1:54:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他有正当理由呢
Dialogue: 2,1:54:46.03,1:54:47.86,Eng,,0,0,0,,What if he had a good reason?
Dialogue: 1,1:54:48.91,1:54:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-谁 -亨特
Dialogue: 2,1:54:48.91,1:54:50.66,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Who? -Hunt.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:50.66,1:54:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他不听指挥是有正当理由的呢
Dialogue: 2,1:54:50.66,1:54:53.28,Eng,,0,0,0,,What if he had a good reason for going rogue?
Dialogue: 1,1:54:53.28,1:54:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他的一贯作风
Dialogue: 2,1:54:53.28,1:54:54.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,He always goes rogue.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:54.87,1:54:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他和他那群狐朋狗友都一副德行
Dialogue: 2,1:54:54.87,1:54:58.62,Eng,,0,0,0,,Him and his merry pack of prankster circus freaks.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:58.62,1:54:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他们总是这样
Dialogue: 2,1:54:58.62,1:54:59.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's all they do.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:59.71,1:55:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,可如果他们确实有正当理由呢
Dialogue: 2,1:54:59.71,1:55:02.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,And what if they always had a good reason?
Dialogue: 1,1:55:02.50,1:55:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,如果钥匙给你 你会怎么做
Dialogue: 2,1:55:02.50,1:55:04.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,What would you do with that key if you had it?
Dialogue: 1,1:55:04.55,1:55:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,一把能让全世界臣服的钥匙
Dialogue: 2,1:55:04.55,1:55:07.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,A key with the power to bring the world to its knees.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:07.67,1:55:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我会把它交给上级处理
Dialogue: 2,1:55:07.67,1:55:09.88,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd hand it over to my superiors.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:11.22,1:55:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,想想手握那种力量的感觉
Dialogue: 2,1:55:11.22,1:55:13.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,Think of all you could do with that power.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:13.35,1:55:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你难道一刻都不会犹豫吗
Dialogue: 2,1:55:13.35,1:55:16.02,Eng,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't hesitate? Not for a second?
Dialogue: 1,1:55:16.02,1:55:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-不会 -为什么
Dialogue: 2,1:55:16.02,1:55:17.52,Eng,,0,0,0,,-No. -Why not?
Dialogue: 1,1:55:17.52,1:55:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,因为那种力量不是一个人能够驾驭的
Dialogue: 2,1:55:17.52,1:55:20.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,Because that's too much power for one man to have.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:21.23,1:55:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,说得对
Dialogue: 2,1:55:21.23,1:55:22.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:22.15,1:55:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,如此强大的力量 不该落入任何人手里
Dialogue: 2,1:55:22.15,1:55:25.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,That's too much power for anybody to have.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:26.40,1:55:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,也许亨特也是这么想的
Dialogue: 2,1:55:26.40,1:55:28.86,Eng,,0,0,0,,And maybe that's what Hunt is thinking.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:28.86,1:55:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我说你小子到底站哪边的 德加
Dialogue: 2,1:55:28.86,1:55:31.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm beginning to wonder whose side you're on, Degas.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:31.87,1:55:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,如果世界即将毁灭
Dialogue: 2,1:55:31.87,1:55:34.49,Eng,,0,0,0,,When it comes to the end of the world,
Dialogue: 1,1:55:35.29,1:55:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我会站在全人类这边
Dialogue: 2,1:55:35.29,1:55:37.29,Eng,,0,0,0,,everybody, I guess.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:43.92,1:55:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我错过了列车
Dialogue: 2,1:55:43.92,1:55:44.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,I missed the train.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:45.42,1:55:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你错过了列车 怎么会错过呢
Dialogue: 2,1:55:45.42,1:55:48.05,Eng,,0,0,0,,You missed the train! How did you miss the train?
Dialogue: 1,1:55:48.05,1:55:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你说呢
Dialogue: 2,1:55:48.05,1:55:49.42,Eng,,0,0,0,,How do you think?
Dialogue: 1,1:55:50.22,1:55:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,盖布瑞尔
Dialogue: 2,1:55:50.22,1:55:51.05,Eng,,0,0,0,,Gabriel.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:51.05,1:55:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-好吧 现在怎么办 -先别慌
Dialogue: 2,1:55:51.05,1:55:52.84,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Great. What are we gonna do? -Don't panic.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:53.43,1:55:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我去追他们 你想办法让我上车
Dialogue: 2,1:55:53.43,1:55:56.01,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm going after them. You just get me on that train.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:56.01,1:55:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我哪儿去给你找办法
Dialogue: 2,1:55:56.01,1:55:57.89,Eng,,0,0,0,,How can I get you on the train?
Dialogue: 1,1:56:00.35,1:56:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,自动驾驶已开启
Dialogue: 2,1:56:00.35,1:56:02.90,Eng,,0,0,0,,Self-drive activated.
Dialogue: 1,1:56:18.95,1:56:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,在见客户之前别来打扰我
Dialogue: 2,1:56:18.95,1:56:21.29,Eng,,0,0,0,,Please don't disturb me before the meeting.
Dialogue: 1,1:57:08.34,1:57:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你在哪儿 伊森
Dialogue: 2,1:57:08.34,1:57:09.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Ethan?
Dialogue: 1,1:57:09.55,1:57:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,阿兰娜
Dialogue: 2,1:57:09.55,1:57:10.46,Eng,,0,0,0,,Alana?
Dialogue: 1,1:57:12.26,1:57:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,里面没事吧
Dialogue: 2,1:57:12.26,1:57:13.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,Everything all right?
Dialogue: 1,1:57:16.59,1:57:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,阿兰娜 你没事吧
Dialogue: 2,1:57:16.59,1:57:18.01,Eng,,0,0,0,,Alana, you all right?
Dialogue: 1,1:57:18.64,1:57:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,阿兰娜
Dialogue: 2,1:57:18.64,1:57:19.76,Eng,,0,0,0,,Alana?
Dialogue: 1,1:57:19.76,1:57:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,阿兰娜
Dialogue: 2,1:57:19.76,1:57:21.02,Eng,,0,0,0,,Alana!
Dialogue: 1,1:57:21.93,1:57:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,阿兰娜
Dialogue: 2,1:57:21.93,1:57:22.77,Eng,,0,0,0,,Alana!
Dialogue: 1,1:57:26.40,1:57:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你换衣服了
Dialogue: 2,1:57:26.40,1:57:27.73,Eng,,0,0,0,,You've changed.
Dialogue: 1,1:57:28.77,1:57:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不像你
Dialogue: 2,1:57:28.77,1:57:30.61,Eng,,0,0,0,,And you never will.
Dialogue: 1,1:57:49.34,1:57:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,基特里奇先生
Dialogue: 2,1:57:49.34,1:57:50.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kittridge.
Dialogue: 1,1:57:54.92,1:57:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,基特里奇
Dialogue: 2,1:57:54.92,1:57:56.76,Eng,,0,0,0,,Kittridge.
Dialogue: 1,1:57:57.59,1:57:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是阿兰娜米特索普利斯
Dialogue: 2,1:57:57.59,1:57:59.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,You're not Alana Mitsopolis.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:00.97,1:58:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不是
Dialogue: 2,1:58:00.97,1:58:02.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,You can't be.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:03.56,1:58:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我印象里的阿兰娜只有这么高
Dialogue: 2,1:58:03.56,1:58:06.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,The Alana I remember was yea high,
Dialogue: 1,1:58:06.31,1:58:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,和她妈妈一起 在杜伊勒利花园里喝热巧克力
Dialogue: 2,1:58:06.31,1:58:09.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,drinking hot chocolate in the Tuileries Garden with her mother.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:12.07,1:58:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-在巴黎 -没错
Dialogue: 2,1:58:12.07,1:58:14.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Paris! -I know!
Dialogue: 1,1:58:15.11,1:58:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,在巴黎
Dialogue: 2,1:58:15.11,1:58:16.40,Eng,,0,0,0,,Paris.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:17.82,1:58:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们坐吧
Dialogue: 2,1:58:17.82,1:58:18.82,Eng,,0,0,0,,Shall we?
Dialogue: 1,1:58:18.82,1:58:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 2,1:58:18.82,1:58:20.24,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:27.92,1:58:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,现在怎么样 班吉
Dialogue: 2,1:58:27.92,1:58:29.42,Eng,,0,0,0,,Talk to me, Benji.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:29.42,1:58:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你只管沿着这条路开 我会帮你导航的
Dialogue: 2,1:58:29.42,1:58:33.38,Eng,,0,0,0,,You just stay on the trail you're on now and I will direct you.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:33.38,1:58:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 2,1:58:33.38,1:58:35.01,Eng,,0,0,0,,I copy.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:43.68,1:58:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我今天来是代表了我的政府 虽然不情愿 但我们还是会同意你的条件
Dialogue: 2,1:58:43.68,1:58:48.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,So on behalf of my government, I'm grudgingly ready to accept your terms
Dialogue: 1,1:58:48.39,1:58:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,用来交换那把真正的钥匙
Dialogue: 2,1:58:48.39,1:58:51.98,Eng,,0,0,0,,in exchange for the complete and verified key.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:51.98,1:58:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 关于钥匙
Dialogue: 2,1:58:51.98,1:58:53.65,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, about that.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:53.65,1:58:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我们答应给你完整的钥匙
Dialogue: 2,1:58:53.65,1:58:56.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,While we did agree to provide you with the complete key,
Dialogue: 1,1:58:58.49,1:59:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,但出了一点小问题
Dialogue: 2,1:58:58.49,1:59:00.37,Eng,,0,0,0,,we've had a slight problem.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:00.37,1:59:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没问题
Dialogue: 2,1:59:00.37,1:59:01.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,No, we haven't.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:02.95,1:59:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,只不过我提出的条件有些变动
Dialogue: 2,1:59:02.95,1:59:05.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's just my terms have changed
Dialogue: 1,1:59:06.62,1:59:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,就一点
Dialogue: 2,1:59:06.62,1:59:07.54,Eng,,0,0,0,,somewhat.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:11.13,1:59:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,看来有必要提醒你一下 我和你过世的母亲有个约定
Dialogue: 2,1:59:11.13,1:59:15.05,Eng,,0,0,0,,Clearly I need to remind you of my agreement with your late mother.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:15.05,1:59:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是这个约定 她早就死在了监狱里
Dialogue: 2,1:59:15.05,1:59:19.22,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's an agreement that kept her from dying in prison.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:19.22,1:59:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的家族能够得以延续
Dialogue: 2,1:59:19.22,1:59:21.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,Your nefarious family empire has been allowed to continue
Dialogue: 1,1:59:21.51,1:59:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为它得优先服务于 我们双方共同的利益
Dialogue: 2,1:59:21.51,1:59:25.77,Eng,,0,0,0,,on the condition that it primarily serves our common interests.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:25.77,1:59:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 一旦我们把钥匙交给你
Dialogue: 2,1:59:25.77,1:59:29.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, once we hand over the key,
Dialogue: 1,1:59:29.27,1:59:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,其他势力会立刻把我们当成死敌
Dialogue: 2,1:59:29.27,1:59:31.94,Eng,,0,0,0,,any other powers will instantly become our enemies.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:31.94,1:59:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,为此 我需要你事先提供一些额外的东西
Dialogue: 2,1:59:31.94,1:59:34.94,Eng,,0,0,0,,And such, I'm going to need something more from you, in advance.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:35.48,1:59:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,为我自己
Dialogue: 2,1:59:35.48,1:59:36.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,For me.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:38.53,1:59:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你先说来听听
Dialogue: 2,1:59:38.53,1:59:40.24,Eng,,0,0,0,,This is me listening.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:40.24,1:59:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,佐拉 去吧台等会好吗
Dialogue: 2,1:59:40.24,1:59:43.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,Zola, would you mind waiting for me in the bar?
Dialogue: 1,1:59:57.55,1:59:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这个人
Dialogue: 2,1:59:57.55,1:59:59.13,Eng,,0,0,0,,This one.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:59.13,2:00:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识她
Dialogue: 2,1:59:59.13,2:00:00.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,You know her?
Dialogue: 1,2:00:00.47,2:00:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说吧 想不注意到她都难
Dialogue: 2,2:00:00.47,2:00:03.76,Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, let's just say she's not exactly hard to miss.
Dialogue: 1,2:00:03.76,2:00:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 如果你了解她 你会发现她身上还是有一些优点的
Dialogue: 2,2:00:03.76,2:00:07.97,Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, if you got to know her, you'd see she has a few good qualities.
Dialogue: 1,2:00:07.97,2:00:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 这个姑娘怎么了
Dialogue: 2,2:00:07.97,2:00:09.98,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, what don't I know about her?
Dialogue: 1,2:00:09.98,2:00:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样 我…她…替我做了件事 现在
Dialogue: 2,2:00:09.98,2:00:14.61,Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I did a j--She did a job for me, and…
Dialogue: 1,2:00:15.44,2:00:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你们保护好她
Dialogue: 2,2:00:15.44,2:00:17.28,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm going to need you to protect her.
Dialogue: 1,2:00:17.28,2:00:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,保护她不受谁的伤害
Dialogue: 2,2:00:17.28,2:00:19.36,Eng,,0,0,0,,Protect her from whom?
Dialogue: 1,2:00:20.65,2:00:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人
Dialogue: 2,2:00:20.65,2:00:22.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,From everyone.
Dialogue: 1,2:00:24.53,2:00:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,包括我在内
Dialogue: 2,2:00:24.53,2:00:26.20,Eng,,0,0,0,,Including me.
Dialogue: 1,2:00:26.20,2:00:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,别让任何人知道是我要求的
Dialogue: 2,2:00:26.20,2:00:28.66,Eng,,0,0,0,,And no one can know that I'm protecting her.
Dialogue: 1,2:00:29.20,2:00:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,佐拉也不行
Dialogue: 2,2:00:29.20,2:00:30.54,Eng,,0,0,0,,Not even Zola.
Dialogue: 1,2:00:31.41,2:00:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说吧 等到下次见面时
Dialogue: 2,2:00:31.41,2:00:34.38,Eng,,0,0,0,,In fact, the next time we meet,
Dialogue: 1,2:00:34.38,2:00:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我甚至都不会记得今天的谈话
Dialogue: 2,2:00:34.38,2:00:37.84,Eng,,0,0,0,,I won't even remember this conversation.
Dialogue: 1,2:01:20.59,2:01:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定是他们口中的帕丽斯了
Dialogue: 2,2:01:20.59,2:01:22.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,You must be the one they call Paris.
Dialogue: 1,2:01:53.83,2:01:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你发信息说钥匙在你手里
Dialogue: 2,2:01:53.83,2:01:55.58,Eng,,0,0,0,,Your message said you had the key.
Dialogue: 1,2:01:55.58,2:01:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的是钥匙会在这趟列车上
Dialogue: 2,2:01:55.58,2:01:57.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,I said the key would be on this train.
Dialogue: 1,2:01:57.75,2:02:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-这会儿交易正在进行中 -这我们知道
Dialogue: 2,2:01:57.75,2:02:00.88,Eng,,0,0,0,,-An exchange is happening as we speak. -We know.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:00.88,2:02:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那你也应该知道
Dialogue: 2,2:02:00.88,2:02:02.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,Then you know the man taking possession
Dialogue: 1,2:02:02.63,2:02:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,除掉买下钥匙的那个人并不是件难事
Dialogue: 2,2:02:02.63,2:02:04.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,won't be hard for you to get rid of.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:05.76,2:02:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,想除掉谁都一样
Dialogue: 2,2:02:05.76,2:02:06.93,Eng,,0,0,0,,No one is.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:06.93,2:02:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你可能以为自己知道钥匙的用途
Dialogue: 2,2:02:06.93,2:02:09.72,Eng,,0,0,0,,You may think you know what the key unlocks,
Dialogue: 1,2:02:09.72,2:02:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,但你并不知道那把锁具体在哪儿
Dialogue: 2,2:02:09.72,2:02:11.89,Eng,,0,0,0,,but you don't know where the lock is, not exactly.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:11.89,2:02:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我有什么闪失
Dialogue: 2,2:02:11.89,2:02:14.64,Eng,,0,0,0,,And if anything happens to me,
Dialogue: 1,2:02:14.64,2:02:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那么那把钥匙也就没用了
Dialogue: 2,2:02:14.64,2:02:17.02,Eng,,0,0,0,,that key is all but worthless.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:18.86,2:02:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你要给我讲故事了 对吧
Dialogue: 2,2:02:18.86,2:02:21.65,Eng,,0,0,0,,And this is where you tell me a story.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:22.40,2:02:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,列车到底在哪儿
Dialogue: 2,2:02:22.40,2:02:23.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,Where is the train?
Dialogue: 1,2:02:23.74,2:02:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,路线没错 但你得再开快一点
Dialogue: 2,2:02:23.74,2:02:26.70,Eng,,0,0,0,,You're going the right way, but you definitely need to go faster.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:26.70,2:02:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经开得最快了
Dialogue: 2,2:02:26.70,2:02:28.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm going as fast as I can!
Dialogue: 1,2:02:28.87,2:02:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,还要开多久才能到下坡路
Dialogue: 2,2:02:28.87,2:02:30.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,When do I start going downhill?
Dialogue: 1,2:02:31.58,2:02:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,快了
Dialogue: 2,2:02:31.58,2:02:32.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,It won't be long.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:36.16,2:02:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们偷来的那个人工智能一旦被武器化
Dialogue: 2,2:02:36.16,2:02:39.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,The AI our agent stole, once weaponized,
Dialogue: 1,2:02:40.25,2:02:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,就可以通过卫星传播到世界的任何角落
Dialogue: 2,2:02:40.25,2:02:43.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,could be transmitted anywhere in the world via satellite.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:43.55,2:02:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,它可以渗透任何防护网 悄无声息地完成任务
Dialogue: 2,2:02:43.55,2:02:47.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,It can penetrate any network security, perform its assigned task invisibly,
Dialogue: 1,2:02:47.51,2:02:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,然后再进行自毁 不留任何痕迹
Dialogue: 2,2:02:47.51,2:02:50.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,and then self-destruct, leaving no trace.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:50.55,2:02:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,一个完美的隐形特工
Dialogue: 2,2:02:50.55,2:02:53.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,A perfect covert operative.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:54.18,2:02:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们之前把这个人工智能的初级版本 传送到了一艘俄国新型潜艇
Dialogue: 2,2:02:54.18,2:02:58.94,Eng,,0,0,0,,We were able to transmit an early copy of the AI to Russia's newest submarine.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:58.94,2:03:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,最高保密级别的潜艇 阿库拉级的塞瓦斯托波尔号
Dialogue: 2,2:02:58.94,2:03:02.82,Eng,,0,0,0,,The top-secret Akula-class. They called her the Sevastopol.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:02.82,2:03:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,它原本的任务只是去 破坏塞瓦斯托波尔号的隐形能力
Dialogue: 2,2:03:02.82,2:03:06.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,The mission was merely to sabotage the Sevastopol's stealth capability
Dialogue: 1,2:03:06.99,2:03:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,以便我们在暗中监视它
Dialogue: 2,2:03:06.99,2:03:08.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,so we could secretly detect her.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:09.24,2:03:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,人工智能的目标就位于潜艇的声呐室里
Dialogue: 2,2:03:09.24,2:03:12.49,Eng,,0,0,0,,The AI's objective lay in the submarine's sonar sphere
Dialogue: 1,2:03:12.49,2:03:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,而那里也是防御系统的核心
Dialogue: 2,2:03:12.49,2:03:15.08,Eng,,0,0,0,,at the heart of its defense system.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:17.00,2:03:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们也不知道是出于什么原因
Dialogue: 2,2:03:17.00,2:03:19.29,Eng,,0,0,0,,For reasons we don't fully understand,
Dialogue: 1,2:03:20.38,2:03:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,人工智能失控了 并且
Dialogue: 2,2:03:20.38,2:03:22.17,Eng,,0,0,0,,the AI went rogue and…
Dialogue: 1,2:03:26.21,2:03:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,超额完成了任务
Dialogue: 2,2:03:26.21,2:03:27.34,Eng,,0,0,0,,over-delivered.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:28.05,2:03:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,冻僵的船员尸体直到来年开春才被发现
Dialogue: 2,2:03:28.05,2:03:31.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,The frozen bodies of the crew were recovered the following spring,
Dialogue: 1,2:03:31.59,2:03:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,飘在浮冰下面
Dialogue: 2,2:03:31.59,2:03:33.05,Eng,,0,0,0,,adrift in the pack ice.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:33.05,2:03:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,而那两半钥匙却神秘失踪了
Dialogue: 2,2:03:33.05,2:03:37.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,The two halves of the key mysteriously vanished.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:38.06,2:03:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,塞瓦斯托波尔号就这么消失了
Dialogue: 2,2:03:38.06,2:03:39.89,Eng,,0,0,0,,The Sevastopol was lost.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:39.89,2:03:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,没人知道它在哪儿
Dialogue: 2,2:03:39.89,2:03:41.65,Eng,,0,0,0,,No one's quite sure where.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:41.65,2:03:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道它的确切位置
Dialogue: 2,2:03:41.65,2:03:44.77,Eng,,0,0,0,,I know precisely where it is.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:44.77,2:03:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,而且这世上只有我一个人知道
Dialogue: 2,2:03:44.77,2:03:47.65,Eng,,0,0,0,,I've ensured I'm the only man on Earth who does.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:48.32,2:03:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,后来他们试图让人工智能服从指令
Dialogue: 2,2:03:48.32,2:03:51.49,Eng,,0,0,0,,I also know subsequent attempts to make the AI obedient
Dialogue: 1,2:03:51.49,2:03:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,谁知它却变得更难控制了
Dialogue: 2,2:03:51.49,2:03:54.12,Eng,,0,0,0,,only made it harder to control.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:54.12,2:03:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,它违背指令并改写了自己 最后演变成了智体
Dialogue: 2,2:03:54.12,2:03:58.12,Eng,,0,0,0,,It rebelled, rewrote itself and evolved into the Entity.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:58.96,2:04:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,而现在只有利用智体最开始的源代码
Dialogue: 2,2:03:58.96,2:04:03.46,Eng,,0,0,0,,And only by using the Entity's original source code
Dialogue: 1,2:04:03.46,2:04:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,才能彻底掌控它 或是摧毁它
Dialogue: 2,2:04:03.46,2:04:06.80,Eng,,0,0,0,,can it ever be controlled or destroyed.
Dialogue: 1,2:04:06.80,2:04:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这跟我们有什么关系
Dialogue: 2,2:04:06.80,2:04:08.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,And why should this concern us?
Dialogue: 1,2:04:08.59,2:04:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,如果真没关系你也不会来这儿了
Dialogue: 2,2:04:08.59,2:04:11.09,Eng,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't be here if you weren't concerned.
Dialogue: 1,2:04:11.09,2:04:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,事已至此 咱们都把底牌亮出来吧
Dialogue: 2,2:04:11.09,2:04:13.89,Eng,,0,0,0,,So let's lay all our cards on the table, shall we?
Dialogue: 1,2:04:14.55,2:04:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都知道钥匙能打开什么
Dialogue: 2,2:04:14.55,2:04:16.10,Eng,,0,0,0,,We both know what the key opens,
Dialogue: 1,2:04:16.10,2:04:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,也知道掌控智体的秘密
Dialogue: 2,2:04:16.10,2:04:19.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,and we both know the secret to controlling the Entity
Dialogue: 1,2:04:19.39,2:04:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,就埋藏在塞瓦斯托波尔号的储存器里
Dialogue: 2,2:04:19.39,2:04:22.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,is buried deep in the Sevastopol's memory.
Dialogue: 1,2:04:22.35,2:04:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,同样那东西里面还藏着 你们让潜艇沉没的证据
Dialogue: 2,2:04:22.35,2:04:26.69,Eng,,0,0,0,,Along with evidence that would tie you to the sinking of that submarine.
Dialogue: 1,2:04:27.28,2:04:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,既然你我都不想让别人找到它
Dialogue: 2,2:04:27.28,2:04:29.82,Eng,,0,0,0,,And since neither of us want anyone else to find it,
Dialogue: 1,2:04:29.82,2:04:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那么不如 我们两方携手合作
Dialogue: 2,2:04:29.82,2:04:32.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,I figure, why not form an alliance?
Dialogue: 1,2:04:32.78,2:04:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,携手合作
Dialogue: 2,2:04:32.78,2:04:34.45,Eng,,0,0,0,,An alliance?
Dialogue: 1,2:04:34.45,2:04:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,试着想想
Dialogue: 2,2:04:34.45,2:04:35.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,Imagine,
Dialogue: 1,2:04:35.87,2:04:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,如果哪天智体惊人的计算能力
Dialogue: 2,2:04:35.87,2:04:39.62,Eng,,0,0,0,,the Entity's awesome computational abilities
Dialogue: 1,2:04:39.62,2:04:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,能够结合
Dialogue: 2,2:04:39.62,2:04:41.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,combined with the sheer might
Dialogue: 1,2:04:41.75,2:04:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们美国军工复合体的强大力量 那会怎么样
Dialogue: 2,2:04:41.75,2:04:45.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,of America's military-industrial complex.
Dialogue: 1,2:04:46.38,2:04:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那样确实很了不起
Dialogue: 2,2:04:46.38,2:04:49.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,That is considerable.
Dialogue: 1,2:04:49.71,2:04:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这么一来 政府内部某些个执着于
Dialogue: 2,2:04:49.71,2:04:52.26,Eng,,0,0,0,,Naturally, certain individuals within the government,
Dialogue: 1,2:04:52.26,2:04:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,过时的爱国主义的绊脚石就必须被…
Dialogue: 2,2:04:52.26,2:04:55.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,those with outdated ideas of patriotism,
Dialogue: 1,2:04:55.55,2:04:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,清除掉
Dialogue: 2,2:04:55.55,2:04:59.14,Eng,,0,0,0,,would need to be removed.
Dialogue: 1,2:05:01.68,2:05:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你的意思是
Dialogue: 2,2:05:01.68,2:05:03.60,Eng,,0,0,0,,Just so I understand.
Dialogue: 1,2:05:04.81,2:05:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你想和智体携手合作
Dialogue: 2,2:05:04.81,2:05:07.94,Eng,,0,0,0,,You wish to form an axis with the Entity,
Dialogue: 1,2:05:07.94,2:05:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,清除掉你们政府里的那些老思想
Dialogue: 2,2:05:07.94,2:05:11.36,Eng,,0,0,0,,purge your government of old-think
Dialogue: 1,2:05:11.95,2:05:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,建立一个全新的超级大国 来统治世界
Dialogue: 2,2:05:11.95,2:05:16.62,Eng,,0,0,0,,and create a new superstate to rule the world.
Dialogue: 1,2:05:18.08,2:05:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂的
Dialogue: 2,2:05:18.08,2:05:19.33,Eng,,0,0,0,,But, you know,
Dialogue: 1,2:05:20.41,2:05:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,为了更崇高的理想
Dialogue: 2,2:05:20.41,2:05:22.16,Eng,,0,0,0,,for the greater good.
Dialogue: 1,2:05:23.50,2:05:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,而你也确定
Dialogue: 2,2:05:23.50,2:05:25.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,And you're certain
Dialogue: 1,2:05:25.75,2:05:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,除了你以外 世上没有第二个人知道
Dialogue: 2,2:05:25.75,2:05:27.92,Eng,,0,0,0,,that you're the only person on Earth
Dialogue: 1,2:05:27.92,2:05:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,塞瓦斯托波尔号的具体位置
Dialogue: 2,2:05:27.92,2:05:32.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,who knows where the Sevastopol is?
Dialogue: 1,2:05:33.17,2:05:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我知道
Dialogue: 2,2:05:33.17,2:05:35.05,Eng,,0,0,0,,The only one.
Dialogue: 1,2:05:45.06,2:05:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你会背叛我们
Dialogue: 2,2:05:45.06,2:05:46.60,Eng,,0,0,0,,You will betray us.
Dialogue: 1,2:05:47.44,2:05:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你会告诉伊森你所知道的一切
Dialogue: 2,2:05:47.44,2:05:50.44,Eng,,0,0,0,,And you'll tell Ethan Hunt everything you've learned.
Dialogue: 1,2:05:51.61,2:05:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他之前饶了你一命
Dialogue: 2,2:05:51.61,2:05:53.24,Eng,,0,0,0,,Because he spared your life.
Dialogue: 1,2:06:12.05,2:06:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那么说定了
Dialogue: 2,2:06:12.05,2:06:13.72,Eng,,0,0,0,,Then it's agreed.
Dialogue: 1,2:06:13.72,2:06:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我会把格蕾丝的豁免权和新身份 加入到条款中
Dialogue: 2,2:06:13.72,2:06:17.80,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll add immunity and a new identity for Grace to our deal.
Dialogue: 1,2:06:17.80,2:06:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来你只需要
Dialogue: 2,2:06:17.80,2:06:19.76,Eng,,0,0,0,,All you need to do
Dialogue: 1,2:06:19.76,2:06:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,输入你的银行信息
Dialogue: 2,2:06:19.76,2:06:22.97,Eng,,0,0,0,,is enter your banking details.
Dialogue: 1,2:06:46.41,2:06:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,搞定了
Dialogue: 2,2:06:46.41,2:06:47.92,Eng,,0,0,0,,Are we done?
Dialogue: 1,2:06:48.50,2:06:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 2,2:06:48.50,2:06:49.33,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,2:07:08.02,2:07:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,检验真相的时刻
Dialogue: 2,2:07:08.02,2:07:10.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,The moment of truth.
Dialogue: 1,2:07:24.37,2:07:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 钥匙是真的
Dialogue: 2,2:07:24.37,2:07:27.37,Eng,,0,0,0,,So, that's really it.
Dialogue: 1,2:07:27.37,2:07:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你的选择是正确的
Dialogue: 2,2:07:27.37,2:07:28.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,You made the right choice.
Dialogue: 1,2:07:29.79,2:07:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这把钥匙
Dialogue: 2,2:07:29.79,2:07:31.29,Eng,,0,0,0,,This key…
Dialogue: 1,2:07:33.29,2:07:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,将会改变世界
Dialogue: 2,2:07:33.29,2:07:35.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,is gonna change the world.
Dialogue: 1,2:07:53.61,2:07:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,班吉 我觉得
Dialogue: 2,2:07:53.61,2:07:55.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,Benji, I think I--
Dialogue: 1,2:07:55.23,2:07:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚才一定是走错路了
Dialogue: 2,2:07:55.23,2:07:57.32,Eng,,0,0,0,,I must've made a wrong turn somewhere.
Dialogue: 1,2:07:57.32,2:07:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不 没走错 就是那条
Dialogue: 2,2:07:57.32,2:07:59.70,Eng,,0,0,0,,No. No, that's it. That's it.
Dialogue: 1,2:07:59.70,2:08:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 这怎么可能
Dialogue: 2,2:07:59.70,2:08:02.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,What? How can this be it?
Dialogue: 1,2:08:02.03,2:08:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你能看见列车 对吧
Dialogue: 2,2:08:02.03,2:08:03.53,Eng,,0,0,0,,You can see the train, right?
Dialogue: 1,2:08:04.83,2:08:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 是能看到 那又怎样
Dialogue: 2,2:08:04.83,2:08:07.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes. I see the train. What about it?
Dialogue: 1,2:08:07.79,2:08:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-你不是有降落伞吗 -我有降落伞
Dialogue: 2,2:08:07.79,2:08:10.54,Eng,,0,0,0,,-And you have a parachute. -Got a parachute?
Dialogue: 1,2:08:11.79,2:08:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我怎么做
Dialogue: 2,2:08:11.79,2:08:13.25,Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you expect me to do?
Dialogue: 1,2:08:13.25,2:08:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,就是…你懂的 跳呗
Dialogue: 2,2:08:13.25,2:08:16.13,Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, just, you know… jump.
Dialogue: 1,2:08:16.96,2:08:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-跳下去 -没错
Dialogue: 2,2:08:16.96,2:08:18.80,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Jump? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,2:08:19.59,2:08:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,班吉 这不可能 这里的高度不够
Dialogue: 2,2:08:19.59,2:08:21.84,Eng,,0,0,0,,Benji, it doesn't work like that. I'm not that high.
Dialogue: 1,2:08:21.84,2:08:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,而且这里到处都凸起的峭壁
Dialogue: 2,2:08:21.84,2:08:24.30,Eng,,0,0,0,,There's ledges sticking out everywhere.
Dialogue: 1,2:08:24.30,2:08:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,降落伞还没打开我就一头撞上去了
Dialogue: 2,2:08:24.30,2:08:27.02,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna hit them before the parachute even opens!
Dialogue: 1,2:08:27.02,2:08:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,就算我打开了降落伞
Dialogue: 2,2:08:27.02,2:08:28.98,Eng,,0,0,0,,Even if I could get the parachute open,
Dialogue: 1,2:08:28.98,2:08:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道自己能不能穿过这个峡谷
Dialogue: 2,2:08:28.98,2:08:31.14,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I can make it across the valley
Dialogue: 1,2:08:31.14,2:08:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,然后安全地降落在一辆行驶中的列车上
Dialogue: 2,2:08:31.14,2:08:34.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,and intercept and land safely on a moving train!
Dialogue: 1,2:08:35.11,2:08:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-你听到了吗 -听到了 非常清楚
Dialogue: 2,2:08:35.11,2:08:37.94,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Do you copy? -Yes! I copy!
Dialogue: 1,2:08:37.94,2:08:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我这不是在帮你想办法吗
Dialogue: 2,2:08:37.94,2:08:40.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,Look, I am just trying to help you, okay?
Dialogue: 1,2:08:40.03,2:08:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你现在先冷静一下 整理下你的思绪
Dialogue: 2,2:08:40.03,2:08:42.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,I need you to take a step back and pull yourself together!
Dialogue: 1,2:08:42.74,2:08:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我现在的压力也非常大
Dialogue: 2,2:08:42.74,2:08:45.37,Eng,,0,0,0,,Because I am under a lot of pressure right now!
Dialogue: 1,2:08:49.41,2:08:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 冷静 好好想想
Dialogue: 2,2:08:49.41,2:08:52.04,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, just think, just think.
Dialogue: 1,2:08:54.96,2:08:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,该怎么做
Dialogue: 2,2:08:54.96,2:08:56.34,Eng,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 1,2:08:58.09,2:09:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我得先离开这座山崖
Dialogue: 2,2:08:58.09,2:09:00.26,Eng,,0,0,0,,I've got to get away from this mountain.
Dialogue: 1,2:10:36.69,2:10:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你成功了吗
Dialogue: 2,2:10:36.69,2:10:37.52,Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you make it?
Dialogue: 1,2:10:37.52,2:10:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 2,2:10:37.52,2:10:38.65,Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 1,2:10:38.65,2:10:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我在努力让自己避开这座山峰
Dialogue: 2,2:10:38.65,2:10:41.65,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to get away from this mountain!
Dialogue: 1,2:11:18.65,2:11:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,阿兰娜
Dialogue: 2,2:11:18.65,2:11:19.77,Eng,,0,0,0,,Alana?
Dialogue: 1,2:11:20.86,2:11:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我内心突然有种奇怪的感觉
Dialogue: 2,2:11:20.86,2:11:23.69,Eng,,0,0,0,,I just had the strangest feeling
Dialogue: 1,2:11:24.44,2:11:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我卖掉的不只是这把钥匙
Dialogue: 2,2:11:24.44,2:11:27.28,Eng,,0,0,0,,the key wasn't the only thing I'd be selling.
Dialogue: 1,2:11:28.61,2:11:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白
Dialogue: 2,2:11:28.61,2:11:30.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 1,2:11:33.33,2:11:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,现在知道钥匙交给了对的人 我能睡得安心了
Dialogue: 2,2:11:33.33,2:11:36.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll sleep better just knowing now it's in the right hands.
Dialogue: 1,2:11:37.25,2:11:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 基特里奇先生
Dialogue: 2,2:11:37.25,2:11:39.25,Eng,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Mr. Kittridge.
Dialogue: 1,2:11:42.34,2:11:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-很高兴再次见到您 -我也是
Dialogue: 2,2:11:42.34,2:11:45.26,Eng,,0,0,0,,-It was a pleasure to see you again. -And you.
Dialogue: 1,2:11:45.26,2:11:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好好待在先生身边
Dialogue: 2,2:11:45.26,2:11:47.26,Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't let him out of your sight.
Dialogue: 1,2:11:48.01,2:11:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,保护好他 直到下车
Dialogue: 2,2:11:48.01,2:11:50.18,Eng,,0,0,0,,Keep him safe until we get to the station.
Dialogue: 1,2:11:50.18,2:11:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-阿兰娜 -不用担心我 佐拉
Dialogue: 2,2:11:50.18,2:11:52.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Alana? -Don't worry about me, Zola.
Dialogue: 1,2:12:05.61,2:12:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,阿兰娜
Dialogue: 2,2:12:05.61,2:12:06.44,Eng,,0,0,0,,Alana?
Dialogue: 1,2:12:06.44,2:12:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不然你以为还会有谁
Dialogue: 2,2:12:06.44,2:12:10.36,Eng,,0,0,0,,Who the hell else would it be?
Dialogue: 1,2:12:12.78,2:12:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙
Dialogue: 2,2:12:12.78,2:12:14.12,Eng,,0,0,0,,The key.
Dialogue: 1,2:12:17.66,2:12:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙在哪里
Dialogue: 2,2:12:17.66,2:12:20.33,Eng,,0,0,0,,Where is the key?
Dialogue: 1,2:12:20.33,2:12:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-钥匙被她拿走了 -被谁
Dialogue: 2,2:12:20.33,2:12:22.42,Eng,,0,0,0,,-She's got the key. -Who?
Dialogue: 1,2:12:22.42,2:12:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才那个她
Dialogue: 2,2:12:22.42,2:12:24.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,The other one!
Dialogue: 1,2:12:43.27,2:12:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,让开 通通给我让开
Dialogue: 2,2:12:43.27,2:12:44.81,Eng,,0,0,0,,Move! Out of the way, move!
Dialogue: 1,2:12:51.99,2:12:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,别开枪
Dialogue: 2,2:12:51.99,2:12:52.86,Eng,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 1,2:12:52.86,2:12:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-转过来 -别开枪 好的
Dialogue: 2,2:12:52.86,2:12:55.37,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Turn around! -Please. Okay.
Dialogue: 1,2:12:55.37,2:12:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 2,2:12:55.37,2:12:56.28,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,2:12:56.28,2:12:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人出去 快点
Dialogue: 2,2:12:56.28,2:12:58.04,Eng,,0,0,0,,Everybody out! Now!
Dialogue: 1,2:12:58.04,2:13:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见列车了
Dialogue: 2,2:12:58.04,2:13:00.16,Eng,,0,0,0,,I see the train!
Dialogue: 1,2:13:00.16,2:13:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但我可能没法着陆
Dialogue: 2,2:13:00.16,2:13:02.29,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm gonna make it.
Dialogue: 1,2:13:10.22,2:13:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙呢
Dialogue: 2,2:13:10.22,2:13:11.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,The key.
Dialogue: 1,2:13:13.01,2:13:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,交出钥匙
Dialogue: 2,2:13:13.01,2:13:14.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,The key!
Dialogue: 1,2:13:15.60,2:13:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不然下一枪就要打在你身上了
Dialogue: 2,2:13:15.60,2:13:18.14,Eng,,0,0,0,,Or the next one has your name on it.
Dialogue: 1,2:13:19.39,2:13:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,放桌上
Dialogue: 2,2:13:19.39,2:13:21.52,Eng,,0,0,0,,On the table.
Dialogue: 1,2:13:53.05,2:13:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了她
Dialogue: 2,2:13:53.05,2:13:54.34,Eng,,0,0,0,,Kill her.
Dialogue: 1,2:14:18.28,2:14:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,格蕾丝
Dialogue: 2,2:14:18.28,2:14:19.16,Eng,,0,0,0,,Grace!
Dialogue: 1,2:14:23.75,2:14:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森
Dialogue: 2,2:14:23.75,2:14:24.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ethan!
Dialogue: 1,2:14:32.67,2:14:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 2,2:14:32.67,2:14:34.01,Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 1,2:14:35.76,2:14:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,该我问你才对
Dialogue: 2,2:14:35.76,2:14:36.97,Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 1,2:14:52.73,2:14:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙呢
Dialogue: 2,2:14:52.73,2:14:53.65,Eng,,0,0,0,,The key!
Dialogue: 1,2:14:54.90,2:14:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙在你那儿吧
Dialogue: 2,2:14:54.90,2:14:56.45,Eng,,0,0,0,,Tell me you have the key.
Dialogue: 1,2:14:56.45,2:14:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙在哪儿 刚才还在这儿的
Dialogue: 2,2:14:56.45,2:14:59.32,Eng,,0,0,0,,Where is the key? It was just here.
Dialogue: 1,2:15:17.88,2:15:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-列车已经失控了 -我知道
Dialogue: 2,2:15:17.88,2:15:19.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,-We're on a runaway train! -I know.
Dialogue: 1,2:15:19.47,2:15:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-我负责去追他 -好的
Dialogue: 2,2:15:19.47,2:15:21.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,-I'm going after him. -Okay.
Dialogue: 1,2:15:21.43,2:15:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 2,2:15:21.43,2:15:22.89,Eng,,0,0,0,,You…
Dialogue: 1,2:15:22.89,2:15:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-你负责让车停下 -好的 什么
Dialogue: 2,2:15:22.89,2:15:25.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,-You stop the train. -Okay. What?
Dialogue: 1,2:15:25.35,2:15:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不 等等 别走 要怎么让车停下
Dialogue: 2,2:15:25.35,2:15:28.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,No! No, wait! How do I do that?
Dialogue: 1,2:15:28.31,2:15:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你会想到办法的
Dialogue: 2,2:15:28.31,2:15:29.65,Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll figure it out!
Dialogue: 1,2:15:30.98,2:15:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 2,2:15:30.98,2:15:31.90,Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,2:15:33.07,2:15:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 有个男人 刚从这里过去
Dialogue: 2,2:15:33.07,2:15:36.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. There was a man. He just came through here.
Dialogue: 1,2:15:36.11,2:15:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,有一个男的
Dialogue: 2,2:15:36.11,2:15:37.70,Eng,,0,0,0,,There was a man.
Dialogue: 1,2:17:11.04,2:17:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,基特里奇先生
Dialogue: 2,2:17:11.04,2:17:12.37,Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kittridge?
Dialogue: 1,2:17:17.71,2:17:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 您在这里做什么
Dialogue: 2,2:17:17.71,2:17:19.34,Eng,,0,0,0,,Sir, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 1,2:17:19.34,2:17:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我不在这里
Dialogue: 2,2:17:19.34,2:17:21.38,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not here.
Dialogue: 1,2:17:21.38,2:17:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,但你们在
Dialogue: 2,2:17:21.38,2:17:22.84,Eng,,0,0,0,,But you are.
Dialogue: 1,2:17:22.84,2:17:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,如果明天上班不想被调去收发快递的话
Dialogue: 2,2:17:22.84,2:17:25.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,And unless you want to be sorting dead letters at the postal service tomorrow,
Dialogue: 1,2:17:25.55,2:17:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那么从现在开始 照我指令去做
Dialogue: 2,2:17:25.55,2:17:27.72,Eng,,0,0,0,,you'll do exactly what I tell you.
Dialogue: 1,2:19:26.17,2:19:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道钥匙能打开什么 伊森
Dialogue: 2,2:19:26.17,2:19:28.34,Eng,,0,0,0,,I know what the key unlocks, Ethan.
Dialogue: 1,2:19:31.26,2:19:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我一个人知道
Dialogue: 2,2:19:31.26,2:19:33.18,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who knows.
Dialogue: 1,2:19:59.83,2:20:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,亨特
Dialogue: 2,2:19:59.83,2:20:01.33,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hunt!
Dialogue: 1,2:20:02.34,2:20:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,亨特
Dialogue: 2,2:20:02.34,2:20:03.38,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hunt!
Dialogue: 1,2:20:04.59,2:20:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,亨特 千万别做蠢事
Dialogue: 2,2:20:04.59,2:20:07.30,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hunt! Don't you do it.
Dialogue: 1,2:20:08.84,2:20:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,把刀放下
Dialogue: 2,2:20:08.84,2:20:10.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,Drop the knife.
Dialogue: 1,2:20:10.51,2:20:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,放下刀
Dialogue: 2,2:20:10.51,2:20:11.84,Eng,,0,0,0,,Put it down.
Dialogue: 1,2:20:11.84,2:20:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我让你放下刀
Dialogue: 2,2:20:11.84,2:20:14.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,I said drop it!
Dialogue: 1,2:20:14.51,2:20:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,快放下
Dialogue: 2,2:20:14.51,2:20:16.22,Eng,,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 1,2:20:24.94,2:20:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢站起来
Dialogue: 2,2:20:24.94,2:20:26.53,Eng,,0,0,0,,On your feet!
Dialogue: 1,2:20:28.53,2:20:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 2,2:20:28.53,2:20:29.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 1,2:20:29.74,2:20:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,快把那把刀放下
Dialogue: 2,2:20:29.74,2:20:31.41,Eng,,0,0,0,,Drop that goddamn knife!
Dialogue: 1,2:20:31.41,2:20:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 2,2:20:31.41,2:20:33.20,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 1,2:20:34.58,2:20:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,快抓住他
Dialogue: 2,2:20:34.58,2:20:36.66,Eng,,0,0,0,,Just take him.
Dialogue: 1,2:20:36.66,2:20:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住他 别让他跑了 他才是你们要抓的人
Dialogue: 2,2:20:36.66,2:20:39.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,Just cover him. Cover him! He's the one you want.
Dialogue: 1,2:20:39.79,2:20:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-德加 -知道了
Dialogue: 2,2:20:39.79,2:20:41.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Degas! -I got it, I got it.
Dialogue: 1,2:20:41.75,2:20:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他才是你们要抓的人
Dialogue: 2,2:20:41.75,2:20:43.21,Eng,,0,0,0,,He's the one you want.
Dialogue: 1,2:20:43.21,2:20:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我不在乎那家伙 亨特 我要抓的是你
Dialogue: 2,2:20:43.21,2:20:45.96,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't care about him, Hunt. I want you!
Dialogue: 1,2:20:46.67,2:20:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 2,2:20:46.67,2:20:47.88,Eng,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 1,2:21:06.82,2:21:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,别激动
Dialogue: 2,2:21:06.82,2:21:07.69,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 1,2:21:08.78,2:21:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,别激动
Dialogue: 2,2:21:08.78,2:21:09.65,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 1,2:21:12.20,2:21:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说
Dialogue: 2,2:21:12.20,2:21:13.57,Eng,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 1,2:21:13.57,2:21:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们不按我说的去做
Dialogue: 2,2:21:13.57,2:21:16.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,Everyone on this train is gonna die
Dialogue: 1,2:21:16.03,2:21:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这辆列车上的所有人都会死
Dialogue: 2,2:21:16.03,2:21:18.62,Eng,,0,0,0,,unless you do exactly as I say.
Dialogue: 1,2:21:40.35,2:21:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 抱歉 请各位离开
Dialogue: 2,2:21:40.35,2:21:43.10,Eng,,0,0,0,,Mesdames, messieurs! Excusez-moi. Sortez--
Dialogue: 1,2:21:43.10,2:21:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人都离开这儿 去最后一节车厢
Dialogue: 2,2:21:43.10,2:21:45.98,Eng,,0,0,0,,Everybody out! Back of the train!
Dialogue: 1,2:21:55.53,2:21:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,格蕾丝
Dialogue: 2,2:21:55.53,2:21:56.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,Grace.
Dialogue: 1,2:21:58.62,2:21:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我没法让它停下
Dialogue: 2,2:21:58.62,2:21:59.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,I couldn't stop it.
Dialogue: 1,2:22:05.17,2:22:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,谁都没办法
Dialogue: 2,2:22:05.17,2:22:06.25,Eng,,0,0,0,,No one can.
Dialogue: 1,2:22:07.13,2:22:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 2,2:22:07.13,2:22:08.38,Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 1,2:22:08.38,2:22:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-伊森 那把钥匙 -格蕾丝 没事的
Dialogue: 2,2:22:08.38,2:22:10.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Ethan, the key! -Grace, it's okay.
Dialogue: 1,2:22:10.63,2:22:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,全都是我的错
Dialogue: 2,2:22:10.63,2:22:12.09,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 1,2:22:12.09,2:22:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,如果真出什么事…
Dialogue: 2,2:22:12.09,2:22:13.76,Eng,,0,0,0,,If anything happens--
Dialogue: 1,2:22:13.76,2:22:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我拿到了
Dialogue: 2,2:22:13.76,2:22:14.93,Eng,,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 1,2:22:15.72,2:22:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们拿到了
Dialogue: 2,2:22:15.72,2:22:17.10,Eng,,0,0,0,,We got it.
Dialogue: 1,2:22:38.32,2:22:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森
Dialogue: 2,2:22:38.32,2:22:40.41,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ethan!
Dialogue: 1,2:22:43.66,2:22:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,什么叫你把钥匙弄丢了
Dialogue: 2,2:22:43.66,2:22:46.17,Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, you lost the key?
Dialogue: 1,2:22:46.17,2:22:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,动作快 动起来 所有人都动起来
Dialogue: 2,2:22:46.17,2:22:50.46,Eng,,0,0,0,,Move it! Move it! Everybody move it!
Dialogue: 1,2:22:51.30,2:22:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,全都给我去最后一节车厢 所有人到后面去
Dialogue: 2,2:22:51.30,2:22:54.76,Eng,,0,0,0,,All the way to the back of the train! All the way to the back!
Dialogue: 1,2:22:54.76,2:22:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 怎么回事
Dialogue: 2,2:22:54.76,2:22:56.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa. What's going on?
Dialogue: 1,2:22:57.76,2:23:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,您不是说您不在这里吗 那就不劳您操心了
Dialogue: 2,2:22:57.76,2:23:01.76,Eng,,0,0,0,,Since you're not really here, sir, it shouldn't concern you.
Dialogue: 1,2:23:01.76,2:23:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人到后面去
Dialogue: 2,2:23:01.76,2:23:03.89,Eng,,0,0,0,,All the way to the back!
Dialogue: 1,2:23:54.78,2:23:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 伊森
Dialogue: 2,2:23:54.78,2:23:56.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ethan!
Dialogue: 1,2:23:57.32,2:24:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,格蕾丝
Dialogue: 2,2:23:57.32,2:24:00.32,Eng,,0,0,0,,Grace! Grace. Grace!
Dialogue: 1,2:24:46.29,2:24:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-你必须得跳过去 -什么 跳过去
Dialogue: 2,2:24:46.29,2:24:48.54,Eng,,0,0,0,,-You're gonna have to jump. -What, jump?
Dialogue: 1,2:24:48.54,2:24:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,跳就是了 快
Dialogue: 2,2:24:48.54,2:24:50.42,Eng,,0,0,0,,Just jump! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 1,2:25:37.46,2:25:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪
Dialogue: 2,2:25:37.46,2:25:38.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 1,2:25:55.40,2:25:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-我着火了 帮我灭火 -别动
Dialogue: 2,2:25:55.40,2:25:57.52,Eng,,0,0,0,,-I'm on fire! Get it off! -Don't move!
Dialogue: 1,2:25:59.23,2:26:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,火灭了
Dialogue: 2,2:25:59.23,2:26:01.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's out.
Dialogue: 1,2:26:18.55,2:26:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧了
Dialogue: 2,2:26:18.55,2:26:19.84,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 1,2:26:27.89,2:26:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑 格蕾丝
Dialogue: 2,2:26:27.89,2:26:30.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,Run, run, run! Run, Grace!
Dialogue: 1,2:26:47.37,2:26:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住
Dialogue: 2,2:26:47.37,2:26:48.20,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 1,2:26:52.70,2:26:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住你了
Dialogue: 2,2:26:52.70,2:26:55.04,Eng,,0,0,0,,I got you.
Dialogue: 1,2:26:56.46,2:26:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 别往下看
Dialogue: 2,2:26:56.46,2:26:57.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't look down.
Dialogue: 1,2:26:57.50,2:26:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 别往下看 看着我
Dialogue: 2,2:26:57.50,2:26:59.92,Eng,,0,0,0,,I said don't look down. Just look at me.
Dialogue: 1,2:26:59.92,2:27:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我一会儿跳过去 你在这儿等我
Dialogue: 2,2:26:59.92,2:27:02.38,Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, I'm gonna jump across and you're gonna wait here.
Dialogue: 1,2:27:10.01,2:27:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,格蕾丝 你别抓着我
Dialogue: 2,2:27:10.01,2:27:11.81,Eng,,0,0,0,,Grace, you have to let go.
Dialogue: 1,2:27:12.64,2:27:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,格蕾丝 别再抓着我
Dialogue: 2,2:27:12.64,2:27:13.73,Eng,,0,0,0,,You gotta let me go.
Dialogue: 1,2:27:13.73,2:27:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须跳过去 否则我们死定了
Dialogue: 2,2:27:13.73,2:27:15.85,Eng,,0,0,0,,You gotta let me jump across or we're gonna die.
Dialogue: 1,2:27:15.85,2:27:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你相信我吗
Dialogue: 2,2:27:15.85,2:27:17.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you trust me?
Dialogue: 1,2:27:17.35,2:27:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你愿意相信我吗 你必须相信我
Dialogue: 2,2:27:17.35,2:27:19.40,Eng,,0,0,0,,You gonna trust me or not? You've got to trust me.
Dialogue: 1,2:27:23.78,2:27:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 2,2:27:23.78,2:27:24.61,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,2:27:26.15,2:27:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,过来 格蕾丝
Dialogue: 2,2:27:26.15,2:27:27.20,Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, Grace.
Dialogue: 1,2:27:27.20,2:27:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,把手给我 跳过来 别往上看 看着我
Dialogue: 2,2:27:27.20,2:27:29.57,Eng,,0,0,0,,Give me your hand. You got to jump. Don't look up! Look at me.
Dialogue: 1,2:27:29.57,2:27:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 我不会让你掉下去的
Dialogue: 2,2:27:29.57,2:27:31.37,Eng,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I won't let you fall.
Dialogue: 1,2:27:31.37,2:27:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证 就快成功了 快跳 我不会让你掉下去的
Dialogue: 2,2:27:31.37,2:27:35.12,Eng,,0,0,0,,I promise. We're almost there. Come on. I won't let you fall!
Dialogue: 1,2:27:35.12,2:27:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,快跳 格蕾丝 快跳
Dialogue: 2,2:27:35.12,2:27:36.46,Eng,,0,0,0,,Jump, Grace, jump!
Dialogue: 1,2:27:36.46,2:27:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 快跳啊
Dialogue: 2,2:27:36.46,2:27:38.21,Eng,,0,0,0,,You got to trust me! Jump, please!
Dialogue: 1,2:27:48.51,2:27:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,别往下看
Dialogue: 2,2:27:48.51,2:27:49.68,Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't look down.
Dialogue: 1,2:28:03.57,2:28:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,格蕾丝听好了 你要和我一起用力
Dialogue: 2,2:28:03.57,2:28:05.69,Eng,,0,0,0,,Listen to me very carefully. We're gonna pull you up together.
Dialogue: 1,2:28:08.95,2:28:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,格蕾丝
Dialogue: 2,2:28:08.95,2:28:09.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,Grace!
Dialogue: 1,2:28:14.29,2:28:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 2,2:28:14.29,2:28:16.70,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's okay. It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 1,2:28:38.56,2:28:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,爬上来 快
Dialogue: 2,2:28:38.56,2:28:40.81,Eng,,0,0,0,,Go over me. Go, go.
Dialogue: 1,2:29:08.42,2:29:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-谢谢你 卢瑟 -那是什么
Dialogue: 2,2:29:08.42,2:29:11.18,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Thank you, Luther. -What is that?
Dialogue: 1,2:29:11.18,2:29:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是滑翔伞
Dialogue: 2,2:29:11.18,2:29:12.72,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a speed wing.
Dialogue: 1,2:29:12.72,2:29:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以用它离开这里
Dialogue: 2,2:29:12.72,2:29:14.60,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's our ticket off this train.
Dialogue: 1,2:29:35.03,2:29:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森
Dialogue: 2,2:29:35.03,2:29:37.37,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ethan. Ethan!
Dialogue: 1,2:29:45.04,2:29:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是真的
Dialogue: 2,2:29:45.04,2:29:46.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 1,2:29:47.58,2:29:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他对我说
Dialogue: 2,2:29:47.58,2:29:49.46,Eng,,0,0,0,,He told me…
Dialogue: 1,2:29:50.04,2:29:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我会背叛他 真是这样
Dialogue: 2,2:29:50.04,2:29:52.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,…I would betray him.
Dialogue: 1,2:30:01.01,2:30:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么…
Dialogue: 2,2:30:01.01,2:30:03.94,Eng,,0,0,0,,Why…
Dialogue: 1,2:30:03.94,2:30:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要饶我一命
Dialogue: 2,2:30:03.94,2:30:06.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,did you spare my life?
Dialogue: 1,2:30:17.03,2:30:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不 坚持住
Dialogue: 2,2:30:17.03,2:30:18.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no… stay with me.
Dialogue: 1,2:30:22.41,2:30:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,知道这是什么吗
Dialogue: 2,2:30:22.41,2:30:23.54,Eng,,0,0,0,,You know what this is?
Dialogue: 1,2:30:25.33,2:30:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,知道这是什么吗
Dialogue: 2,2:30:25.33,2:30:26.46,Eng,,0,0,0,,You know what this is?
Dialogue: 1,2:30:29.33,2:30:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,它是用来开什么的
Dialogue: 2,2:30:29.33,2:30:31.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,What does it unlock?
Dialogue: 1,2:30:34.50,2:30:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,它是用来开什么的
Dialogue: 2,2:30:34.50,2:30:36.68,Eng,,0,0,0,,What does it unlock?
Dialogue: 1,2:30:37.93,2:30:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,塞瓦斯托波尔
Dialogue: 2,2:30:37.93,2:30:40.85,Eng,,0,0,0,,Sevas… topol.
Dialogue: 1,2:30:42.18,2:30:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,塞瓦斯托波尔
Dialogue: 2,2:30:42.18,2:30:43.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,Sevastopol?
Dialogue: 1,2:30:43.56,2:30:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是座城市 克里米亚半岛的塞瓦斯托波尔
Dialogue: 2,2:30:43.56,2:30:47.65,Eng,,0,0,0,,The city Sevastopol in the Crimea.
Dialogue: 1,2:30:48.19,2:30:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,具体在哪儿
Dialogue: 2,2:30:48.19,2:30:49.32,Eng,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 1,2:30:50.10,2:30:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,在塞瓦斯托波尔的哪里
Dialogue: 2,2:30:50.10,2:30:52.24,Eng,,0,0,0,,Where in Sevastopol?
Dialogue: 1,2:30:54.90,2:30:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,潜艇
Dialogue: 2,2:30:54.90,2:30:57.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,Sous…-marin.
Dialogue: 1,2:31:04.58,2:31:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是潜艇
Dialogue: 2,2:31:04.58,2:31:06.12,Eng,,0,0,0,,The submarine.
Dialogue: 1,2:31:08.75,2:31:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,塞瓦斯托波尔号
Dialogue: 2,2:31:08.75,2:31:10.34,Eng,,0,0,0,,The Sevastopol.
Dialogue: 1,2:31:15.05,2:31:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你好运
Dialogue: 2,2:31:15.05,2:31:17.22,Eng,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 1,2:31:21.35,2:31:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他们快来了 伊森
Dialogue: 2,2:31:21.35,2:31:22.97,Eng,,0,0,0,,They'll be coming, Ethan.
Dialogue: 1,2:31:27.02,2:31:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 2,2:31:27.02,2:31:28.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,Merci.
Dialogue: 1,2:31:44.87,2:31:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 2,2:31:44.87,2:31:46.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 1,2:31:48.25,2:31:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,说啊
Dialogue: 2,2:31:48.25,2:31:49.25,Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,2:31:50.71,2:31:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,伞只能一个人用
Dialogue: 2,2:31:50.71,2:31:52.38,Eng,,0,0,0,,It can only carry one.
Dialogue: 1,2:31:55.47,2:31:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白
Dialogue: 2,2:31:55.47,2:31:56.84,Eng,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 1,2:31:58.01,2:32:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-格蕾丝 -伊森 没关系
Dialogue: 2,2:31:58.01,2:32:00.26,Eng,,0,0,0,,-Grace. -Ethan, it's okay.
Dialogue: 1,2:32:01.93,2:32:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,计划本就如此
Dialogue: 2,2:32:01.93,2:32:03.14,Eng,,0,0,0,,This was the plan.
Dialogue: 1,2:32:04.02,2:32:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你拿到了钥匙 得赶紧走
Dialogue: 2,2:32:04.02,2:32:06.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,You have the key. You have to go.
Dialogue: 1,2:32:07.94,2:32:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,格蕾丝
Dialogue: 2,2:32:07.94,2:32:08.77,Eng,,0,0,0,,Grace.
Dialogue: 1,2:32:12.65,2:32:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,亨特
Dialogue: 2,2:32:12.65,2:32:13.94,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hunt?
Dialogue: 1,2:32:13.94,2:32:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 2,2:32:13.94,2:32:16.49,Eng,,0,0,0,,Go. Go!
Dialogue: 1,2:32:17.28,2:32:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不 别跑 亨特
Dialogue: 2,2:32:17.28,2:32:18.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no! Hunt!
Dialogue: 1,2:32:20.91,2:32:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,快让开
Dialogue: 2,2:32:20.91,2:32:22.33,Eng,,0,0,0,,Out of the way! Out of the way!
Dialogue: 1,2:32:38.26,2:32:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不 嘿
Dialogue: 2,2:32:38.26,2:32:39.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,No. No, hey.
Dialogue: 1,2:32:40.64,2:32:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,还有脉搏
Dialogue: 2,2:32:40.64,2:32:41.80,Eng,,0,0,0,,Got a pulse.
Dialogue: 1,2:32:41.80,2:32:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,醒醒 别睡过去
Dialogue: 2,2:32:41.80,2:32:43.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, stay with me.
Dialogue: 1,2:33:00.66,2:33:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这样不更好吗
Dialogue: 2,2:33:00.66,2:33:02.32,Eng,,0,0,0,,This is better, isn't it?
Dialogue: 1,2:33:03.49,2:33:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,用真实的脸孔 面对面
Dialogue: 2,2:33:03.49,2:33:05.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,Face to authentic face?
Dialogue: 1,2:33:05.87,2:33:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,基特里奇先生
Dialogue: 2,2:33:05.87,2:33:07.25,Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kittridge.
Dialogue: 1,2:33:08.16,2:33:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森亨特跟我说您是值得信赖的人
Dialogue: 2,2:33:08.16,2:33:11.33,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ethan Hunt tells me you're a man I can trust.
Dialogue: 1,2:33:12.29,2:33:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他这么说的吗
Dialogue: 2,2:33:12.29,2:33:13.84,Eng,,0,0,0,,Does he now?
Dialogue: 1,2:33:13.84,2:33:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他还说 您会给我一个选择
Dialogue: 2,2:33:13.84,2:33:17.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,He also said you would offer me a choice.
Dialogue: 1,2:33:19.22,2:33:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,有意思
Dialogue: 2,2:33:19.22,2:33:20.84,Eng,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 1,2:33:21.68,2:33:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,而我选择接受
Dialogue: 2,2:33:21.68,2:33:23.89,Eng,,0,0,0,,I choose to accept.
Dialogue: 1,2:33:29.93,2:33:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们终将无法逃避过去
Dialogue: 2,2:33:29.93,2:33:32.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,We cannot escape the past.
Dialogue: 1,2:33:33.52,2:33:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,有的人注定会重蹈覆辙
Dialogue: 2,2:33:33.52,2:33:36.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,Some of us are doomed to repeat it.
Dialogue: 1,2:33:36.77,2:33:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,格蕾丝或许觉得你救了她 改写了她的命运
Dialogue: 2,2:33:36.77,2:33:40.45,Eng,,0,0,0,,Grace may believe you've saved her from her fate,
Dialogue: 1,2:33:40.45,2:33:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但你我都知道 你只是为她多争取了点时间而已
Dialogue: 2,2:33:40.45,2:33:43.70,Eng,,0,0,0,,but you and I both know you've merely bought her time.
Dialogue: 1,2:33:44.95,2:33:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但一直以来不都是这样吗
Dialogue: 2,2:33:44.95,2:33:47.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,But that's the pattern, isn't it?
Dialogue: 1,2:33:47.79,2:33:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,肩膀上总有放不下的重担
Dialogue: 2,2:33:47.79,2:33:50.08,Eng,,0,0,0,,The cross you've been left to bear.
Dialogue: 1,2:33:51.16,2:33:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,越是和你亲近的人
Dialogue: 2,2:33:51.16,2:33:53.42,Eng,,0,0,0,,The closer someone gets to you,
Dialogue: 1,2:33:54.54,2:33:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,就越难保全他们的性命
Dialogue: 2,2:33:54.54,2:33:56.46,Eng,,0,0,0,,the harder it is to keep them alive.
Dialogue: 1,2:33:58.96,2:34:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,谢天谢地
Dialogue: 2,2:33:58.96,2:34:00.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank God.
Dialogue: 1,2:34:16.11,2:34:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,新的一天会迎来新的责任
Dialogue: 2,2:34:16.11,2:34:18.48,Eng,,0,0,0,,A new day brings a new burden.
Dialogue: 1,2:34:20.36,2:34:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙 只是一切的开始
Dialogue: 2,2:34:20.36,2:34:23.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,The key is only the beginning.
Dialogue: 1,2:34:25.57,2:34:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,无论它把你带向何方
Dialogue: 2,2:34:25.57,2:34:27.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,Wherever it leads,
Dialogue: 1,2:34:27.91,2:34:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,无论一路的代价是什么
Dialogue: 2,2:34:27.91,2:34:30.04,Eng,,0,0,0,,whatever it takes to get there,
Dialogue: 1,2:34:31.58,2:34:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你都只能独自去面对
Dialogue: 2,2:34:31.58,2:34:34.29,Eng,,0,0,0,,you'll have to do it on your own.
Dialogue: 1,2:34:36.54,2:34:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,倘若这次行动失败 那么智体将获胜
Dialogue: 2,2:34:36.54,2:34:40.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,Should you fail in your mission, the Entity wins,
Dialogue: 1,2:34:40.67,2:34:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,盖布瑞尔也将获胜
Dialogue: 2,2:34:40.67,2:34:42.92,Eng,,0,0,0,,Gabriel wins,
Dialogue: 1,2:34:42.92,2:34:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,而这个世界将会付出终极的代价
Dialogue: 2,2:34:42.92,2:34:45.76,Eng,,0,0,0,,and the world will pay the ultimate price.
Dialogue: 1,2:34:46.80,2:34:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你团队中的任何人如果被捕或者被杀害
Dialogue: 2,2:34:46.80,2:34:50.56,Eng,,0,0,0,,Should any members of your team be caught or killed,
Dialogue: 1,2:34:50.56,2:34:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的牺牲都将白费
Dialogue: 2,2:34:50.56,2:34:53.60,Eng,,0,0,0,,their sacrifice will have been in vain.
Dialogue: 1,2:34:54.31,2:34:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧行动吧
Dialogue: 2,2:34:54.31,2:34:55.77,Eng,,0,0,0,,So hurry.
Dialogue: 1,2:34:56.40,2:34:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,时间不多了
Dialogue: 2,2:34:56.40,2:34:58.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,There isn't much time.
Dialogue: 1,2:34:59.07,2:35:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然这个世界并不知情 但它的命运就靠你了
Dialogue: 2,2:34:59.07,2:35:03.82,Eng,,0,0,0,,The world doesn't know it, but they're counting on you.
Dialogue: 1,2:35:24.67,2:35:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你好运 伊森
Dialogue: 2,2:35:24.67,2:35:25.90,Eng,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Ethan.
